<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Etulo</book>
  <para style="h">iLuku</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esɔ Osuse mi abɔ mgbi iLuku</para>
  <para style="toc2">iLuku</para>
  <para style="toc3">iLuk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Esɔ Osuse mi abɔ mgbi</para>
  <para style="mt1">iLuku</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Dafi inggisɛ kwuba fya olɔ ungwɔ nkiyayi mi idzidzɛ mgbi eyi nɛ, <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>ungwɔ olɔɔlɔ nɛ ba mbi eyi mi abɔ mgbi ama ndi inɛ-inɛ di li engbidɔ, ama nkye ewoma fifɛ mi elodzɛ na mani. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Nghanɛ, iTiofyilɔ otsungwudɛ,<figure style="fig" alt="ITiofyilɔ otsungwudɛ" file="lb00263c.tif" size="col" loc="1;3" copy="Ib00263c" ref="1:3">Dear Theophilus</figure> dafi ani abuani kya mi odzɛ nɛ saan mi owita-wita nɛ, n di gbɛɛ i tishi nin lɔn imbisɔn-mbisɔn mi ikye abu, <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>zukwu ni abu difwi otsitsi mgbi ungwɔ ngwi a tso abu nani.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A teyi gbɔ ombaamba mgbi iJɔn <optbreak/> okyɔ iBatisima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mi onɔ ngwi iHerude li utɔ mgbi iJudia mani, inggisɛ ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho oka iyin gbɛɛ iDzakaria, mi ayɛ inggisɛ ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho mgbi Abyija nani; owan Elidzabeti kpaa li mi etɔ mgbi Eron (ongwu kpaa li etɔ mgbi inggisɛ ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho). <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Ama efa duu le nyaan mi inɛ Imgbasho, a ngyo ola di gbela yi odzɛ owɛ-wɛ mgbi Otsɛ Imgbasho, a sulu idza ewo ba du. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Nghaduu a dzɛ yi ongwɛ ba, ikyesinɛ Elidzabeti li ogyoma; ama duu egbe mgbi ama kɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Egbe oka nɛ, iDzakaria dzɛ ondidɔ mgban mgbi inggisɛ ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin mi onɔ ngwi idɔ dikyon. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>A sadun mi efa ogboogbo, dafi nli ola mgbi ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho mani, gbɛɛ no kaka <char style="k">ozu idzidzɛ </char> mgbi Imgbasho mi imbe iwashi okye ungwɔ ogbungbɛ toola. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Onɔ ngwi iDzakaria kye ungwɔ ogbungbɛ na le toola nɛ, ibyi inggisɛ ama osunu Imgbasho kwutokɛ esɛ le bibɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Man ongyesɔ mgbi Otsɛ Imgbasho mblegba tun, o kwudzɛkɛ abugye mgbi iwashi okye ungwɔ ogbungbɛ toola. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Ngwi iDzakaria di ongyesɔ nɛ, i kakan ewo, imio di won. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Ongyesɔ nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka mio ba, iDzakaria; Imgbasho fwo ibɔ mgbi abu. Owaabu Elidzabeti ka mba abu ongwongyulɔ, o ka kwun iyi di iJɔn. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Abu ka dzɛ yi atsa diyɛ shisha. Ibyi inggisɛ angbeka ka tsatsa mi ombaamba mgbi ongwɛ nani. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Ongwɛ na ka li angbodzi inggisɛ mi inɛ mgbi Otsɛ Imgbasho, o ka wa ɛbyɛ hona ungwɔ ofyumfye ba, o ka mbwo yi Onodzi Osaan wita mi onɔ ngwi onɔn byifun mani. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>O ka kyata emi Israi kwuba, yile ma luba mbi Otsɛ Imgbasho mgbi ama. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Ongwɛ na ka dzɛ Otsɛ Imgbasho iyayi, o ka dzɛ dafi Elaija mi Onodzi bɛyi mfye, okyatitukwu mgbi etsɛngwɛ yɛ luba mbi engwɛ, ama onghaadɔ yɛ luba ozoyeye mgbi ama osaan, adzi ni ongwu kye mɛlu inggisɛ mgbi Otsɛ tokɛ le fan fɛɛfɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>IDzakaria byi ongyesɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li mi ali ofɛ ngwi ani ka ye gbɛɛ ungwɔnɛ ka wa dzɛ ngha? Bana ani kyɛ, owaani kpaa kyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Ongyesɔ nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ani iGebre, ani kwudzɛ mi inɛ Imgbasho, ongwu ndɔ ani esɔ gbɛɛ ni ani gbɔ nya abu di kye elodzɛ osuse nɛ ba mbi abu mani. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Dafi abu noyɛyɛ mi ungwɔ nka wa kyɔ mi onɔ mgban ba nɛ, o ka yɛɛ ikplima di yagba ogbɔdzɛ wuba, nghataa egbe ngwi owa abu ka wa fwise mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Nghanɛ, ama ntole fɛ iDzakaria mi esɛ ma i kwulu ma ewo dafi o mbe onɔ kwuba mi ifoozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin ngha mani. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Ngwi o wa tɔ luba esɛ ma, o yagba gbɔdzɛ yi ama wuba, man a difwi gbɛɛ o di ungwɔ mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin, o yɛ le gbɔdzɛ yi ama mi abɔ ta o si yɛɛ ikplima.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Ngwi onɔ idɔ mgban mi ozu Imgbasho wa ngyɛ nɛman, o yɛ lu udan. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Onɔ wa nyɛ gwee nɛta, owan Elidzabeti si tiludɛ, o kye ewon da ofyia eda. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li Otsɛ Imgbasho kyungwɔnɛ yi ani, mi olɛlɛ nɛ o nu ikyese dɔ ani di kyelu ayiwi mgbi ani mi inɛ inggisɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A teyi gbɔ ombaamba mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Ngwi ifu mgbi Elidzabeti wa li ofyia egyin mata, Imgbasho dɔ ongyesɔ iGebre kɛ ogalu iNadzareti, mi ayɛsɛ mgbi iGalalia, <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>mbi ibidrua ongyaa ngwu a li kwun gbɛɛ iMeri, ngwu inggisɛ oka mi etɔ mgbi iDevedi. Ongwu a li kwun di iJose, tsikwɔn dzɛ esɛ nani. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Ongyesɔ na ba mbon, o tan angba di nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu ngwu ikyese dɔ abu kpakpa nɛ! Otsɛ Imgbasho dzɛ yi abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Itukwu gbo-gbo lo iMeri kwuba mi elodzɛ mgbi ongyesɔ nɛni, i di kwulun ewo mi itɔ angba na dafi ka dzɛ mani. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Ongyesɔ iGebre nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka mio ba, iMeri, bana ikyese dɔ abu mbi Otsɛ Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Abu ka wa byifu di mba ongwongyulɔ, o ka kwun iyi gbɛɛ iYesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>O ka li angbodzi inggisɛ a dika kwun gbɛɛ Ongwɛ mgbi Ongwu Nghaangha mi esho. Otsɛ Imgbasho dika kye itsuutɔ mgbi otsɔn iDevedi kye nun. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>O ka li Utɔ mi etɔ mgbi iJeko gyegwu, esutɔ mgban ka dondu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>IMeri byi ongyesɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɔnɛ ka dzɛ ngha sinɛ? Ngwi ani ye ongyulɔ waba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Ongyesɔ nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onodzi Osaan ka kyi gbɛlu abu sɔ, mfye mgbi Ongwu Nnghaangha mi esho dika gbiiwulu tukwu abu. Nɛ Ongwɛ Osaan ngwu abu ka wa mba na, a ka kwun gbɛɛ Ongwɛ Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Elidzabeti, odo abu ngwu a tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ o li ogyoma nani, o dzɛ yi ewefa ofyia egyin waani. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Lubana ungwɔ ngwi Imgbasho ka kyɔ gbɛ ba dzɛma ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>IMeri gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li ongwongyiidɔ mgbi Otsɛ Imgbasho, no kyɔ yi ani dafi abu gbɔ nɛni.&gt;&gt; Man ongyesɔ na lu dzatan.<figure style="fig" alt="Ongyesɔ iGebre gbɔdzɛ yi iMeri" file="DN00401b.tif" size="col" loc="1;38" copy="Dunhan" ref="1:38">Angel Gabriel visits Mary</figure><verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IMeri ka kpadi Elidzabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Mi onɔ na iMeri wewo di yewo lu ogalu mi ewunggwɔ mi ɛsɛ iJudia. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>O ka kaka udɛ iDzakaria, man o ta Elidzabeti angba. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Ngwi Elidzabeti fwo angba mgbi iMeri nɛ, ongwɛ gbokyɛɛ lon mi ifu. Ta Elidzabeti si mbwo yi Onodzi Osaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>O gbɔ mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mse dzɛ yi abu mi idzidzɛ engyaa duu yi ongwɛ ngwu abu ka mba nani. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ikyese dɛn ngha, ngwi onɔ Otsɛ mgbi ani ba mbi ani? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Bana ngwi ani fwo angba mgbi abu mata, ongwɛ gbokyɛɛ len mi ifu yi atsa. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Mse no dzɛ yi abu ngwu noyɛyɛ gbɛɛ, odzɛ ngwi Otsɛ Imgbasho gbɔ yi abu ka wa dondu yɛyɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IMeri tsɛ Imgbasho yi ashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>IMeri gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;Itukwu mgbi ani tsɛ Otsɛ Imgbasho<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>oshishe mgbɛn dzɛ yi atsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47">mi ikye Imgbasho Onagbɛ ani,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>lubana o wɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">ani nli unka ba, ongwongyiidɔ mgban.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Wita mi onɛnɛ lu iyayi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">etɔ duu kale kwu ani gbɛɛ ogbumse,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>bana Imgbasho odatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">kyungwɔ okwukwo mi ikye ani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Osaan li iyi mgban.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Elela odiidi mgban li na kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">mbi ama nli sunun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">mi etɔ nghataa kɛ etɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>O kyungwɔ ama odatu mi abɔ mgban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">o kye ganya ama okyile ewo esho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">mi ɛwɛ otsɛɛtsɛ mgbi ama.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>O tashulu ama nsɔ utɔ mi itse mgbi ama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">kpaa o kyile ama oyile ewo esɛ esho.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Ama ngwu enbwa dɔ ma ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">o mbwo ma yi ungwɔ osuse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">kpaa emi awuya yɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">o wo ma ofɛ abubɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>O tobyi ongwongbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">mgban Israi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">mi ondu odzɛɛdzɛ mgban yi emi otseyi<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>mbi Abrahan bɛyi engwiba mgban gyegwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>IMeri la mbi Elidzabeti mɛ dafi ofyia eta man yɛ lu udɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ombaamba mgbi <optbreak/> iJɔn okyɔ iBatisima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Ngwi onɔ imba mgbi Elidzabeti wa gyɔ nɛta, o mba ongwongyulɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Emi ongwunɔn bɛyi ama owatse dɔn fwo gbɛɛ Otsɛ Imgbasho tso elela odiidi kpakpa mbon nɛ, a tsatsa yan.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Ongwɛ wa mbwo egbe egyata nɛ, a ba owa kyan ikyɛ, ma dzɛ mbisɔ ngwi a ka yile iyi otsɔn kyɔn gbɛɛ, iDzakaria. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Nghaduu onɔn nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ei! Dzɛ mbisɔ ngwi a ka kwun di iJɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>A nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ onyi mi etɔ mgbi abu dzɛ yi iyi na ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>A gbɔdzɛ yi iDzakaria mi abɔ gbɛɛ nu ma ye iyi ngwi o mina okyɔ ongwɛ na mani. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>O kyɔ ambɛ gbɛɛ nu ma nun ongwɛ akwukwɔ olɔ ungwɔ, o si lɔ iyin gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IJɔn.&gt;&gt; Ta i kwulu ali inggisɛ duu ewo. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Labɔlabɔ nɛman ondu mgbi iDzakaria kwulu ta itiidɛ shɛ lon o di wita gbɔdzɛ, le tsɛ Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Ama nwatse dɔn duu i kwulu ma ewo, inggisɛ ama nto ɛsɛ undɔ mgbi iJudia duu le gbɔdzɛ ungwɔ okwulewo ntonɛni. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Ali inggisɛ nfwo odzɛ nɛ le tsɛwɛ mi ele, le byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ali itɔ inggisɛ ngwi ongwɛ nɛ ka wa dzɛ?&gt;&gt; Bana mfye mgbi Imgbasho dzɛyan.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ashi mgbi iDzakaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Ta otsɔn iDzakaria mbwo yi Onodzi Osaan man o wita ogbɔdzɛ mi ela oyegbɔ gbɛɛ:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>&lt;&lt;Nu ma tsɛ Otsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Imgbasho mgbi emi Israi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">lubana o ba wa tobyi emidan di nagbɛ ma.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>O kye otlɛsɛ mgbi owatɔ-watɔ tuo ikye eyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">mi etɔ mgbi ongwongbɛ mgban iDevedi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Dafi o gbɔ nyɛ mbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">oyegbɔ osaan emi tugbe<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>gbɛɛ ongwu ka dulu eyi tɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">mi abɔ engyikyili mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">bɛyi mi abɔ mgbi ama ngwu di eyi lanyi<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>ikye otso elela odiidi mbi emi otseyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">diyɛ wɛ ondu odzɛɛdzɛ mgban osaan,<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>ofaafa ngwi o fa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73">yi otseyi Abrahan:<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>odulu eyi tɔ mi abɔ engyikyili mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">ikye onu eyi sunun yi imio ba<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>mi osaan bɛyi osaan mi iyayi mgban,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">mi egbe oshishe mgbi eyi duu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Abu ongwani, a ka kwu abu gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">oyegbɔ mgbi Ongwu Nnghaangha mi esho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">lubana abu ka teyi Otsɛ ikye omɛlun ofɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Onu emidan difwi odzɛ mgbi owatɔ-watɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">mi odzita ma yi ali ibwubwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Mi ikye elela odiidi oleewo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">mgbi Imgbasho mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">ikyegbɛɛ ni osa dafi onɔ mi esho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">gbosa ba esɛ mbi eyi<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>azukwu no wa nu osa mbi ama nwoto iyifu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">bɛyi iwulu ikwongye duu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ongyo eyi afɔ byi ofɛ iyu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Nɛ ongwɛ na she di yɛɛ kpɔklɔɔ mi onodzi, o la okwɛsɛ nghataa se o wa kye ewon tso emi Israi mi ododa.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ombaamba mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Mi onɔ na iSidza (utɔ) Ogɔstu, utɔ mgbi emi iRoma noola gbɛɛ nu ma lɔ mmbwo inggisɛ mi ɛsɛ iRoma tsatsadu. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Nɛnɛ li mmbwo olɔɔlɔ ongwi ababɔ mi onɔ ngwi iKwirinu li iGɔna odi mi ɛsɛ iSiria mani. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Ali inggisɛ lu oka lɔ mmbwo mi ɛsɛ udan.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>IJose kyato mi igeli iNadzareti mi ayɛsɛ iGalalia, lu iBɛtlɛhɛn ogalu mgbi iDevedi mi ayɛsɛ iJudia, ikyekyɛ o tɔ mi etɔ mgbi iDevedi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>O kɛ oka lɔ mmbwo na yi iMeri, ongwu o tsikwɔn dzɛ esɛ dzɛ yi ifewo nani. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Ngwi a ka to iBɛtlɛhɛn nɛta imba kwun, <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>o si mbongwɛ mgban ovlɛ, ongwongyulɔ. O kye oshata ndiwon kyon lakɛ ikpɔkɔ, lubana a tu imbe mi ozu ingyoga ba.<figure style="fig" alt="iYesu ladzɛ ikpɔkɔ" file="CN01640b.tif" size="col" loc="2;7" copy="Cook note" ref="2:7">Jesus in the manger</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ama ongyo ifyungwɔ yi engyesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ama ongyo ifyungwɔ angbeka to agya ɛsɛ nani, a lato oshɛ tole ngyo ifyungwɔ mgbi ama mi otu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Ongyesɔ mgbi Otsɛ Imgbasho wa mblegba tu ma, ta okwɔkwɔ mgbi Otsɛ gbosa kpakɛkɛ wo ma, nɛ imio wo ma kpakpa. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Kpaa ongyesɔ nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka mio ba na, ikyena ani ba yi ema Esɔ Osuse mgbi atsa ngwi shewo nka dzɛ ikye ali inggisɛ duu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Inɛ nɛ mi ogalu mgbi iDevedi a mba ema ongye Onagbɛ, o li iKrestu Otsɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ongwu Otsɛ Imgbasho zondu gbɛɛ o ka wa dulu ɛsɛ tɔ mani.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Ungwɔ nka li ambɛ mbi ema yɔ, ema ka di ongwɛ eyeyi a kyon ndi wodzɛ oshata ladzɛ ikpɔkɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Plɛ nɛta ibyi engyesɔ emi esho ba wa tu ongyesɔ nani, le tsɛ Imgbasho dile gbɛɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>&lt;&lt;Okwɔkwɔ no dzɛ yi Imgbasho ngwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">Ngha mi esho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">mi ɛsɛ nɛ iyu no dzɛ yi ama ngwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">ikyese mgban dɔ ma mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Onɔ ngwi engyesɔ dzamata yɛ lu esho mata, ama ongyo ifyungwɔ gbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba i kɛ iBɛtlɛhɛn ni i ka di ungwɔ nkyɔ se ngwi Otsɛ Imgbasho nya eyi odzɛ ele nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>A byakpa lu maama si ka dili iJose yi iMeri bɛyi ongwɛ eyeyi na ladzɛ ikpɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Mi onɔ ngwi ama ongyo ifyungwɔ ntona di ongwɛ mata, a le gbɔdzɛ ngwi ongyesɔ nya ma mi ikpewo ongwɛ nɛni. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Ama nfwo odzɛ nɛ duu i kwulu ma ewo mi odzɛ ngwi ama ongyo ifyungwɔ gbɔ mi ikpewo ongwɛ nɛni. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Nghaduu iMeri kwulu ungwɔ ntonɛ duu wokɛ itukwu diyɛ le tsɛwɛ mi ele. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Ama ongyo ifyungwɔ ntona yidɔ lu, le kyile iyi Imgbasho deesho dile tsan mi alungwɔ ngwi ama fwo diyɛ di, ngwi kyɔ yɛyɛ dafi a plɛ nya ama mani.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A kye iYesu dubɔ Imgbasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>A mban nyɛ egbe egyata, ngwi li egbe a ka kyan ikyɛ nɛman, a si kwun iyi gbɛɛ, iYesu, iyi ngwi ongyesɔ teyi nu duuse a wa byifun mani.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Ngwi egbe ogbiiyɛ mgbi ama wa gyɔ dafi ola mgbi iMose gbɔ ma nɛ, iJose yi iMeri kye iYesu kɛ iJerosalin oka kyon dubɔ Otsɛ Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>(Dafi a lɔ mi ola mgbi Otsɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ali ongwongyulɔ ovlɛ ngwu a mba duu nu ma kye dubɔ Otsɛ Imgbasho&gt;&gt;), <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>odi fifɛ dafi ola mgbi Imgbasho gbɔ mani: &lt;&lt;Anyama nghi efa, hona ibidrua ingyakpa efa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Mi onɔ na inggisɛ oka dzɛ iJerosalin a kwun di iSimiɔn, o le saan di gbekabyi idɔ mgbi Imgbasho. Ongwu nose le fɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi, Onodzi Osaan nose dzɛyan. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Onodzi Osaan teyi kye tson gbɛɛ o ka di ikwongye inɛ waba, imbisɔ ngwi o ka di iKrestu Otsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Onodzi kye iSimiɔn teyi ka kaka ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin. Mi onɔ na iJose yi iMeri kye ongwɛ iYesu ba owa kyɔ yan dafi aletɔ mgbi ola mgbi ama mina mani. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>ISimiɔn si kye gbɛlu ongwɛ na byikɛ abɔ mgban le tsɛ Imgbasho gbɛɛ:<figure style="fig" alt="A kye iYesu ka dubɔ Imgbasho mi iTɛmpɛ" file="WA03805b.tif" size="col" loc="2;28" ref="2:28">Jesus is presented in the Temple</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>&lt;&lt;Otsɛ onghaangha, dafi abu mbwo ondu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">odzɛɛdzɛ mgbi abu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">dzata ongbidɔ mgbi abu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">onɛnɛ no lu mi iyu.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Lubana inɛ mgbɛn di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:30">owatɔ-watɔ mgbi abu,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>ngwi abu kye mɛlu dzɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:31">mi inɛ inggisɛ duu.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Li osa nka dzɛ mbi emi agwɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">odi kye okwɔkwɔ ba mbi emidabu Israi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>I kwulu iJose yi iMeri ewo mi elodzɛ ngwi iSimiɔn gbɔ mi ikpewo ongwɛ ma nɛni. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>ISimiɔn kye mse bɛ ma ewo diyɛ nya iMeri gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwɛ nɛ, Imgbasho kyon dzɛ ikye odzili-dzili bɛyi owatɔ-watɔ mgbi ibyi inggisɛ mi Israi. O dika li ambɛ ngwi inggisɛ kwuba ka fwan. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Ikye ni ewodzɛ mgbi inggisɛ ibyibyi wa dɔ ododa. Ta okwusunkli ka suwo abu itukwu kpaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Oyegbɔ oka kpaa nose dzɛ, ongyaa ngwu a li kwun di Anna, ongwɛ iFanue, mi agwɔ mgbi Ashɛ. O kyɛ kpakpa; o dzɛ yi oban mɛ onova egyafa ta oban si kwulu dzanta. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>O yɛɛ owakwadɛ mɛ onova ngwusenɛ dɔn enɛ. O dzata ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin ba, kpaa o li sunu Imgbasho onɔ yi otu mi ondu otukwu-tukwu yi ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Mi obyi na yɛyɛ o kaka si ta Imgbasho angba dile gbɔdzɛ mgbi ongwɛ na nya ama ntole fɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi iJerosalin duu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Onɔ ngwi iJose yi iMeri ngyɛlu alungwɔ ngwi ola mgbi Otsɛ mina ma, a yɛ luba ogalu mgbi ama iNadzareti mi ayɛsɛ iGalalia. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Ongwɛ na she diyɛ fyumfye; o mbwo yi ozoyeye, ikyese mgbi Imgbasho dzɛyan.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Ali onova ama omba iYesu li kɛ iJerosalin ikye oka kyɔ oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Mi onɔ ngwi iYesu li onova iwyodefa ma, o si kɛ oga nɛ yi ama omban, dafi li aletɔ mgbi ama mani. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Egbe ngwi oga wa ngyɛ nɛ a yɛ le lu udɛ, ta ongwɛ iYesu tila mi iyikpa mi iJerosalin, kpaa ama omban ye ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>IJose yi iMeri tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ di iYesu kyɛ yi ama mi idzidzɛ ibyi inggisɛ, nghanɛ a kyikyɛ mi egbe olɔlɔ. Man a wita opitan mbi odo ma bɛyi oka ma. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Dafi a din ba nɛ, a yidɔ lu iJerosalin le ka pitan. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Mi egbe ongwu ta ma, a wa tun mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin sɔdzɛ mi idzidzɛ etsetse, le fwo ma dile byi ma ita.<figure style="fig" alt="Ongwɛ iYesu sɔdzɛ iTɛmpɛ yi engyukwo" file="WA03808b.tif" size="col" loc="2;46" ref="2:46">The Boy Jesus in the Temple</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Ama nfwon duu, i kwulu ma ewo mi ozoyeye bɛyi uka mgban onuunu. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Onɔ ngwi ama omban wa din nɛ, i kwulu ma ewo. Onɔn si byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwani, kyɔsinɛ ngwi abu kyungwɔnɛ yi eyi ngha? Otsabu yi ani gbili abu ndɛngyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>IYesu byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema le pita ani? Ema ye dafi i wo gbɛɛ ani ka dzɛ mi ozu mgbi Otsani baa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Nghaduu elodzɛ ngwi o nya ma na gbosa loma ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Ta iYesu wafɔ yi ama lu iNadzareti dile siikye nu ma. Onɔn kwulu elodzɛ ntonɛ duu wokɛ itukwu mbon. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>IYesu she mi ikpewo bɛyi ozoyeye, ikyese mgbi Imgbasho dzɛyan, inggisɛ duu gbela yan.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">IJɔn okyɔ iBatisima mɛ ofɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Mi onova ongwi iwyodeda ngwi iSidza (utɔ) iTiberu li utɔ mi iRoma mani, iPontu iPlatu li iGɔna mi ayɛsɛ iJudia, iHerude li atɔtsɛ mi ayɛsɛ iGalalia, ongwunɔn iFyilipi li atɔtsɛ mi Ituria bɛyi iTirakoni, iLisania di li atɔtsɛ mi Abilen. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Mi onɔ ngwi Anna bɛyi iKayafa li okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho ma, elodzɛ mgbi Imgbasho ba mbi iJɔn ongwɛ iDzakaria mi okwɛsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>O kaka ali imbe mi ewekyoo mgbi iJodan, le gbeesɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyata mi ali ibwubwe mgbi ema nu ma kyɔ ema iBatisima ikye nu ma dzita ema yi ali ibwubwe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Dafi oyegbɔ Adzaya tsekise lɔ gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Ela mgbi inggisɛ le kwu mi okwɛsɛ gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Mɛlu ofɛ ikye mgbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Otsɛ no byi yɛyɛ na,<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Ali ufɛ duu nu ma yilen tukwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ali unggwɔ bɛyi undɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">duu nu ma kye gbobu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Ofɛ ama nkwenggengga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ma nu ma kye nalu byi yɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ofɛ ama nli ishishɛ duu ni a kye tukwulu.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Ta inggisɛ owamyɛ duu ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">di owatɔ-watɔ mgbi Imgbasho.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>IJɔn nya ibyi inggisɛ ama nba gbɛɛ no wa kyɔ ma iBatisima ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema engwɛ ogidzi ntonɛ! Li emɛ wɛ ema odzɛ gbɛɛ ni ema tsinya itingga mgbi Imgbasho, nkyɛ iyayi na? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Nghanɛ ema kyɔ ali otso itukwu okyata-kyata mgbi ema, Ka nya ewema gbɛɛ, &lt;Eyi li engwɛ mgbi Abrahan ta si ngyɛ ba.&gt; Lubana n nya ema Imgbasho ka yagba kyata akwutsɛ ntonɛ yɛɛ engwɛ Abrahan gbɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Ika ladzɛ iteekwɔ le fɛɛfɛ, ali ekwɔ n wa owawa osuse ba duu, a ka kye dzɛlu ngwuta wokɛ ola.&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="IJɔn okyɔ iBatisima le gbɔ esɔ" file="WA03809b.tif" size="col" loc="3;9" ref="3:9">The preaching of John the Baptist</figure><verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Inggisɛ ntona byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni eyi kyɔsinɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>IJɔn nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi abu nghi efa yɔ, no kye onyi nu odon, abu ndzɛ yi ungwogye yɔ gha yi inggisɛ oka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ kpaa ba owa kyɔ iBatisima, a byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, eyi ma ni eyi kyɔsinɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka yama gbɛ awuya nyɛ obyi ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Oblakwutsɛ angbeka kpaa byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi ma ni eyi kyɔsinɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka yama gbɛ inggisɛ awuya mi abumfye ba dika gbe odzɛ tukwu inggisɛ ewo mi atsika ba, udza ofya mgbi ema no gyɔlo ema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Inggisɛ ntona le fɛ yi ɛwɛ ogbebyi dile tsɛwɛ mi itukwu gbɛɛ naadi iJɔn li iKrestu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ongwu Otsɛ Imgbasho zondu gbɛɛ o ka wa dulu ɛsɛ tɔ mani.</char></note> ngwu ama le fɛ ma hoo! <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>IJɔn nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani le kyɔ ema iBatisima yi eni. Nghaduu Ongwu nshewo ngha ani kyɛma, ngwu odi okpafɔ mgban kpaa ani mɛ oshɛ ba. O ka kyɔ ema iBatisima mi Onodzi Osaan mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ola. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Okwuga byidzɛ abɔ mgban, o ka folu ungwogyowe kye gbelu inɛnɛ osuse wokɛ oba, ashuwe yɔ o ka kye toola mi ola ngwi li gyegwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>IJɔn kwu inggisɛ ntona ɛwɛ wo mi elodzɛ angbeka kwuba di gbɔ Esɔ Osuse nya ma.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Dafi iJɔn fwa mi otsitsi tsɛ iHerude atɔtsɛ inɛ ikyegbɛɛ o kyelu iHerodia owa ongwunɔn iFyilipi bɛyi alungwɔ obube angbeka ngwi o tsekise kyɔ nɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>iHerude diyɛ kyɔ alobube ndatu ngha duu: O bwalu iJɔn wokɛ obawi.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IBatisima bɛyi odzɛ etɔ mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Ngwi iJɔn kyɔ ali inggisɛ duu iBatisima nɛ, o kyɔ iYesu kpaa iBatisima. Mi onɔ ngwi iYesu le bibɔ nɛta, esho kwulu, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>man Onodzi Osaan tashulu ba mbon dafi anyama mani, ela di tɔ mi esho gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li Ongwani nkpaani itukwu; i kpani yi abu saan.&gt;&gt;<figure style="fig" alt="The baptism of Jesus" file="gt00066.jpg" size="col" loc="3:22" copy="gt" ref="3:22">IBatisima mgbi iYesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Onɔ ngwi iYesu li onova osudiwyo ma, o wita idɔ mgban. Ali inggisɛ tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ o li ongwɛ iJose,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">nli ongwɛ iHeli,<verse eid="LUK 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>ongwɛ iMatati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">ongwɛ iLevi, ongwɛ iMelki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">ongwɛ iJenai, ongwɛ iJose,<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>ongwɛ iMatatia, ongwɛ Emosu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">ongwɛ iNahun, ongwɛ Esili,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">ongwɛ iNaga, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>ongwɛ iMaati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">ongwɛ iMatatia, ongwɛ iSeme,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">ongwɛ iJoseki, ongwɛ iJoda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>ongwɛ iJonan, ongwɛ iResa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">ongwɛ iDzerubabɛ, ongwɛ iShetiɛ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">ongwɛ iNeri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>ongwɛ iMelki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">ongwɛ Addi, ongwɛ iKosan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">ongwɛ Elimanda, ongwɛ Eri,<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>ongwɛ iJoshua, ongwɛ Eliadza,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">ongwɛ iJorin, ongwɛ iMatati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">ongwɛ iLevi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>ongwɛ iSimiɔn,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">ongwɛ iJuda, ongwɛ iJose,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">ongwɛ iJonan, ongwɛ Eliakin,<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>ongwɛ iMelia, ongwɛ iMena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">ongwɛ iMatata, ongwɛ iNatan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">ongwɛ iDevedi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>ongwɛ iJese,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">ongwɛ Obɛdi, ongwɛ iBoadzi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">ongwɛ iSalmɔn, ongwɛ iNashɔn,<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>ongwɛ Aminada, ongwɛ iRan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">ongwɛ iHerizɔn, ongwɛ iPeredzi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">ongwɛ iJuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>ongwɛ iJeko,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">ongwɛ Adziki, ongwɛ Abrahan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">ongwɛ iTera, ongwɛ iNahɔ,<verse eid="LUK 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>ongwɛ iSerɔgu, ongwɛ iReu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">ongwɛ iPelegi, ongwɛ Ebɛl,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">ongwɛ iSala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>ongwɛ iKaina,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">ongwɛ Afadza, ongwɛ iShɛn,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">ongwɛ iNua, ongwɛ iLameki,<verse eid="LUK 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>ongwɛ iMetusela, ongwɛ Enɔku,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">ongwɛ iJaredi, ongwɛ iMahalale,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">ongwɛ iKaina, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>ongwɛ Enɔsh,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">ongwɛ iSeti, ongwɛ Adan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Ongwɛ Imgbasho.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Imbadi mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>IYesu mbwo yi Onodzi Osaan, o yɛ mi ekyoo mgbi iJodan, ta Onodzi kyon teyi lu okwɛsɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>mi imbe na iSatan gyilan mi egbe ngwusefa. Mi egbe ntona duu o gye unkonyi ba, ngwi egbe ntona wa nyɛ nɛ, enbwa si dɔn.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Ta iSatan nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini abu li Ongwɛ Imgbasho yɔ, nya ikwutsɛ nɛ no kyata yɛɛ ibredi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>IYesu nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɛ lɔ gbɛɛ: &lt;Li mi ibredi ta ngwi inggisɛ ka dzɛ oshishe ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>ISatan di kyon lu ka dɔkɛ imbe oshigbo, o tson esutɔ mgbi ɛsɛ duu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Ta iSatan nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N ka kye ali mfye duu nu abu bɛyi okwɔkwɔ mgbi ɛsɛ nɛni, lubana a kye mfye bɛyi okwɔkwɔ kye nu ani, ani ka yagba okye nu ali inggisɛ ngwu ani mina duu. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Nghanɛ, kini abu sunu ani yɔ, ungwɔ ntonɛ duu ka yɛɛ mgbi abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Kpaa iYesu nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɛ lɔ gbɛɛ: &lt;Sunu Otsɛ Imgbasho mgbi abu di li ongwu ta kyɔn idɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>ISatan di kye iYesu lu iJerosalin ka kyon dɔkɛ ikyikye ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin. O nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini abu li Ongwɛ Imgbasho yɔ, bulu lu esɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Lubana Afɛ lɔ gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;O ka wo engyesɔ mgban ola ikye abu gbɛɛ nu ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">ngyo abu saan;<verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>ni abu bulu le lu esɛ a ka kye gbɛlu abu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">mi abɔ mgbi ama ikyegbɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">ni abu ka kye afɔ tsɛ akwutsɛ ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Nghaduu iYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɛ lɔ gbɛɛ &lt;Ka mbadi Otsɛ Imgbasho mgbi abu ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Mi onɔ ngwi iSatan ngyɛlu ogyila iYesu nɛ, o lu dzanta, o nyan gbɛɛ, se egbe oka.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu wita idɔ mgban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>IYesu yɛ luba iGalalia mi mfye mgbi Onodzi, ta odzɛ mgban si gbɔfwɛ kpatsɛ ɛsɛ na duu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>O tso mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda, ali inggisɛ duu tsan.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A fwa iYesu mi iNadzareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Ta iYesu kɛ iNadzareti imbe ngwi o she mani, o ka kaka ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda mi egbe otonyidɔ dafi o li tsekise kyɔ mani. O kyato dzɛkunto ogbɔ afɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>a kye afɛ ofulu-fulu mgbi oyegbɔ Adzaya kye nun. O kye nalu afɛ na, o tu imbe ngwi Afɛ lɔ gbɛɛ;<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>&lt;&lt;Onodzi mgbi Otsɛ dzɛ mbi ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">lubana o kye engyie Kyi ani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">onu ani gbɔ Esɔ Osuse nya emi adzɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">O dɔ ani esɔ ogbɔ otɔ-tɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">mi isɔ nya ama nwoto obawi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">bɛyi onu ama nbinɛ dinɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">onu ama ngwu a si ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">to myɛɛ-myɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Odi gbɔgbɛɛ onɔ gyɔ ngwi Otsɛ Imgbasho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">ka dulu emidan watɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>O si kye fulu afɛ na, yilen nu inggisɛ oyabɔ nkye nun mani, man sɔkɛ esɛ. Ta ali inggisɛ ama nwoto ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda na duu gbe inɛ fyakwun. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Ta iYesu wita ogbɔdzɛ yi ama gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inɛ nɛ, odzɛ ngwi Afɛ lɔ nɛ mbwumbwo mi adɔ mgbi ema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Ali inggisɛ duu gbɔdzɛ osuse ikpewon; i di kwulu ma ewo mi itɔ elodzɛ osuse nle tɔ mi ondu mbon nani. A si byi ewoma gbɛɛ &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ongwɛ iJose nɛ baa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li otsitsi ema ka nya ani utsa ngha gbɛ, gbɛɛ: &lt;Inggisɛ obwe ootse, bwe ewabu: di kyungwɔ ngwi abu le kyɔ mi iKapenahun ma mi ɛsɛ udɛ abu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>&lt;&lt;Otsitsi ani le nya ema, oyegbɔ onyonyi kpaa a li gbela yan mi ɛsɛ udan ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>I mina ani ni ema ye gbɛɛ engyaa owakwadɛ to ɛsɛ Israi kwuba mi onɔ mgbi Elaija, mi onɔ ngwi mmbwo kya ba mɛ onova eta yi ofyia egyin ngwi enbwa gbo kpatsɛ ɛsɛ duu mani. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Nghaduukpaa Imgbasho dɔ Elaija esɔ kɛ mbi owakwadɛ onyi kpaa mi Israi ba, se li owakwadɛ mi iDzarefati mi ogalu iShidon ta. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Emi Israi kwuba to yi otsoma mi onɔ mgbi Elaisha oyegbɔ nghaduu Imgbasho ngyɛlu inggisɛ onyi kpaa otsoma ba, se li iNama inggisɛ iSiria ta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ yi ama ngha nɛ, ali inggisɛ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda na duu nyɛ yi itingga. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Ta a kyato, a lɔn onya tasɛ mi ɛsɛ udɛ ama, a kyon tasɛ lu ikpozu udɛ le ka kyon dɔkɛ undɔ ongwi a mbɛ igeli mgbi ama mi ele mani, ikye oka tsamun ngwuta lu agblo. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Nghaduu, o sɛ wo ma ewo lu ofɛ mgban.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu lɔ onodzi obube onya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Nɛ iYesu si lu iKapenahun, igeli mi iGalalia, mi egbe otonyidɔ, ka wita otso ma. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>I kwulu ma ewo mi otsootso mgban, ikyesinɛ esɔ mgban kyɛ yi mfye.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda na, inggisɛ oka dzɛ ele ngwu dzɛ yi esɛ ikye, onodzi obube. O teela mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>&lt;&lt;Kpei! iYesu ongwi iNadzareti, li alungwɔ mina abu okyɔ yi eyi? Abu ba owa dzili eyii? Ani ye abu, abu li Ongwɛ Osaan mgbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Nghaduu, iYesu kyɔkyɔ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dede, tasɛ mbon.&gt;&gt; Ta onodzi obube na kyon gyɛsɛ mi idzidzɛ ma, man tasɛ mbon, kpaa o yama kyɔn unkonyi ba.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>I kwulu ma ewo, ta a sile gbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ali odzɛ lo! Lubana o gbɔdzɛ mi ela mfye yi onodzi ibwubwe ta a fwon diyɛ tasɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Man odzɛ mgban si gbɔfwɛ kpatsɛ ɛsɛ na bɛyi ɛsɛ ama nto yi ama kwɛkwɛ duu.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu ngyɛlu ibyi inggisɛ ootse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>O si kyato mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda, lu udɛ iSaimɔn, onɔ na awo bwa onowa iSaimɔn ladzɛ esɛ le tsaatsa, nɛ a nya iYesu gbɛɛ no yan abɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Ta iYesu si kɛ ka klɛsɛ mbon, o kyɔkyɔ yi awo na, man i tɔ dzanta. Onowa iSaimɔn si kyato wita gbe ungwogye le nu ma.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Mi onɔnɔdɛ, a gbe emi ootse idzidza-dzidza ba mbi iYesu, ta o kye abɔ gbo ali inggisɛ ewo, man ootse ngyɛ loma. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Enedzi ibwubwe kpaa tɔ mbi inggisɛ kwuba le kwu ela gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li Ongwɛ Imgbasho.&gt;&gt; Nghaduu o kwo ma adɔ di nu ma ofɛ ogbɔdzɛ ba ikyesinɛ, a ye dafi o li iKrestu mani.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Ngwi egbe fa nɛ, iYesu tasɛ lu imbe ngwi inggisɛ dzɛ ele ba; ibyi inggisɛ tɔ tole pitan, ngwi a wa to mbon nɛ, i mina ma omben onɔ, ikyegbɛɛ no ka lu dzata ma ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Nghaduu iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li kyɛmɛ ngwi ani ka gbɔ Esɔ Osuse mgbi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho nɛ mi igeli angbeka kpaa, lubana li itɔdzɛ nɛ ngwi Imgbasho dɔ ani esɔ ba mmɛnɛ aani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>O sile gbɔ Esɔ mi emi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda kpatsɛ iJudia.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Engwafɔ mgbi iYesu emi ababɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Egbe oka nɛ, iYesu kwulɛsɛ dzɛ ewuutɔ mgbi iGenesareti, ibyi inggisɛ kpakɛkɛ won tole fwo odzɛ Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Nɛ o ndinɛ ka gbo yi uwaa nghi efa bɛto onduutɔ kpaa ama otuntsɛ woto ele ba, a tasɛ le sa ukɛ mgbi ama. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>O kaka uwaa oka ongwi li mgbi iSaimɔn, man nyan gbɛɛ no tsamu uwaa kaka eni gwee, ta o sɔkɛ esɛ mi uwaa si tso ma ungwɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Onɔ ngwi o ngyɛlu ogbɔdzɛ yi ama nɛ, o nya iSaimɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gblekɛ ole, ka wo ukɛ ni ema kwu mmbwɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>ISaimɔn nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, eyi kwo ukɛ mi otu nghataa ni egbe fa mi adzɛ kpakpa, kpaa eyi kwu oshagye ba; kpaa li abu gbɔ mayɔ n ka kye wo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Ngwi a kyɔ dafi iYesu nya ma nɛ, a kwu mmbwɛ kpakpa, man ukɛ mgbi ama wita ofawa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Nɛ a flɛ ama otuntsɛ angbeka ama nwoto uwaa oka ntona abɔ gbɛɛ nu ma wa ya ma abɔ, nɛ a si kwu mmbwɛ mbwo uwaa efa ntona kyɛɛ dile fya osulu-sulu.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Ngwi iSaimɔn iPyita di ungwɔnɛ nghanɛ, o ka kye akwafɔ kwokɛ esɛ mi iyayi mgbi iYesu, o nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Lu dzɛ ani ta, Otsɛ, lubana ani li inggisɛ alobube.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Ikyekyɛ ongwu bɛyi ama nto yan duu i kwulu ma ewo mi itɔ mmbwɛ ngwi ama kwu kwuba nani. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Li ngha ngwi iJɛnsi bɛyi iJɔn emi ongwɛ iDzebedi ama nle tuntsɛ yi iSaimɔn na kpaa i kwulu ma ewo aali. Nghaduu, iYesu nya iSaimɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka mio ba, wita mi onɛnɛ lu iyayi ka li inggisɛ ngwi ema kale kwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Ta a kye kwolu uwaa mgbi ama dɔkɛ esɛ, a dzata alungwɔ duu kyɛdɔn.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inggisɛ ongwu iYesu ngyɛlun otsoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Dafi iYesu dzɛ mi igeli oka nɛ, inggisɛ oka ba mbon ongwu otsoma gban ewo sɔ. Ngwi o di iYesu nɛ, o lakɛ esɛ kye inɛ tukwu esɛ, tɛkyɛ nun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ni abu ki gbela, o ka yagba nu ani yɛɛ saan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>IYesu na abɔ gbon ewo nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani gbela, yɛɛ saan!&gt;&gt; Mi onɔ na ta otsoma ngyɛ lon.<verse eid="LUK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Nɛ iYesu kwon adɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka ka gbɔ nya inggisɛ ba, kpaa kye ewabu lu ka tso inggisɛ ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho di nu umba dafi iMose woola mani, mi oyɛɛ saan mgbi abu, zukwu no yɛɛ obwɛndɛ mbo ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Nghaduu odzɛ mgban nghao le gbɔfwɛ-gbɔfwɛ, ta ibyi inggisɛ nghao le ba ikye ofwon di non ngyɛlu ma ootse. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Kpaa iYesu li lu ka dzɛkɛ imbe ndede le bibɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu ngyɛlu inggisɛ ongwu alewo <optbreak/> mgban kwulu ootse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Egbe oka nɛ, iYesu le tsungwɔ nɛta, emi iFarasi bɛyi etsetse mgbi ola mgbi iMose, ama nkyɛ mi ali udɛ mi iGalalia, mi iJudia bɛyi iJerosalin duu sɔto ele, mfye mgbi Otsɛ Imgbasho kpaa dzɛyan ikye onon ongyɛlu ma ootse. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Inggisɛ angbeka si kye inggisɛ ngwu alewo mgban kwulu mi amuku, a fya okyon kaka ozu okyon lakiyayi iYesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Kpaa dafi a tu ofɛ okyɔ ngha ba ikye ibyi inggisɛ nɛ, a lu ka tɔkɛ ikpendu, kyon nyɛ ikpendu mi amuku nyɛ idzidzɛ ibyi inggisɛ nghataa lu iyayi iYesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Dafi iYesu di oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi ama nghanɛ, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Uka, a kye ali ibwubwe mgbi abu ta abu mkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Ta emi iFarasi bɛyi etsetse mgbi ola, wita otsɛwodzɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ ongwu li ali inggisɛ? Odzɛ na li ito! Li Imgbasho yuon ka dzata inggisɛ yi obube!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Nghaduu ngwi iYesu ye ewodzɛ mgbi ama nɛ, o byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ali ewodzɛ ngwi ema le tsɛ mi itukwu mgbi ema da? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Li ekyɛ nghao li adzɛ ba: Li ogbɛɛ, a dzita abu yi ali ibwubwe mgbi abu naadi li ogbɛɛ: &lt;Kyato kyikyɛ?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Kpaa li ikye onu ema ye gbɛɛ Ongwɛ Inggisɛ dzɛ yi mfye mi ɛsɛ nɛ odzɛ inggisɛ ta yi ali ibwubwe...&gt;&gt; O gbɔ yi inggisɛ ngwu alewo mgban kwulu na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani le nya abu kyato, kyelu amuku mgbi abu lu udɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Labɔlabɔ mata, inggisɛ ngwu alewo mgban kwulu na kyato dzɛkunto mi inɛ mgbi ama, o kyi kyelu amuku mgban ongwi a kyon wele ba ma lu udɛ le tsɛ Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Ali inggisɛ duu ewo waa loma, a si tsɛ Imgbasho. Imio wo ma nɛta a gbɛɛ &lt;&lt;Eyi di ungwɔ ama okwulewo inɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kwu iLevi ela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Ngwi iYesu ngyɛ nɛ, o tasɛ ta o di inggisɛ ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ ngwu a li kwun di iLevi sɔdzɛ mi ozu ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ. O si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɛdɔ ani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Man iLevi kyato dzata alungwɔ duu kyɛdɔn.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Nɛ iLevi kyɔn oga okwukwo mi udɛ mgban, ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ kwuba bɛyi angbeka kpaa le gye ungwogye yi ama. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Kpaa emi iFarasi bɛyi emidi ama, ama otso ola mgbi iMose le ndaandu, le byi engwafɔ mgbi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔnɛ ngwi ema le gye ungwogye dile wa yi ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ bɛyi emi ali ibwubwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ali ibwubwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛ mi onɔ na nose a li kye ma wuuta wuba ikyena li emi iRoma ma kye ma idɔ mi idzidzɛ emidi ama. A di li sii emidi ama okpaa udza ifyɛɛ di mwa dɔ efu. Nghanɛ emi iJuda li kwu ma gbɛɛ emi ali ibwubwe.</char></note>?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li inggisɛ ama ndzɛ saan li le pita inggisɛ obwotse ba, kpaa li inggisɛ ama ndotse. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Ani ba ikye owa kwu ama osaan ela ba, kpaa li ama nle saan ba mani, ikye nu ma kyatitukwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ita mi odzɛ ondu otukwu-tukwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>A gbɔ yi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Engwafɔ mgbi iJɔn li tukwondu dile bibɔ alonɔ duu, engwafɔ mgbi emi iFarasi kpaa, nghaduu emidabu le gye di wa alonɔ duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema ka yagba osi ama nbato oga ongyaa ofufɛ gbɛɛ nu ma tukwondu mi onɔ ngwi ongyaa ofufɛ ka dzɛ yi ama na gbɛɛ? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Nghaduu egbe kyɛma ngwi a ka kyi kyelu obongyaa ofufɛ, ta mi egbe ntona, ama kpaa ka tukwondu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>O diyɛ nya ma utsa gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ onyi kpaa ka mwadzɛ angwuto ofufɛ kye tukwukɛ angwuto ogbugbe ba. Ki non kyɔ ngha, o ka fawa angwuto ofufɛ na ta ba, ayɛ angwuto ofufɛ na dika kwokyi yi ogbugbe na ba. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Inggisɛ onyi kpaa ka kye eneekwɔ ofufɛ yaokɛ ikpɔkpɔ ogbugbe ba. Ki non kyɔ ngha yɔ, eneekwɔ ofufɛ na ka kye gbobu ikpɔkpɔ nani, eneekwɔ na kpaa ka yangwuta nyanya bɛyi ikpɔkpɔ na duu. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Kpaa a li kye eneekwɔ ofufɛ yaokɛ ikpɔkpɔ ofufɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Inggisɛ onyi nle wa eneekwɔ ogbugbe se ngwi ofufɛ ka minan dzɛma ba, o ka gbɛɛ: &lt;Ogbugbe nghao tishi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Ekwu oshɛ-shɛ mi egbe otonyidɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Mi egbe otonyidɔ oka nɛ, emi iYesu le kyikyɛ nyɛ ifu okwɔ ekwu, ta engwafɔɔn le shɛ ekwu, ngwunu mi atabɔ le bukwu. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Kpaa emi iFarasi angbeka byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema le kyungwɔ nli ola ba mi egbe otonyidɔ ngha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema gbɔ ungwɔ ngwi utɔ iDevedi kyɔ mi onɔ ngwi ongwu bɛyi emi ibuge mgban ngwi enbwa dɔ ma na ye wa lo? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>O ka kaka ozu Imgbasho, kyi kyelu ibredi ongwi a kye dɔ Imgbasho ubɔ, kye gye di kye nu ama nkyɛ yan ma duu. Ongwi ola gbɛɛ se li inggisɛ ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho ta ka gye mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Nɛ iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwɛ Inggisɛ li Otsɛ mgbi egbe otonyidɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inggisɛ owaa abɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Mi egbe otonyidɔ oka nɛ, iYesu kaka ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda le tso, nɛ inggisɛ oka wodzɛ ele ongwu abɔ abugye mgban waawaa. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Emi iFarasi bɛyi etsetse mgbi ola gbe inɛ fyakwun ikye nu ma di ni o ka bwe inggisɛ na mi egbe otonyidɔ yɔ, ni ama tu itɔdzɛ okye abɔ byi ele kwun elikwɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Nghaduu iYesu ye ewodzɛ mgbi ama otsɛɛtsɛ man o si nya inggisɛ owaa abɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyato wa dzɛkɛ mi iyayi mgbi ali inggisɛ duu.&gt;&gt; Ta o kyato wa kwulɛsɛ dzɛkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Nghanɛ iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani le byi ema ita, li ole li ola mgbi eyi ngwi li ayin okyɔɔkyɔ mi egbe otonyidɔ: li okyɔ osuse naadi li okyɔ obube, li odulu oshishe naadi li odzili oshishe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>IYesu ndinɛ di ma kpatsɛ si nya inggisɛ owaa abɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Na abɔ mgbi abu.&gt;&gt; O si kyɔ ngha, ta abɔ mgban yɛɛ saan. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Nghaduu itukwu fu loma a si wita ogbɔ yi ewoma ungwɔ ngwi ama ka kyɔ yi iYesu mani.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu sadu ama ogbikyon iwyodefa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Egbe oka nose nɛ iYesu tasɛ lu unggwɔ le ka bibɔ, o kye otu na duu bibɔ mbi Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Ngwi egbe wa fa nɛ, o kwu ama nkyɛdɔn duu ela takye man, o sadu engyulɔ iwyodefa, o kwu ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama ogbikye ani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>ISaimɔn ongwu o kyɔn iyi oka gbɛɛ iPyita, bɛyi ongwunɔn Andru, yi iJɛnsi, yi iJɔn, yi iFyilipi, yi iBatlomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>yi iMatiu, yi iTɔmɔsu, yi iJɛnsi ongwɛ Alfeɔ, yi iSaimɔn ongwu a kwun gbɛɛ Ogbodami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ogbodami </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Li inggisɛ ngwu li mina kpakpa onagbɛ emidan. Mi Israi mi onɔ mgbi iYesu ma itishe oka dzɛ ngwi mina kpakpa onagbɛ emi Israi mi abumfye mbi emi iRomanu, iSaimɔn onyi mbi ama ngwu iYesu sadu ma ogbikyon kyɛ mi itishe nani.</char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>yi iJuda ongwɛ iJɛnsi bɛyi iJuda Iskarɔti ongwu n wa yɛɛ inggisɛ okyon gya nani.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mse yi ikamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Nɛta emi iYesu tashulu mi unggwɔ wa kwulɛsɛ mi imbe ogblagadaa. Ama okyɛdɔn kwuto ele bɛyi ibyi inggisɛ mi ali ayɛ iJudia, iJerosalin yi ewekyoo mgbi iTiru bɛyi iSidon duu. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>A ba ikye owa fwon, no di ngyɛlu ma ootse. Ama ngwu onodzi ibwubwe kaka ma ewo duu o ngyɛlu ma ele. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Ta inggisɛ ibyibyi le nana okye abɔ gbon, lubana ama nkye abɔ gbon duu mfye tɔ mbon ngyɛlu ma ootse.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>IYesu kye inɛ byi ama okyɛdɔn, o nya ma gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">&lt;&lt;No kpa ema ewo ema emi adzɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">lubana esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho dzɛ ikye ema.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>No kpa ema ewo ema ngwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">enbwa le dɔ ema onɛnɛni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">lubana ema ka wa tolo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">No kpa ema ewo ema</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ama nle tsukwu onɛnɛni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">lubana ema ka wa shisha.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>No kpa ema ewo mi onɔ ngwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">inggisɛ di ema kyili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">nu ma di kye ema wuuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ba di fya ema ito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">di fwa ema gbɛɛ ema li emi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ibwubwe mi ikye mgbi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>&lt;&lt;Dzɛ yi atsa mi egbe nani di shufwe yi atsa, ikyesinɛ umba mgbi ema shewo mi esho. Lubana li ngha ngwi emi otsikyɔ ma kyɔ yi ama ogbɛɛsɛ aali.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>&lt;&lt;Kpaa ahoo mbi ema ama nli aludu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">Lubana ema tu omyɛɛ-myɛɛ mgbi ema wa.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Odzɛ ka tu ema, ema ama ntolo onɛnɛni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Lubana enbwa ka wa dɔ ema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ahoo mi ikye ema ama nle shisha onɛnɛni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ema ka wa buntse diyɛ tsukwu.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Odzɛ ka tu ema, ema ngwu ali inggisɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">li le gbɔdzɛ osuse ikpewo ema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">lubana li ngha ngwi emi otsikyɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">ma kyɔ yi oyegbɔ emi atsika aali.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okpitukwu mbi emi ikyili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>&lt;&lt;Nghaduu ani le nya ema ama ntole fwo ani nɛ gbɛɛ: Engyikyili mgbi ema nu ma kpa ema itukwu, kyɔ osuse yi ama ndi ema taanyi, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>kyumse yi ama nfya ema ito di bibɔ ikye ama nkyɔ yi ema timbi-timbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Kini inggisɛ ta abu afɛ mi atadɔ agya oka yɔ, kyata agya oka na kpaa nun. Kini inggisɛ kye gbɛlu abu angwuto owoowo ongwi ifun yɔ, ka kwɔ otsungwɔn okye gbɛlu abu angwuto ongwi esɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Ali inggisɛ nbɔ abu ungwɔ duu, ka kwɔ otsungwɔn ba, ni inggisɛ di gbɛ ungwɔ mbi abu ka kwun mkpa gbɛɛ no yilen wa nu abu ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Kyɔ yi angbeka dafi i mina ema gbɛɛ ni a kyɔ yi ema mani.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>&lt;&lt;Kini abu kyɔ okpitukwu yi ama nkpa abu itukwu ta ma, li ali oyabɔ ngwi abu ka tu? Lubana li ngha ngwi emi ali ibwubwe kpaa li di ama ngwu ama kpa ma itukwu ma, kpa ma itukwu aali. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Ni abu di kyɔ osuse yi ama nli kyɔ osuse yi abu ta ma, li ali oyabɔ ngwi abu ka tu? Lubana li ngha ngwi emi ali ibwubwe kpaa li kyɔ aali. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Kini ema gha ama ngwu ema ye gbɛɛ a ka yilen kpa ema ta umba ma, li ali oyabɔ ngwi ema ka tu? Lubana li ngha ngwi emi ali ibwubwe kpaa li kye nu ama ngwu a ye gbɛɛ a ka yilen kpa ma kyɛɛ ma aali. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Nghaduu, engyikyili mgbi ema nu ma kpa ema itukwu, kyɔ osuse yi ama, di kye nu ma gbɛɛ nu ma ka yilen kpa ema ba. Ta umba mgbi ema kale gbagbadzidzi, ema dika li engwɛ mgbi Ongwu Nghaangha mi Esho, lubana o li kyɔ osuse yi ama ungwɔ li mɛ ma inɛ ba yi emi imbali. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Dzɛ yi elela odiidi dafi Otsema kpaa li di elela nɛni.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogbɔ angbeka ikwɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>&lt;&lt;Ka gbiikwɔ ba, ta ema kpaa a ka gbɔ ema ikwɔ ba. Ka ngwɔ inggisɛ ikwɔ ba ta ema kpaa a ka ngwɔ ema ikwɔ ba. Dzita inggisɛ yi obube, ta ema kpaa a ka dzita ema yi obube mgbi ema. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Nu, ta ema kpaa Imgbasho ka yilen nu ema. Ombaamba osuse, ongwi a siin, ngwi a kwonwo saan, ngwi di mbwo le yangwuta, Imgbasho ka kye nu ema; ikyesinɛ li ombaamba ngwi ema mba ma, ngwi Imgbasho ka yilen mba nu ema aali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>IYesu diyɛ nya ma utsa gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ obinɛ ka kye obinɛ oka teyi gbɛɛ? Ama efa duu a ka gbɛsɛ wokɛ ishɛ baa? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Inggisɛ okpayi-kpayi ka ye ngha otsetse mgban ba, kpaa ali inggisɛ ngwu a tson saan ka dzɛ dafi otsetse mgban mani.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>&lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi abu li di ɛfɛ nwodzɛ inɛ mbi ongwunabu kpaa li difwi otsokplekwɔ nwodzɛ inɛ mgbi abu na ba? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Ka kyɔsinɛ abu ka nya ongwunabu gbɛɛ: &lt;Ongwunani detse nin dulu abu ɛfɛ mi inɛ, ngwi otsokplekwɔ wodzɛ inɛ mbi abu?&gt; Abu inggisɛ ikpala nɛ, tsekise dulu otsokplekwɔ nwodzɛ inɛ mbi abu na duuse o ka dinɛ saan odulu ɛfɛ nwodzɛ inɛ mbi ongwunabu nani.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekwɔ bɛyi owawa mgban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>&lt;&lt;Ekwɔ osuse li wa owawa obube ba, hona ekwɔ obube li wa owawa osuse ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Ali ekwɔ duu a li difwin mi owawa mgban, inggisɛ li shɛ andundu mi ato ba, naadi a li shɛ owawa ekwɔ mi afwe ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Inggisɛ osuse li dulu ungwɔ osuse ama ngwi o kye da mi itukwu mgban, inggisɛ ibwubwe li dulu ungwɔ ibwubwe ama ngwi o kye da mi itukwu mgban, lubana dafi i mbwon itukwu ma ngwi ondu li gbɔ tɔ aali.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ama okyɛdɔ iYesu mi otsitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>&lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛse ngwi ema li kwu ani gbɛɛ, &lt;Otsɛ, Otsɛ&gt; kpaa li kyungwɔ ngwi ani gbɔ ba? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Ani ka tso ema dafi inggisɛ nba mbi ani wa fwo elodzɛ mgbi ani diyɛ kyɔ mi ele dzɛ mani. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>O dzɛ dafi inggisɛ nle mbɛ ozu, o plɛ tishɛ kɛ di wo itozu mi akwutsɛ. Mi onɔ ngwi ekyoo taayɔ, akpeni wa tsɛkɛ ele kpaa i kyɔn unkaba, ikyesinɛ a mban saan. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ nfwo elodzɛ mgbi ani diyɛ kyɔ mi ele ba, o dzɛ dafi inggisɛ nmbɛ ozu mgban mi ikye mfyan wo itozu ba mani. Onɔ ngwi akpeni okwukwo wa tsɛkɛ ele nɛ, ozu na gbobu tukwu esɛ gbluu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi ongyukwo <optbreak/> oblakwutsɛ mgbi emi iRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Dafi iYesu ngyɛlu odzɛ ogbɔɔgbɔ yi ibyi inggisɛ tsatsadu nɛ, o si kaka iKapenahun. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Mi igeli na, ongbidɔ mgbi ongyukwo oblakwutsɛ oka ngwu kpan itukwu saan dotse dzɛ kwɛkwɛ okwulu-kwulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Ongyukwo oblakwutsɛ mgbi emi iRoma nɛ si fwo odzɛ mgbi iYesu, o dɔ engyukwo emi iJuda angbeka esɔ gbɛɛ nu ma ka nyan no ba wa ngyɛlu ongbidɔ mgbi ongwu ootse. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Nɛ a ka tɛkyɛ nu iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nɛ mina abɔ oyaaya mbi abu kyɛmɛ-kyɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Ikyekyɛ ɛsɛ mgbi eyi kpan itukwu, o di mbɛ eyi ozu okwakye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Nɛ iYesu si wafɔ yi ama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Dafi iYesu dzɛ kwɛkwɛ okaka udɛ nɛ, ongyukwo oblakwutsɛ mgbi emi iRoma na dɔ emi okan angbeka esɔ nu ma ka nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ka nu ewabu okakewo wuba, ikyena ani mɛ ongwu abu ka ba onufozu mgbi ani ba. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ani mɛ okɛ mbi abu ba. Nghanɛ gbɔ elodzɛ ta ootse mgbi ongbidɔ mgbi ani ka ngyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Ikyena ani abuen kpaa n li inggisɛ nbyidzɛ abɔ mfye, yi emi oblakwutsɛ mi abɔ ani, ni ani nya ongwunɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;Lu,&gt; o li lu. N di li gbɔ yi oka gbɛɛ, &lt;Kwa&gt; o di li ba. N di li nya ongbɛ mgbɛn gbɛɛ, &lt;Kyungwɔnɛni,&gt; o di li kyɔ ngha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Ngwi iYesu fwo odzɛ nɛ nghanɛ, i kwulun ewo yan, o kyata inɛ mbi ibyi ama nkyan iyikpa ma si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema, n tu itɔ oyɛyɛ onuunu nshewo itɔ nɛ ye ba, kwo mbi emi Israi kpaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Engyesɔ ntona yɛ lu udɛ ka tu ongbidɔ na yɛɛ saan.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kyile ongwɛ owakwadɛ mi ikwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Ngwi i wa nyɛ nɛta iYesu wafɔ yi engwafɔɔn bɛyi ibyi inggisɛ le lu mi igeli ngwi a li kwun di iNai. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Dafi a dzɛ kwɛkwɛ okaka onufɛ ogalu nɛ, a kye ikwɔ tɔ le kɛ ongwu nli ongwɛ onyi kpokpo mgbi owakwadɛ. Nghanɛ ibyi inggisɛ mi ogalu na wafɔ yan. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Ngwi Otsɛ iYesu din nɛ, elela kyɔn won, o si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka tsukwu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Nɛ iYesu kɛ kwɛkwɛ kye abɔ gbo ogba, ama nsisi ntona kwulɛsɛ. O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwongyulɔ, kyato.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Nɛta inggisɛ ikwukwɔ ma si kyato sɔ nto wita ogbɔdzɛ, iYesu yilen nu onɔn.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Ama duu imio wo ma man a le tsɛ Imgbasho. A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Oyegbɔ okwukwo tɔ mi idzidzɛ mgbi eyi: Imgbasho ba owa ya emidan abɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Odzɛ mgbi iYesu si gbɔfwɛ kpatsɛ iJudia bɛyi ɛsɛ angbeka ama nwo otsee dɔ ma duu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu yi iJɔn okyɔ iBatisima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Engwafɔ mgbi iJɔn nyan ungwɔ ama ngwi iYesu kyɔ duu, o kwu efa ela, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>o dɔ ma esɔ gbɛɛ nu ma kɛ ka byi Otsɛ iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li abu li ongwu iJɔn gbɔgbɛɛ o kyɛma le ba ma, naadi ni eyi gbe inɛ byi inggisɛ oka idzidza?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Mi onɔ ngwi emi esɔ ntona ba mbi iYesu nɛ, a gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IJɔn okyɔ iBatisima dɔ eyi esɔ mbi abu gbɛɛ ni eyi wa byita gbɛɛ: &lt;Abu li ongwu nkyɛ ka ba ma naadi ni eyi gbe inɛ byi inggisɛ oka?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Mi onɔ na iYesu ngyɛlu ibyi inggisɛ ootse idzidza-dzidza, bɛyi onodzi ibwubwe, di nu ama nbinɛ dinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>O si nu emi esɔ ntona uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Yidɔ lu ka nya iJɔn ungwɔ ngwi ema di diyɛ fwo: Ama nbinɛ yɛ le di, ama ngwu afɔ waawaa le kyikyɛ, ama ndɔ otsoma, otsoma mgbi ama ngyɛ, ama nkyadɔ le fwo, ama nkwulu le kyato mi ikwu, a le gbɔ Esɔ Osuse nya emi adzɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Imgbasho ka kye mse dzɛ yi ali inggisɛ nfwa ani ba mi ungwɔ ama ani kyɔ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Onɔ ngwi emi esɔ mgbi iJɔn lu nɛ, iYesu wita ogbɔdzɛ yi ibyi inggisɛ mi odzɛ mgbi iJɔn gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Li alungwɔ ngwi ema kɛ okwɛsɛ le ka di? Li atakwu ngwi awo le fan ntonaa? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Ki no li ngha ba ma, li alungwɔ ngwi ema kɛ le ka di? Li ongyulɔ nwo angwuto osusee? Ama nwo angwuto ofyunfyummya bɛyi ama ogye ɛsɛ a li to udɛ utɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Wanɛ li alungwɔ ngwi ema tasɛ le ka di? Li oyegbɔɔ? Ɛɛn, ani le nya ema, o ngha oyegbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Nɛnɛ li ongwu a lɔ ungwɔ ikyen gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">&lt;&lt; &lt;Dii, ani ka dɔ ongyesɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">mgbi ani no teyi abu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">ongwu nka teyi ka mɛ abu ofɛ mani.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Ani le nya ema, inggisɛ ngwu ongyaa mba ma duu, onyi kpaa dzɛma nshewo ngha iJɔn ba; Nghaduu inggisɛ nli olɛlɛ mi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho shewo nghan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>(Ali inggisɛ bɛyi ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ ngwu fwon duu, gbela Imgbasho, lubana iJɔn tsekise kyɔ ma iBatisima. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Kpaa emi iFarasi bɛyi ama oye ola fwa oweka mgbi Imgbasho mi ikye mgbi ama, ikyesinɛ a fwa onu iJɔn kyɔ ma iBatisima.)<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>&lt;&lt;Ma li alungwɔ ngwi ani ka kye inggisɛ emi etɔ nɛ mba yan? A to sinɛ? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>A to dafi ɛngbɛ ama nto ifyidu le kwu ewoma ela gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;&lt;Eyi gbla ema ozuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">kpaa ema shufwe ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Eyi shashi ibɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">kpaa ema tsukwu ba!<verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Lubana iJɔn okyɔ iBatisima ba, o li gye ungwogye ba, di li wa eneekwɔ ba; ema gbɛɛ: &lt;Esɛ dɔn ikye.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ba le gye diyɛ wa, kpaa ema li gbɛɛ: &lt;Dii, o li inggisɛ okyɔ nggwɔ yi inggisɛ ofya ɛbyɛ di li oka ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ bɛyi emi ali ibwubwe.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Nghaduu ozoyeye li tso otsitsi tɔ mbi ama nkyɛdɔn mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owagbai ongyaa kye engyie kyi <optbreak/> iYesu afɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Inggisɛ iFarasi oka bɔ iYesu ungwogye ongwi onɔdɛ mi udɛ mgban, o ka sɔkɛ imbe ogye ungwogye. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Onɔ ngwi ongyaa owagbai ngwu dzɛ igeli na, ka fwo dafi iYesu le gye ungwogye mi ozu mgbi inggisɛ iFarasi nɛ, o kye ikpɔkpɔ alabasta mgbi engyie ogbungbɛ, <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>wa kwulɛsɛ mi iyikpa iYesu le tsukwu kye etse kyin afɔ. Di kyi fwɔlu yi otu mgban, o kye ondu le kwon afɔ diyɛ kye engyie ogbungbɛ yawon afɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Ngwi inggisɛ iFarasi ngwu bɔɔn ungwogye na di nghanɛ, o gbɔ yi ewon gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nɛ ki li oyegbɔ yɔ, o ki ye itɔ ongyaa nkye abɔ le gbon ewo nɛ bɛyi iyi obube ngwi o dzɛyan nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Ta iYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;iSaimɔn, ani dzɛ yi odzɛ ngwi n ka gbɔ yi abu.&gt;&gt; O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbɔka otsetse!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ onu mkpa oka dzɛ yi ama ngban mkpa nghi efa: Oka dzɛyan isule ideli eda, oka ma li isule ngwusefa dɔn iwyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Ama efa duu yagba okpaakpa ba, ta o dzɛ ma ta. Li emɛ ngwu inggisɛ onu mkpa na ka nghao kpan itukwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>ISaimɔn nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ, li ongwu o dzanta yi mkpa kwuba nani.&gt;&gt; IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O gbɔ ayin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>O si kyata inɛ kɛ mbi ongyaa na nya iSaimɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu di ongyaa nɛ wɛ? Ani ba udɛ abu kpaa abu nu ani eni osaafɔ ba, kpaa ongyaa nɛ nu ani afɔ yɛɛ eneni yi etse, di kye fwɔlu yi otu mgban. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Abu ta ani angba yi ondu okwo ani ataka ba, kpaa ongyaa nɛ kyɛ onɔ ngwi ani ba mmɛnɛ ma jo, o tonya okye ondu kwo ani afɔ waba. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Abu kye engyie kyi ani ikye ba, nghaduu ongwu yɔ kye engyie ogbungbɛ kyi ani afɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Hininɛ ani le nya abu gbɛɛ a dzanta yi ali ibwubwe kwuba, ikyesinɛ o tso okpitukwu kwuba. Kpaa inggisɛ ongwu a dzanta gwee, li tso okpitukwu gwee ta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Ta iYesu nya ongyaa na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;A dzita abu yi ali ibwubwe mgbi abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Ingyoga angbeka ama nle gye ungwogye yi ama wita ogbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li emɛ ngwu ali ibwubwe kpaa o li dzɛ inggisɛ ta yan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>IYesu nya ongyaa na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi abu dulu abu watɔ, lu mi iyu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Engyaa ama nwafɔ yi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Dafi egbe wa nyɛ gwee nɛ, iYesu le kyikyɛ nyɛ ifu igeli yi agwɔ idzidza-dzidza le gbɔ Esɔ Osuse mgbi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho. Ama ogbikyon kyɛ yan, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>bɛyi engyaa angbeka ngwu a ngyɛlu ma ootse onodzi ibwubwe bɛyi ootse ita idzidza-dzidza: li iMeri ngwu a li kwun di iMagidalin, ongwu a lɔ onodzi emɛsɛ tɔ mbon egyafa nani; <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>bɛyi iJoana, owa iKudza, nli ikye mgbi emi idɔ mi opiikwɔ mgbi iHerude; bɛyi iSudzana, bɛyi engyaa angbeka kwuba ama nli kye ungwɔ mgbi ama abuoma kye ya emi iYesu abɔ mani.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi inggisɛ ofwe etɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Ngwi ibyi inggisɛ tole kwakye, angbeka dile ba mbi iYesu mi igeli idzidza-dzidza nɛ, iYesu nya ma odzɛ mi utsa gbɛɛ: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ofwe etɔ tasɛ o ka fwe etɔ. Dafi o fwe nɛta, angbeka yangwuta mi ofɛ a kye afɔ dzin, ingwunɔ emi esho ba wa kyi salu gye. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Angbeka yangwuta mi akwutsɛ; dafi i lumbye nɛ, a ngwɔ dunto ikyekyɛ a tu eni ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Etɔ angbeka yangwuta mi ifaato, ato she bɛyi ama nu ma gbufyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Angbeka yangwuta mi ekyɛ osuse, a lumbye yɛ wa owawa akpe ngwuseda ngha ongwi a kye kya mani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">IYesu si kwu ela gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ ofwoofwo yɔ, no fwo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itɔdzɛ mgbi utsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Engwafɔ iYesu byun ita mi ungwɔ ngwi utsa nɛ tso mani. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Nɛ o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema yɔ, a nu ema ye ungwɔ ama odaada ongwi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho, kpaa angbeka yɔ, li mi utsa ta ngwi ani li gbɔdzɛ yi ama, ikyegbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Mi odiidi kpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">a ka di ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">bɛyi ofwoofwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">ni a fwo kpaa ka gbosa loma ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>&lt;&lt;Li ngha ngwi utsa nɛ dzɛ aani: Etɔ, li elodzɛ Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Etɔ ama n yangwuta mi ofɛ na, i tso gbɛɛ dzɛ mi ikye ama nfwo kpaa iSatan ba wa kye gbɛlu elodzɛ na mi itukwu mgbi ama, ikyegbɛɛ nu ma dzɛ yi oyɛyɛ onuunu ni a dulu ma watɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Etɔ ama n yangwuta mi akwutsɛ ma, a dzɛ mi ikye inggisɛ ama nfwo esɔ diyɛ kyi gbɛlu yi atsa, kpaa a yagba dzɛ yi akpa ba, a noyɛyɛ mi onɔ gwee ta, ngwi imbadi wa ba nɛ, a gbɛsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Etɔ ama n yangwuta mi ifaato ma, a dzɛ mi ikye inggisɛ ama nfwo, kpaa okakewo bɛyi aludu yi oshishe ofyunfya ongwi ɛsɛ nɛ loka wo ma nɛta, a yɛ wa owawa wuba. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Etɔ ama n yangwuta mi ekyɛ osuse ma, a dzɛ mi ikye inggisɛ ama nfwo elodzɛ mgbi Imgbasho, yilen sisɛ mi itukwu mgbi ama osuse yi osunu mani, a shitukwu nghataa yɛ wa owawa.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi ipitila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ onyi dzɛma nka kye ipitila dɔ duuse yile mgboko tukwu ele ba, naadi yilen dzɛkɛ ifagwudo ba, kpaa o ka kye dɔkɛ mi ododa, ikyegbɛɛ inggisɛ ama nle kaka nu ma di osa! <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Lubana alungwɔ ndzɛ mi odaada duu, a ka kye tɔ mi ododa, bɛyi ungwɔ ama ngwi a kye tukwu duu, a dika kye kwulu tɔ mi ododa. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Nghanɛ gbɛwɛbyi, mi ofwoofwo ngwi ema fwo nɛni, ikyekyɛ inggisɛ ndzɛ yi ungwɔ ma, a ka mbwon mbwoombwo, kpaa inggisɛ ndzɛ yi ungwɔ ba, ogyɛngyɛ ngwi o tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ ongwu dzɛyan ma kpaa, a ka kye gbɛlu mbon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onɔ iYesu bɛyi emi ongwunɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Onɔ iYesu bɛyi emi ongwunɔn ba mbon, kpaa a yagba to mbon gbɛ ba ikye ibyi inggisɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Inggisɛ oka nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onabu bɛyi emi ongwunabu kwulɛsɛ to esɛ, a mina odi abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>IYesu nya ma duu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama nle fwo elodzɛ Imgbasho diyɛ kyɔ mi ele ma, li ama nli emi onani bɛyi emi ongwunani aali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu nu onikyɔ awo kwulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Egbe oka nɛta, iYesu si kaka uwaa yi engwafɔɔn, o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi ka foyombo utɔ.&gt;&gt; A si kyato olu. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Ngwi a le lu nɛ, iYesu nauna. Nɛ onikyɔ awo ba wa fa mi utɔ, nghanɛ uwaa le mweeni, ta a dzɛ mi okakewo kpakpa.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Man a ba mbon wa kyilen, a nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, Ongyukwo! Eyi le dzili!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">IYesu kyato fa awo yi akpeni ela: onikyɔ awo kwulu, man imbe yɛɛ tsiin.<figure style="fig" alt="IYesu nu onikyaawo kwulu" file="WA03848b.tif" size="col" loc="8;24" copy="Cn01958b" ref="8:24">Jesus calms a storm</figure> <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>O nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi ema kɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Kpaa dafi i kwulu ma ewo imio diyɛ wo ma nɛ, a gbɔ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ali inggisɛ dɛn? O fa awo yi akpeni ela ta a fwon!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inggisɛ iGeraseni ngwu <optbreak/> esɛ dɔn ikye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Emi iYesu si fooye ka kaka ogalu iGeraseni, nli oyombo utɔ iGalalia nani. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Ngwi iYesu fa dɔkɛ esɛ nɛta, o tsa yi inggisɛ oka mi igeli nani, ngwu esɛ dɔn ikye. O nya yi angwuto owoowo onɔ kɛ, o di li la udɛ ba, li imbe endzi ta ngwi o li la. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Ngwi o di iYesu nɛ, o makwɔ mi ela okwukwo, o lankɛ iyayi, yɛ kwu ela mfyumfye gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ekyɛ wo abu yi ani, iYesu, Ongwɛ Imgbasho nngha mi esho? N le tɛkyɛ nu abu, ka nu ani adzɛ ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>IYesu plɛ woola gbɛɛ, ni onodzi ibwubwe na tasɛ mbon. Lubana a li bwan mi onɔ ibyibyi, kye ashi won tan itse, ikye ole ngyon, kpaa o li gbɔdzɛ adi nani, onodzi ibwubwe li lɔn lu okwɛsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>IYesu byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyi abu di emɛ?&gt;&gt; O nyan gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ibyibyi&gt;&gt; bana onodzi ibwubwe kaka mbon kwuba. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Onodzi ibwubwe ntona tɛkyɛ nu iYesu gbɛɛ no ka lɔ ama onya ka yaokɛ ikplishɛ na ba.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Obyia ibyibyi kwuto le gye ungwɔ mi ewunggwɔ. Onodzi ibwubwe ntona si le tɛkyɛ yi iYesu gbɛɛ no nu ama ofɛ ni ama lu ka kaka obyia, man o si nu ma ofɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Ta onodzi ibwubwe ntona tasɛ mbi inggisɛ na lu ka kaka mbi obyia ntonani. Obyi obyia ntona nyɛ yi onya kye ikye byi ufɛ lu ka yaokɛ utɔ si dzili mi eni.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Ama ntole ngyo obyia ntona di ungwɔ nkyɔ mani ta a si tsinya lu ka kye odzɛ nɛ gbɔfwɛ nya ma mi igeli bɛyi ama nto okwɔ mi agya na duu. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Nɛ inggisɛ tasɛ le ka di ungwɔ nkyɔ mani. A si ba mbi iYesu, wa tu inggisɛ ongwu onodzi ibwubwe tɔ mbon ma, sɔdzɛ iyayi mgbi iYesu, o wo angwuto ewo di dzɛ yi ozoyeye saan; ta i kwulu ma ewo. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Ama nteyi di ma nya angbeka dafi i kyɔ se inggisɛ ngwu onodzi ibwubwe kaka mbon na yɛɛ saan mani. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Ta inggisɛ ama nto ɛsɛ iGeraseni duu nya iYesu gbɛɛ no lu, ikyekyɛ imio wo ma. Man o si kaka uwaa lu.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Inggisɛ ongwu onodzi ibwubwe tɔ mbon na tɛkyɛ yi iYesu gbɛɛ ni ongwu lu yan. Kpaa iYesu nyan gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>&lt;&lt;Yɛ lu udɛ abu, ka gbɔ ungwɔ ngwi Imgbasho kyɔ yi abu nɛni.&gt;&gt; Inggisɛ na yɛ lu le kyikyɛ kɛ igeli-igeli, le gbɔ ungwɔ ngwi iYesu kyɔ yan mani.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ongwɛ iJaru bɛyi ongyaa ndotse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Ngwi iYesu yɛ luba nɛ, ibyi inggisɛ gban yi atsa, ikyekyɛ a tole fan. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Nɛ inggisɛ oka ba, a li kwun di iJaru, o li ongyukwo mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda, o kwɛsɛ mi iyayi iYesu, si tɛkyɛ yan gbɛɛ no kɛ udɛ ongwu. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Ikyekyɛ ongwan ongwu ongyaa onyi kpokpo, ngwu mɛ onova iwyodefa, le fyikwu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Dafi iYesu le kɛ nɛ, ibyi inggisɛ tukwun kpakpa. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Mi idzidzɛ inggisɛ ntona, ongyaa oka dzɛ le yeeyi mɛ onova iwyodefa. O kye mbelu aludu mgban duu mbi ama obwotse, kpaa onyonyi yan abɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>O kaka ifu ibyi inggisɛ ntona wa kye abɔ gbo iYesu ondu angwuto mi iyikpa, labɔlabɔ mata eyi dzɛ lon.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li emɛ kye abɔ gbo ani?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Ama duu le tangwɛ, iPyita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, ibyi inggisɛ ama nkpakɛkɛ wo abu yɛ mba yi abu nɛ abu le byita gbɛɛ: &lt;Li emɛ kye abɔ gbo ani ewoo?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Nghaduu iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ kye ewo gbo ani, bana n kwu ambɛ dafi mfye tɔ mbi ani mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Ongyaa na di dafi ongwu dzɛ mi odaada wuba nɛ, o ba yi ewo otsaatsa wa kwɛsɛ mi iyayi mbi iYesu. O gbɔ mi inɛ mgbi inggisɛ tsatsa dafi i kyɔ se ongwu kye abɔ gbon ondu angwuto, ngwi ewo mgbi ongwu kpa di gbosa mina mani.<verse eid="LUK 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Nɛ iYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwongyaa, oyɛyɛ mgbi abu onuunu dulu abu tɔ. Lu mi iyu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Onɔ ngwi iYesu le gbɔdzɛ nɛ mata, inggisɛ oka mi udɛ iJaru, ongyukwo mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda na ba, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwabu ongwu ongyaa na kwulu wa: Ka kaka Otsetse ewo wuba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Ngwi iYesu fwo nghanɛ, o nya iJaru gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka teeyi ba, dzɛ yi oyɛyɛ onuunu, ta ootse mgban ka ngyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Dafi iYesu ka kaka udɛ iJaru nɛ, o gbela onu inggisɛ onyi kpaa kaka ozu yan ba, se li iPyita yi iJɔn bɛyi iJɛnsi yi otsɔ ongwongyaa na bɛyi onɔn ta. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Ali inggisɛ duu le tsukwu dile kyelela mi ikye ongwɛ nani. Nghaduu iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka tsukwu ba na, lubana ongwɛ nɛ kwulu ba, o nanuna ta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Ama duu shan isha ikwangha, ikyekyɛ a ye gbɛɛ di o kwulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Kpaa ngwi iYesu byin abɔ nɛ, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwani, kyato!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Ta oshishe mgban yɛ, man o kyato plɛ. IYesu si nya ma gbɛɛ, nu ma kye ungwogye non gye. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>I kwulu ama o mban ma ewo, nghaduu iYesu wo ma ola gbɛɛ nu ma ka nya inggisɛ onyi ungwɔ nkyɔ nɛ ba.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu dɔ ama ogbikyon iwyodefa esɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Onɔ ngwi iYesu kwu iwyodefa ntona kwakye nɛ, o kye mfye nu ma ikye nu ma lɔ ali itɔ onodzi ibwubwe onya di ngyɛlu ootse, <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>o di dɔ ma esɔ gbɛɛ nu ma gbeesɔ mgbi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho di ngyɛlu ama ndotse ootse. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ka kye unka byi mi okyɛɛ nɛ ba na, okwuta ba, igbe ba, ungwogye ba, awuya ba, angwuto kpaa ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ali udɛ ngwi ema kaka efu duu, dzɛ ele nghataa imbisɔ ngwi ema ka dzata igeli nani. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Ni inggisɛ gbɛ ema bayɔ, dzata igeli na di kye gbolu ombulu mi afɔ mgbi ema otso ambɛ adɔ okwookwo mboma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Ama okyɛ yi iYesu si lu kaka mi agwɔ udɛ yi agwɔ udɛ le gbɔ Esɔ Osuse nɛni dile ngyɛlu ibyi inggisɛ ootse mi ali imbe duu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Odzɛ kaka iHerude ewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Ngwi iHerude atɔtsɛ fwo odzɛ nle kiyayi nɛ, i si kakan ewo. Inggisɛ angbeka tole gbɛɛ iJɔn okyɔ iBatisima yɛ kyɛɛ mi ikwu. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Angbeka tole gbɛɛ oyegbɔ Elaija yidɔ wa, hona onyi mi oyegbɔ emi tugbe ntona diyɛ kyɛɛ mi ikwu. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Nghaduu iHerude gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani nu ma dzɛ iJɔn ikye! Ma li emɛ ngwu ani le fwo odzan kpakpa ngha?&gt;&gt; I mina iHerude kpakpa otsa inɛ yi iYesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu byi inggisɛ idubu eda enbwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Ama ogbikye iYesu si yidɔ wa nyan ungwɔ ngwi ama kyɔ duu. Man o kye ma daada lu yan mi igeli mgbi iBɛtsaida, <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>nghaduu ibyi inggisɛ ka difwi imbe ngwi a lu nɛman a si lukwun. O gbɛ ma di nya ma odzɛ mgbi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho, di ngyɛlu ama i wo ma gbɛɛ ni a ngyɛlu ma ootse duu.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Ngwi onɔ le ka gbɛsɛ nɛ, emi iwyodefa ntona ba mbi iYesu wa gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nu ijiji inggisɛ ntonɛ ofɛ, nu ma lu igeli yi ayɛsɛ mi agya nɛni. A mina imbe ngwi a ka la di tu ungwogye, ikyekyɛ imbe ngwi eyi dzɛ nɛ li imbe okplagada!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nu ma ungwɔ nu ma gye na.&gt;&gt; Kpaa a gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi dzɛ yi ibredi nghi eda bɛyi mmbweni efa ta. Ni eyi ka byi inggisɛ ntonɛ duu enbwa yɔ, sede eyi ka lu ka gyaagya ungwogye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>(A mɛ engyulɔ idubu eda sini.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Nghaduu iYesu nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nu ma sisɛ ibwi-ibwi mɛ mmbwo ngwusefa dɔn iwyo, ngwusefa dɔn iwyo hini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Engwafɔɔn kyɔ ngha yɛyɛ, ali inggisɛ duu sisɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>IYesu kyi kyelu ibredi bɛkɛ yi mmbweni ntona man kyile inɛ kɛ esho, o bibɔ di kye mwalu. Ta o kye nu ama okyɛ yan nu ma kye gha ma. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Ama duu gye di tolo, ambulu nsisi ma a kye gbelu mbwo uya nghi iwyodefa.<figure style="fig" alt="IYesu byi inggisɛ idubu eda enbwa" file="WA03856b.tif" size="col" loc="9;17" ref="9:17">The feeding of the five thousand</figure><verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɛ li iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Egbe oka ngwi iYesu dzɛ yuon le bibɔ nɛ, ama okyɛ yan to biyan man o byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ li gbɛɛ ani li emɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>A nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Angbeka gbɛɛ abu li iJɔn okyɔ iBatisima; angbeka gbɛɛ oyegbɔ Elaija; angbeka li gbɛɛ oyegbɔ oka tugbe yidɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Nghanɛ iYesu byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema ma ema gbɛɛ ani li emɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">IPyita nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li iKrestu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ongwu Imgbasho zondu gbɛɛ o ka wa dulu ɛsɛ watɔ mani.</char></note> mgbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>IYesu kwo ma adɔ kpakpa gbɛɛ nu ma ka nya inggisɛ onyi odzɛ nɛ ba.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gbɔdzɛ mi adzɛ yi odzɛ <optbreak/> ikwongye mgban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>IYesu si nya ama okyɛ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka gbiisɔ mi ungwɔ kwuba engyukwo yi ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ama otso ola mgbi iMose, ka ngwɔn kyɛmɛ-kyɛmɛ. Nghaduu mi egbe ongwu ta ma Imgbasho ka kyilen luba oshishe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Nɛ o nya ma duu gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ali inggisɛ nmina okyɛdɔ ani yɔ, li kyɛmɛ ngwi o ka tangwɛ ewon yɛ kyelu ekwatsi mgban kyɛdɔ ani alegbe-alegbe. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Ikyena ali inggisɛ nmina odulu oshishe mgban tɔ yɔ ka byulu lon, kpaa inggisɛ ngwu oshishe mgban byulu mi ikye mgbi ani yɔ, ka dulun tɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Li ali oyabɔ ngwi inggisɛ ka tu, ni otsungwɔn tu ɛsɛ duu kpaa oshishe mgban dzili? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Ni inggisɛ kwayiwi ani yi esɔ mgbi ani, Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka kwayiwi inggisɛ nani mi onɔ ngwi o yɛ mi okwɔkwɔ mgban bɛyi okwɔkwɔ mgbi Otsɔn Imgbasho bɛyi engyesɔ mgban ama osaan mani. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>N nya ema otsitsi, angbeka to mmɛnɛ nka di ikwongye inɛ ba nghataa ngwi a ka di esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwɔkwɔ mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Ngwi iYesu gbɔdzɛ ntonɛ nyɛ egbe egyata nɛta, o kyi kyelu iPyita bɛyi iJɔn yi iJɛnsi lu yan mi unggwɔ oka bibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Ngwi o kale bibɔ nɛ, inɛ mgban si kyata, angwuto mgban tundzɛ yɛ kwɔ dafi mmbwo onaabɔ mani. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Plɛ nɛta, engyulɔ efa: iMose yi Elaija, tɔ wita ogbɔdzɛ yi iYesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>A tɔ mi okwɔkwɔ ongwi esho sile gbɔdzɛ mgbi ikwu mgbi iYesu ndzɛ kwɛkwɛ ombwumbwo mi iJerosalin mani. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>IPyita yi angbeka si nuna lu byulu, onɔ ngwi a kyato nɛ, a di iYesu yi okwɔkwɔ mgban yi inggisɛ nghi efa toyan. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Dafi iMose yi Elaija wita olu nɛ, iPyita nya iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, i tishi ni eyi ki to mmɛnɛni! Ni eyi klɛ afu eta, onyi ikye abu, onyi ikye iMose, onyi ikye Elaija.&gt;&gt; (Nghaduu o ye odzɛ ngwi o le gbɔ ma ba.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Ngwi o kale gbɔdzɛ nɛ, akpa tɔ gbiiwulu tukwu ma; man ama okyɛ yi iYesu wimio dafi akpa wa tukwu ma mani. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Ta ela tɔ mi akpa na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li Ongwani, ongwu ani dulu-dulu; gadɔ mbon na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Ngwi ela na dede mata, iYesu si dzɛ mmana yuon. A kye ungwɔnɛ da, di nya inggisɛ onyi kpaa ungwɔ ngwi ama di mi onɔ na ba.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu lɔ onodzi ibwubwe tɔ <optbreak/> mbi ongwongyulɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Tegblifan, ngwi a tashulu mi unggwɔ nɛ ibyi inggisɛ wa tu iYesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Inggisɛ mi ifu ibyi kwu ela gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, ani gbabɔ nu abu kye inɛ byi ongwani, o li onyi kpokpo. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Onodzi obube li dzɛsin non le teela; o li dzɛkwulu li tsuuvu ondu. Ni kyɔn li fyumfye odzanta dile dzilin kpaa. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Ani gbabɔ nu engwafɔ mgbi abu gbɛɛ nu ma dulu onodzi na tɔ, kpaa a yagba ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>IYesu si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema etɔ ndzɛ yi oyɛyɛ onuunu ba dile kpɛkpɛ nɛ! Ka kye onɔ sinɛ ngwi ani ka dzɛ yi ema yi itukwu oshiishi?&gt;&gt; Man o nya inggisɛ na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kye ongwabu ma ba mmɛnɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Ngwi a kyon ba nɛ, onodzi obube na di kyon zudɔwɛsɛ o di dzɛkwulu fyumfye. IYesu fwa yi onodzi obube na, man o ngyɛlu ongwɛ na ootse di yilen nu otsɔn. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>I kwulu ali inggisɛ ewo mi ogbagbadzidzi mfye ngwi Imgbasho kyɔ nani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ngwi i kale kwulu ali inggisɛ ewo mi ungwɔ ngwi iYesu kyɔ duu nɛ, o nya ama okyɛ yan gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>&lt;&lt;Gadɔ mi odzɛ ngwi ani le gbɔ nya ema nɛni: A ka kye Ongwɛ Inggisɛ wo engyikyili mgban abɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Kpaa ama okyɛ yan kwu ambɛ odzɛ na ba. Itan da ma daada, nɛ a yagba difwi ba, imio kpaa di wo ma obyin ita.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Li emɛ shewo ngha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Angwodzɛ tɔ mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama okyɛ yi iYesu gbɛɛ li emɛ mboma shewo ngha. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>IYesu ye ungwɔ ngwi a le tsɛwɛ nɛta, o si kye ongbɛ kwulɛsɛ dzɛkɛ agya mgban. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ngbɛ itɔ ongwɛ nɛ mi iyi mgbi ani gbɛ ani; o di gbɛ inggisɛ ngwu ndɔ ani esɔ mani. Ikyena ongwu nghao yɛyikpa mi idzidzɛ ema duu ma nghao shewo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inggisɛ nfwa ema ba li mgbi ema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>IJɔn gbɔ nya iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, eyi di inggisɛ oka le dulu onodzi emɛsɛ mi iyi mgbi abu eyi fwa yan gbɛɛ non nya, ikyekyɛ o li onyi mbi eyi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka yama non nya ba, lubana inggisɛ nfwa ema bayɔ li mgbi ema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emi iBatlomi fwa iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Dafi onɔ wa dzɛ kwɛkwɛ ngwi a ka kye iYesu lu esho nɛ, o ngyɛlu odzɛ mi itukwu mgban si byi ofɛ abɔ le lu iJerosalin. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>O dɔ emi esɔ angbeka teyin, lu mi agwɔ oka mi iSamaria oka mɛlu alungwɔ duu le fan; <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>kpaa inggisɛ emi imbe na gban ba, ikyekyɛ o dzɛ yi oweka olu iJerosalin. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Onɔ ngwi iJɛnsi yi iJɔn di ungwɔnɛ nɛ, a gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, i mina abu gbɛɛ ni eyi kwu ola ela mi esho ba esɛ wa kye ma gyee?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Nghaduu iYesu kyata fwa yi ama, <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>ta a si lu agwɔ oka.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itɔdzɛ okyɛdɔ iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Dafi emi iYesu le lu ofɛ mgbi ama nɛ, ongyulɔ oka nya iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N ka kyɛdɔ abu ali imbe ngwi abu le kɛ duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Emi ogbalinya to yi ishɛ, ingwunɔ emi esho dzɛ yi udɛ, kpaa Ongwɛ Inggisɛ dzɛ yi imbe okye ikye da ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>O di nya inggisɛ oka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɛdɔ ani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Kpaa ongyulɔ ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ababɔ nu ani ofɛ nin ka gbinɛbyi otsani nghataa kyon ndzi se.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni emi ikwukwɔ ndzi ewoma, kpaa abu lu ka gbeesɔ mgbi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Inggisɛ oka di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N ka kyɛdɔ abu, Otsɛ; kpaa nin ka nya emidani gbɛɛ se egbe oka se.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>IYesu si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nkye abɔ byi ikwukwɔ oshookwɔ, wita oshookwɔ diyɛ le ndinɛ kɛ iyikpa yɔ, o mɛ unkonyi mi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu dɔ inggisɛ ngwuseta <optbreak/> dɔn iwyo diwyefa esɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Ta Otsɛ iYesu dulu inggisɛ ngwuseta dɔn iwyo diwyefa. Si dɔ ma esɔ efefa, nu ma teyi ongwu kɛ ali igeli bɛyi imbe ngwi ongwu ka wa kɛ duu. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Etɔ oshɛ-shɛ le kwuba, kpaa emi idɔ le gwee ta. Ema bibɔ mbi Otsɛ Imgbasho mgbi etɔ oshɛ-shɛ, non dɔ emi idɔ mgban esɔ nu ma wa shɛ etɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Lu na! Lubana ani le dɔ ema esɔ dafi engwɛ mmala mi ifu emi idukwlɛbɛ mani. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Ka kye ashiko naadi igbe okɛ agaba hona okpafɔ oka ba. Ka kwulɛsɛ mi ofɛ tangba yi inggisɛ ba na.<verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>&lt;&lt;Onɔ ngwi ema kaka udɛ inggisɛ yɔ, tsekise gbɔgbɛɛ, iyu mgbi Imgbasho no dzɛ udɛ nɛni. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Kini inggisɛ iyu dzɛ udɛ na yɔ, iyu mgbi Imgbasho ka kaka mbi otsungwɔn, kpaa ki no dzɛma ba, iyu mgbi Imgbasho ka yɛ luba mbi ema. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Ka kyikyɛ mi udɛ-udɛ ba na. La mbonyi, le gye, diyɛ wa alungwɔ ngwi a kye nu ema duu, lubana inggisɛ idɔ gyɔ ni a kpan.<verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>&lt;&lt;Ni ema kaka igeli, nu ma kyɔ ema onɔ yɔ, gye alungwɔ ngwi a kye nu ema duu. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Bwe ama ndotse to ele ma na, diyɛ nya ma gbɛɛ: &lt;Esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho dzɛ kwɛkwɛ yi ema.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Nghaduu, igeli nfwa ogbɛ ema yɔ, tasɛ lu ingɔfɛ ka gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>&lt;Ombulu ongwi ogalu mgbi ema nto eyi ka afɔ nɛ, eyi ka kye gbolu dafi ambɛ adɔ okwookwo mbi ema. Di ye na gbɛɛ esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho dzɛ kwɛkwɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>N nya ema gbɛɛ, mi egbe na ka tatase lo ogalu mgbi iSodon ngha ogalu nani.<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogalu ama nnoyɛyɛ ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>&lt;&lt;Ahoo! Abu ogalu mgbi iKoradzin yi abu iBɛtsaida; ema ka gyadzɛ. Ikyekyɛ ungwɔ okwulewo ongwi a kyɔ mbi ema nɛ, ki li mi ogalu mgbi iTiru yi iSidon yɔ, a ki kyatitukwu mi ali ibwubwe mgbi ama gbegbe, a ki kye ishangli wo ewo yɛ myini mi utɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Nghaduu ka tatase mbi iTiru yi iSidon mi egbe ikwɔ ngha ema. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Abu ogalu mgbi iKapenahun, a ka kyile abu esho wɛ? Ei, abu ka lu esɛ mi imbe mgbi emi ikwukwɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>IYesu si nya ama okyɛ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nfwo ema fwo ani. Ongwu nfwa ema fwa ani. Ongwu nfwa ani fwa Imgbasho ndɔ ani esɔ nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyɛɛyɛ mgbi emi ngwuseta <optbreak/> dɔn iwyo diwyefa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Emi ngwuseta dɔn iwyo-diwyo-efa ntona yidɔ yi atsa wa gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ iYesu, mi iyi mgbi abu emi onodzi emɛsɛ kpaa le sunu eyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N di iSatan gbɛsɛ kyɛ esho dafi mmbwo le naabɔ mani. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Ani tsekise kye mfye nu ema okye afɔ dzi ifa bɛyi mnaa odi ngha mfye mgbi ongyikyili mgbi ema, unkonyi kpaa ka kyɔ ema ba. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Nghaduu ka tsatsa na gbɛɛ di emi onodzi ibwubwe sunu ema ba. Kpaa, tsatsa ikyegbɛɛ a lɔ ema iyi mi esho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu tsatsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Mi onɔ na kpɔɔ iYesu mbwo yi atsa mi Onodzi Osaan, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani ta abu angba Otsani, Otsɛ mgbi esho yi esɛ, ikyekyɛ abu kye ungwɔ ntonɛ da ama ntsɛwɛ gbɛɛ di ama kwiinɛ diyɛ yodzɛ mani, kpaa abu kwulu iba nya ɛngbɛ. Ɛɛn, Otsani, li ngha ngwi i kpaa abu gbɛɛ no dzɛ aali.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>&lt;&lt;Otsani kye alungwɔ duu wo ani abɔ. Inggisɛ onyi ye ongwu nli Ongwɛ ba li Otsɔn ta, inggisɛ onyi kpaa di ye Otsɔn ba li Ongwɛ ta bɛyi ama ngwu Ongwɛ sadu okye Otsɔn tso ma mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Man iYesu kyata mbi engwafɔɔn ntona gbɔ yi ama daada gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mse no bɛ ama ndi ungwɔ ema di nɛ ewo! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>N nya ema gbɛɛ i mina ibyi oyegbɔ yi ibyi utɔ gbɛɛ ama ki di ungwɔ ngwi ema di nɛ, kpaa a di ba, odi fwo ungwɔ ngwi ema fwo nɛ, kpaa a yagba fwo ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi inggisɛ iSamaria osuse <optbreak/> ngwu ya inggisɛ oka abɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Onɔɔlɔlɔ ma inggisɛ oye ola mgbi iMose saan kyatunto ombadi iYesu, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, li alungwɔ ngwi ani ka kyɔ se ngwi ani ka tu oshishe igyegwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ &lt;&lt;Ola mgbi iMose gbɔsinɛ? Abu li gbɔn sinɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>O si nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɛ lɔ gbɛɛ: &lt;Otsɛ Imgbasho no kpa abu itukwu yi itukwu mgbi abu duu yi oshishe mgbi abu duu yi mfye mgbi abu duu yi oyeeye mgbi abu duu&gt;; di, &lt;Inggisɛ nwatse dɔ abu kpa abu itukwu dafi ewabu mani.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O gbɔ ayin; lu ka kyɔ ngha ta o ka dzɛ oshishe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Kpaa dafi o mina otso oye-ye mgban nɛ, o byi iYesu gbɛɛ &lt;&lt;Li emɛ li inggisɛ owatse dɔ ani?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>IYesu si nyan gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ iJuda oka kyɛ mi iJerosalin le kɛ iJeriko, o ka kaka abɔ emumyi ama ofofɛ. A gbon ibe di kyon angwuto mi ewo kye dulu dzanta lakɛ ofɛ le fyikwu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>I wa yɛɛ gbɛɛ inggisɛ ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho oka wa le nyɛ ofɛ na kpɔɔ, o di inggisɛ na ta, o nyɛ enggengga lu. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Inggisɛ iLevi nli kyidɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda kpaa kyɔ ngha, ngwi o di inggisɛ na nɛ, ongwu kpaa nyɛ enggengga lu. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ iSamaria oka nli ingyoga le kɛ agaba, o wa to imbe ngwi inggisɛ na ladzɛ, ngwi o din nɛ, elela kyɔn won kpakpa. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>O kɛ kwɛkwɛ yan, o san ifwa mi ewo kye otse yawon ele. O kyon dɔkɛ itaklimyi mgban kyon lu ozu ingyoga ka gbeka byun saan. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Tegblifan nɛ, o dulu udza nmɛ okpa idɔ egbe efa sini kye nu inggisɛ odi mi imbe ingyoga nani, o nyan gbɛɛ: &lt;Bwen saan, ni ani yɛ, ungwɔ ngwi abu mbe mi ikyon duu ni ngha ngha kpaa, n ka yilen kpaa abu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>IYesu byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mi idzidzɛ inggisɛ eta ntona li emɛ li inggisɛ owatse dɔ inggisɛ ongwu nkaka abɔ emumyi na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Inggisɛ oye ola na nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li inggisɛ ongwu ndin elela nani.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Lu ka kyɔ ngha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kaka udɛ iMata yi iMeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Dafi iYesu yi engwafɔɔn kye ikye dɔ le lu iJerosalin nɛ, o wa kaka agwɔ oka, ongyaa oka ngwu a li kwun di iMata gban kaka udɛ mgban. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>O dzɛ yi ongwunɔn ongwu ongyaa, iyin di iMeri, ngwu ka sɔkɛ iyayi Otsɛ iYesu le fwo elodzɛ mgban. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Kpaa i kaka iMata ewo kpakpa yi ungwɔ okyɔɔkyɔ nshewo ngwi ongwu ka kyɔ mani. O ba wa byi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, i kpa abu dafi ongwunani dzata idɔ duu tsaani abɔ nɛɛ? Ngyɛse nyan no wa tobyi ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Otsɛ nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IMata, iMata, i kaka abu ewo, eka di kplɔkɔ lo abu mi ungwɔ kwuba; <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>ungwɔ li onyi ta ndzɛ kyɛmɛ-kyɛmɛ. IMeri kye ayɛ ngwi nghao tishi, ngwi a ka kye gbɛlu mbon ba mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu tso ibɔ obɔɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Egbe oka nɛ, iYesu le bibɔ mi imbe oka. Mi onɔ ngwi o ngyɛlu ibɔ obɔɔbɔ nɛ, ongwafɔ mgban onyi ba mbon wa nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, tso eyi obibɔ dafi iJɔn tso engwafɔ mgban nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɔ ngwi ema ka bibɔ yɔ, gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;&lt; &lt;Otseyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">nu ma nu mmwɛ mi iyi mgbi abu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Ni esutɔ mgbi abu ba.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Nu eyi ungwogye mgbi eyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:3">ongwi alegbe-alegbe.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Dzɛ eyi ta yi ali ibwubwe mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">dafi eyi kpaa li dzata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">ama nkyɔ eyi obube mani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Dika kye eyi kaka igyila ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">kpaa dulu eyi tɔ mi obube.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>IYesu di nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li emɛ mbi ema ndzɛ yi uka, ka kɛ mbon mi idzidzɛ otu ka nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Okani, tobyi ani yi ibredi nghi eta; <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>ikyesinɛ okani oka dzagaba wa kaka mbi ani, ma n dzɛ yi unkonyi ngwi n ka kye non gye ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>&lt;&lt;Ma o nu uka mi ozu dzidzɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;Ka kaka ani ewo ba; onufozu tukwu, ɛngbɛ mgbi ani di lato yi ani mi akwulo. Nghanɛ n ka yagba kyato ba wa nu abu unkonyi ba.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>N nya ema, o ka kyato ba wa nun mi ikyegbɛɛ o li okan ba, kpaa mi ikyegbɛɛ o bɔ kyɔ ewewa ba, li ikyengha o ka kyato wa nun dafi o mina duu aali.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>&lt;&lt;N di nya ema: Bɔ na ta a ka nu ema, di pita na, ta ema ka tu; tsaabɔ na, ta a ka kwulu ema onufozu. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Lubana otsungwɔn nbɔ ka gbɛ. Ongwu npita ka tu. Ongwu ntsaabɔ, a ka kwulun ofɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>&lt;&lt;Li emɛ mbi ema etsɛngwɛ ngwu ongwan ka bɔn mmbweni, se o ka nun ifa gbikye mmbweni? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Naadi o bɔn akyogbi, ngwi o ka kye mnaa nun? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Ni ema emi ali ibwubwe ye onu ɛngbɛ mgbi ema umba osuse ma, ka kyɔnɛse Otsema ongwi esho ka nghao nu ama nbɔn Onodzi Osaan ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu yi utɔ mgbi emɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Egbe oka nɛ, iYesu lɔ ikplima emɛsɛ onya. Onɔ ngwi emɛsɛ na tɔ nɛ, inggisɛ ngwu onodzi emɛsɛ na non yɛɛ ikplima ma gbɔdzɛ, ta i kwulu ibyi inggisɛ ntona ewo. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Angbeka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IYesu lɔ emɛsɛ onya yi mfye mgbi iBɛdzɛbu ongwu nli ikye mgbi emɛsɛ nani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Angbeka le mbadin, a mina ambɛ ongwi esho mbon.<verse eid="LUK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>IYesu ye ewodzɛ mgbi ama nɛ, o nya ma gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ali esutɔ ngwi gbua mi ikyili yɔ, a ka bulu, udɛ ngwi di gha yi ewon ka bulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Ni iSatan kpaa gha yi ewon ma, ka kyɔsinɛse esutɔ mgban ka kwudzɛ? Lubana ema gbɛɛ ani lɔ emɛsɛ onya yi mfye mgbi iBɛdzɛbu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Kini ani lɔ emɛsɛ onya yi mfye mgbi iBɛdzɛbu ma, li mfye mgbi emɛ ngwi ɛngbɛ mgbi ema li lɔ emɛsɛ onya? Ngyɛse ɛngbɛ mgbi ema ka gbɔ ema ikwɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Kpaa ni li mi mfye mgbi Imgbasho ngwi ani lɔ emɛsɛ onya yɔ, esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ba mbi ema sewaani.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>&lt;&lt;Ni inggisɛ ndzɛ yi mfye di dzɛ yi okyiika, ngyo udɛ mgban yɔ, alungwɔ ngwi o dzɛyan duu ka dzɛ kyoon. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Nghaduu ni inggisɛ ndzɛ yi mfye nghan ba wa gblika yan yɔ, o ka nghan diyɛ gbɛlun okyiika ngwi o le tsaabɔ igɛgɛ yan mani, o dika kyi ghalu okwudɛ mgban yi inggisɛ angbeka.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi ani bayɔ, kye afɔ twɛsɛ yi ani. Ongwu ngbe ngwikwo yi ani bayɔ, le bulu-bulu.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>&lt;&lt;Onɔ ngwi onodzi emɛsɛ tɔ mbi inggisɛ, o li lu ivu le ka pita imbe otonya. Ki non tu imbe bayɔ, o li gbɛɛ; &lt;N ka yidɔ lu udɛ ani ogbugbe.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Non yɛ ba udan ogbugbe wa di a kyi mɛlu imbe ma dzɛkɛ saan yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>O li yɛ lu ka kwu emɛsɛ angbeka egyafa ama ntimbali nghan mani, a ka ba wa kaka sisɛ mi ele. Taman odzɛɛdzɛ mgbi inggisɛ na ka timbi nghaabɔ ogbugbe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Dafi iYesu le gbɔdzɛ le kɛ nɛ, ongyaa oka mi idzidzɛ ibyi inggisɛ ntona si kyile ela esho gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mse no dzɛ yi ifu ngwi mba abu, bɛyi abɛ ngwi abu ngha nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nghaduukpaa li inggisɛ nfwo elodzɛ mgbi Imgbasho di kyɔ mi ele yɛyɛ mani ka gbumse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ambɛ mgbi iJona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Dafi ibyi inggisɛ shili kye iYesu wo idzidzɛ nɛ, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li etɔ obube! O le mina ambɛ, kpaa o ka tu onyi ba sede ambɛ mgbi <char style="k">iJona</char> ta. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Dafi iJona li ambɛ mbi emi iNinive na, li ngha ngwi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka li ambɛ mbi etɔ nɛ aani. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Apodza ongwi <char style="k">aca</char> ka kye afɔ twɛsɛ yi inggisɛ emi etɔ nɛni mi egbe ikwɔ dika nu ma obube, lubana o kyɛ mbi ɛsɛ dondu owa fwo ozoyeye mgbi utɔ iSolomu, dinaa, ongwu nshewo ngha iSolomu dzɛ mmɛnɛni. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Inggisɛ emi iNinive kpaa ka kye afɔ twɛsɛ yi emi etɔ nɛni mi egbe ikwɔ diyɛ nu ma obube; ikyena a kyatitukwu mi onɔ ngwi a fwo elodzɛ ogbɔɔgbɔ mgbi iJona nani, ma onɛnɛ ongwu nshewo ngha iJona dzɛ aani.<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Osa mgbi ewo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ onyi nka kye ola dɔ se ka kye da di kye mgboko tukwu ele dzɛma ba. O ka kye fakɛ imbe ododa ngwi ali inggisɛ nkaka duu ka di osa mani. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Inɛ mgbi abu li ipitila mgbi ewo mgbi abu. Kini inɛ mgbi abu tishi yɔ, ewo mgbi abu duu ka mbwo yi osa. Kpaa kini inɛ mgbi abu tishi bayɔ, ewo mgbi abu kpaa dika mbwo yi iifu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Ikyenghanɛ, di gbɛɛ, osa ndzɛ mbi abu no ka li iifu ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Nghanɛ, kini ewo mgbi abu duu mbwo yi osa yi alewo onyi kpaa yifu bayɔ, ka mbwo yi osa dafi osa mgbi ipitila li nu abu osa nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu tsaafɔ mi ungwɔ mgbi <optbreak/> emi iFarasi yi ama otso ola <optbreak/> mgbi iMose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Ngwi iYesu ngyɛlu odzɛ ogbɔɔgbɔ nɛ, inggisɛ iFarasi wa bɔɔn gbɛɛ no ba wa gye ungwogye mi udɛ mgban; ta o ka sɔkɛ ogye ungwogye. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ iFarasi na, difwi gbɛɛ iYesu sabɔ mi odzɛɛdzɛ aletɔ mgbi ama ba ta, wita ogye ungwogye, nɛ i kwulun ewo.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Otsɛ iYesu si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ, ema emi iFarasi li sa ewo alubata yi inunggaa, kpaa mi idzidzɛ mgbi ema yɔ li mbwo yi nggwɔ yi imbali. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Ema ikwangha inggisɛ ntonɛ! Li ongwu nmɛ idzidzɛ ma, mɛ esɛ kpaa baa? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Nɛ nu emi adzɛ umba yi itukwu osaan na, ta alungwɔ duu ka dzɛ ema saan.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>&lt;&lt;Ahoo! Mi ikye ema emi iFarasi, ema li kye onyi mi ikye iwyo ongwi okwɔ mgbi ema duu mbwo yi ungwɔ dafi indzafɛ, atsubo, bɛyi ungwɔ angbeka kye nu Imgbasho. Kpaa ema li kyɔ inggisɛ ogye, Imgbasho di kpaa ema itukwu ba. Li ungwɔ ndzɛ imbisɔ ngwi ema ki tsekise kyɔ duuse angbeka ntona aali.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>&lt;&lt;Ahoo! Mi ikye ema emi iFarasi, li kpa ema osɔ imbe mmwɛ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda di nu ma le ta ema angba yi mmwɛ mi ifyidu.<verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>&lt;&lt;Ahoo! Mi ikye ema ama olɔɔlɔ yi emi iFarasi, emi ikpala, ema dzɛ dafi endzi ngwi ambɛ mgban byulu, ngwi inggisɛ li kyikyɛ nyɛ ele kpaa a li difwi ba mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Inggisɛ otso ola mgbi iMose oka nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, dafi ngwi abu gbɔ ungwɔ ntonɛ nɛ, eyi kpaa abu fya eyi ito.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ahoo! Mi ikye ema ama otso ola mgbi iMose, ikyekyɛ ema li gbe isɔ gwuba dɔ inggisɛ ikye kpaa ema li kye ongwufabɔ onyi gbo ele ikye oya ma abɔ ba.<verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>&lt;&lt;Ahoo! Mi ikye ema, ema mbɛ endzi mgbi ama ogbɛɛsɛ ngwu li emi otsikyema ngwɔ tugbe mani. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Nɛ ema tso gbɛɛ ungwɔ ngwi a kyɔ na li ayin; a ngwɔ ama ogbɛɛsɛ, ema di mbɛ ma endzi. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Mi ikyenghanɛ, Imgbasho mi ozoyeye mgban gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani ka dɔ ama ogbɛɛsɛ yi ama ogbikye ani esɔ mboma, angbeka a ka ngwɔ ma diyɛ nu angbeka adzɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Nghanɛ, etɔ nɛni a ka kwo ma adɔ mi ikwu mgbi ama ogbɛɛsɛ ngwu a ngwɔ mi owita-wita mgbi ɛsɛ nani. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Wita mi ikwu mgbi Ebɛl lu ka kaka ikwu iDzakaria, ongwu ma ngwɔn mi idzidzɛ ozu mgbi Imgbasho yi iwashi ofifɛ nani. N nya ema mi otsitsi, a ka kwo etɔ nɛ adɔ mi ungwɔ ntonɛ duu.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>&lt;&lt;Ahoo! Mi ikye ema ama otso ola, lubana ema kyi kyelu ungwɔ okwulu ofɛ mgbi ozoyeye mgbi Imgbasho. Ema abuema kpaa kaka ba, diyɛ noofɛ gbɛɛ ama nle kaka nu ma kaka ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Ngwi iYesu ngyɛlu odzɛ ntonɛ ogbɔɔgbɔ nɛ, o dzata imbe nani, nɛ emi iFarasi yi ama otso ola mgbi emi iJuda wita ole ban ibɛ di kyitingga gbɛɛ no gbɔdzɛ mi ungwɔ gwuba, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>zukwu ni ama tu ofɛ di nun obube mi odzɛ ama ntɔ mi ondu mbon nli ayin ba mani.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Adɔ okwookwo bɛyi okwu <optbreak/> inggisɛ ɛwɛ wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Ngwi inggisɛ idubu ibyibyi wa kwutokɛ mbonyi nɛ, a sile dzi ewoma afɔ, man iYesu wita ogbɔdzɛ ababɔ nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Kyɔ dumɔɔ yi otsootso mgbi emi iFarasi, ngwi li ɛwɛ nli gbɔfwɛ dafi okwuna mi ibredi nani. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Onɔ kyɛma ngwi alungwɔ ndzɛ mi odaada duu ka dɔ ododa, ungwɔ ngwi a di kye da duu a ka kye dɛɛsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Ungwɔ ngwi abu gbɔ mi iyifu a ka fwo mi osa, ungwɔ ngwi abu di gbɔn mi adɔ mi ifoozu idzidzɛ dika gbela tɔ mi ikyendu.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>&lt;&lt;N nya ema, emi okani, ka mio ama nka ngwɔ ikpewo ta ka kyɔ unka gbɛ wuba na ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Kpaa n ka tso ema ongwu ema ka mion mani: Mio ongwu, ki non kye ngwɔlu ikpewo, o di dzɛ yi mfye okye abu wokɛ imbe adzɛ nani. Ɛɛn, ani nya ema, mion na. <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>A li kye ifyilo nghi eda gya mi anini efa baa? Nghaduu ifyilo onyi kpaa Imgbasho gblimɔn ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Nghanɛ, otu mi ikye mgbi ema duu Imgbasho ye mmbwon. Ka mio ba na; ema ngha ifyilo ibyibyi.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>&lt;&lt;Ani nya ema, inggisɛ ta nkyɔ obwɛndɛ mgbi ani mi inɛ inggisɛ yɔ, <char style="k">Ongwɛ Inggisɛ</char> kpaa ka kyɔ obwɛndɛ mgban mi inɛ engyesɔ mgbi Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ ntangwɛ ani mi inɛ inggisɛ yɔ, ongwu kpaa Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka tangwan mi inɛ engyesɔ mgbi Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Ali inggisɛ ngbɔdzɛ obube mi ikye Ongwɛ Inggisɛ, a ka dzanta yi obube, kpaa ongwu nfya Onodzi Osaan ito yɔ, a ka dzanta ba.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>&lt;&lt;Onɔ ngwi a kye ema ba inɛ ikwɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda bɛyi inɛ emi atɔtsɛ bɛyi inɛ mgbi emi ola ma, no ka kaka ema ewo dafi ema ka na ewema naadi odzɛ ngwi ema ka gbɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Ikyena Onodzi Osaan ka nya ema odzɛ ngwi ema ka gbɔ mi onɔ na mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi ikwangha inggisɛ aludu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Inggisɛ oka mi ifu ibyi nya iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, nya ongwunani no kye ghalu okwudɛ ngwi otseyi dzanta nu eyi nɛ yi ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>IYesu si nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Okani, li emɛ nu ani mfye ogbiikwɔ naadi ogha ema okwudɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Ta o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbɛwɛbyi! Ngyo ewema mi ali ofɛ mgbi nggwɔ duu; oshishe mgbi inggisɛ dzɛ mi aludu mgban ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Man o nya ma utsa nɛ gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ikpɛsɛ mgbi inggisɛ udza oka tishi ungwogye. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>O tsɛwɛ mi itukwu mgban gbɛɛ, &lt;Li ekyɛ ngwi ani ka kyɔ? Ani dzɛ yi imbe ngwi ani ka gbe ungwogye mgbi ani to ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>&lt;&lt;Nɛ o gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;Li ungwɔ ani ka kyɔ aani. N ka kye bulu emi oba mgbi ani yidɔ mbɛ ama okwukwo, man ani ka gbe ungwogyowe yi okye mgbi ani duu da mi efu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Ta n ka nya ewen gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu dzɛ yi ungwɔ osuse kwuba to nka kye onova ibyibyi. Yile itukwu bɛsɛ; gye, wa diyɛ dzɛ yi atsa.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>&lt;&lt;Kpaa Imgbasho nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Abu ikwangha nɛ! Mi otu inɛ nɛni n ka mina oshishe mgbi abu mbi abu. Nɛ li emɛ ka kye gbelu ungwɔ ngwi abu gbe to ikye ewabu nɛ?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>&lt;&lt;Li ngha nka dzɛ yi ali inggisɛ ngbe ungwɔ to ikye ewon kpaa li aludu mbi Imgbasho ba aali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">No ka kaka ema ewo ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Ta iYesu nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Nghanɛ ani nya ema, no ka kaka ema ewo mi oshishe mgbi ema ba, ungwɔ ngwi ema ka gye, naadi mi ikye ewo mgbi ema, ungwɔ ngwi ema ka wo. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Oshishe ngha ungwogye, ewo di ngha angwuto. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Di emi ajaglama: A li kya naadi shɛ ba, a dzɛ yi ozu hona oba okye ungwɔ da ba, nghaduu Imgbasho li byi ma enbwa. Ema dzɛ yi oyabɔ ngha ingwunɔ duu! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Li emɛ mbi ema mi itukwu oshanyɛ mgban ka yagba ombwo obyi onyi mi oshishe mgban? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Ma ni itukwu oshanyɛ ka yagba ngyɛlu ungwɔ ogyɛngyɛ ngha ba wali, oyabɔ li ekyɛ onu ewema itukwu shanyɛ mi ungwɔ angbeka?<verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>&lt;&lt;Di dafi onggangga oshɛ li she mani. A li kyidɔ naadi gbo ewoma angwuto ba. Nghaduu <char style="k">iSolomu</char> mi okwɔkwɔ mgban nose wewo tishi dafi onyi mbi onggangga ntonɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Ni li ngha ngwi Imgbasho li nu oshɛ mi okwɔ ngwi dzɛ inɛ, ekeka a ka kye toola sunse ma, ka kyɔsinɛse ngwi o ka nghao kye inɛ byi ema ba? Ema ngwu oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi ema shanyɛ ntonɛni! <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Nghanɛ, no ka kaka ema ewo mi ungwɔ ngwi ema ka gye naadi wa ba; dika dzɛ yi angwodzɛ mi itukwu kpaa ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Bana li ama n ye Imgbasho ba li kyɛdɔ ungwɔ ntonɛni, ma Otsema ye dafi ema mina ungwɔ ntonɛ mani. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Nghaduu pita esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ababɔ, ta a ka gbe ungwɔ ntonɛ duu mbwo ema kɛ ele.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>&lt;&lt;Ka mio ba na, engwafɔ ama okpa ani itukwu, ikyena i mina Otsema okye esutɔ nu ema. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Gbelu ungwɔ ngwi ema dzɛyan duu gya kye udza gha emi adzɛ. Ema ka tu ungwɔ ama osuse nka li gyegwu, aludu mi esho nka ngyɛ ba, imbe ngwi emumyi ka ba kwɛkwɛ naadi ikwukwu ka kye gye ba mani. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Lubana imbe ngwi aludu mgbi ema dzɛma, li mmana ngwi itukwu mgbi ema kpaa li dzɛ aali.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ongyo le fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>&lt;&lt;Wewo okyidɔ di nu ipitila mgbi ema le gbɛ, <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>dafi engbidɔ tole fɛ oyɛɛyɛ mgbi ongyukwo mgbi ama mi eba okwokyiikwokyi, ikyegbɛɛ non yɛ wa tsaabɔ ta a ka kwulun ofɛ vla mani. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Ka sunse mbi engbidɔ onɔ ngwi ongyukwo yɛ tu ma le ngyo mani. N nya ema otsitsi, ongwu abuon ka wewo gbe ma sisɛ kye oga nu ma gye. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Ka sunse mbi engbidɔ ama ngwu ongyukwo mgbi ama wa tu ma wewo mani, yeba non ba mi idzidzɛ otu naadi mi ikyegbe kpaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Kpaa difwi odzɛ nɛni: Ni otsungwɔ ozu ki ye onɔ ngwi emumyi ka ba yɔ, o kika non gbobun ozu kaka ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Ema kpaa li kyɛmɛ ngwi ema ka wewo, ikyekyɛ Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka ba mi obyi ngwi ema gbinɛbyi ma ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>IPyita byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, abu le gbɔ utsa nɛ nya eyi yueyi naadi li ali inggisɛ duu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Otsɛ iYesu si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li emɛ li ongbidɔ oyɛyɛ di kwiinɛ? Li ongwu ngbeka byi ungwɔ, ngwi ongyukwo kyon dzɛkɛ ikye ogbinɛbyi engbidɔ mgban onu ma ungwogye mi onɔ nwogyɔ mani. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Ka tishi mbi ongbidɔ ngwu ongyukwo mgban wa tun le kyɔ ngha mi onɔ ngwi o yɛ mani. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>N nya ema otsitsi, o ka kyon dzɛkɛ ogbinɛbyi ungwɔ mgban duu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Nghaduu ni ongbidɔ na nya ewon gbɛɛ, &lt;Ongyukwo mgbi ani le kye onɔ tunto oyɛɛyɛ,&gt; man wita ogbo engyulɔ yi engyiidɔ ibe dile gye yɛ wa fya yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Ongyukwo mgbi ongbidɔ na ka yidɔ mi egbe ngwi o kye inɛ byi ma ba bɛyi obyi ngwi o ye ba. O ka non gyisɔ kpakpa di kyon dzɛkɛ imbe mgbi ama onghaadɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>&lt;&lt;Ongbidɔ ongwu n ye ungwɔ ngwi ongyukwo mgban mina, kpaa wewo ba di kyungwɔ ma bayɔ, a ka gbon onitse kwuba. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Nghaduu ongwu n ye ba di kyungwɔ ngwi li oyɛyɛ ba, a ka gbon onitse gwee. Mbi ali inggisɛ ngwu a nun kwuba a dika mina kwuba mbon; ongwu a di nun dzii a dika pita mbon dzii.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu ba yi ogbua-gbua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>&lt;&lt;Ani ba ɛsɛ nɛ yi ola, ma dafi i dzɛ ani ma kile gbɛ kpaa wa! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Kpaa ani dzɛ yi iBatisima mgbi isɔ ngwi ani ka wa kaka ele, ma n ka gyisɔ ongwi itukwu nghataa se ka wa ngyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Ema tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ ani ba owa kye iyu ba ɛsɛɛ? Ei, n nya ema, li ogha inggisɛ yi ewoma. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>I wita onɛnɛ nghataa lu iyayi inggisɛ ka li eda mi etɔ onyi a ka gbua yi ewema, eta ka kye afɔ twɛsɛ yi efa, efa dika kye afɔ twɛsɛ yi eta. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>A ka wa gha yi ewoma, otsɔngwɛ yi ongwan ongyulɔ, ongwongyulɔ yi otsɔn, onɔngwɛ yi ongwan ongwu ongyaa, ongwongyaa yi onɔn, onobongyaa yi owongwaan, owongwɛ yi onoban.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Odifwi onɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Nɛ iYesu nya ibyi inggisɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɔ ngwi ema di akpa tseto mi onosa, mi onɔ nata ema li gbɛɛ, &lt;Mmbwo ka wa kya,&gt; man di li kya. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Ma onɔ ngwi awo ongwi agwudu wa fa, ema li gbɛɛ, &lt;Imbe ka wa dziwu,&gt; man di li dzɛ ngha. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Ema emi ikpala ntonɛ! Ema ye onu osa mi odzɛɛdzɛ mgbi ɛsɛ bɛyi akpa mi esho. Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema ye onu osa mi odzɛɛdzɛ ongwi onɛnɛ wuba?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>&lt;&lt;Kyɔnɛ ngwi ema fwikwɔ abuema mi ungwɔ nli ayin wuba? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ni abu le kɛ opiikwɔ yi ongyikyili mgbi abu yɔ, fya kpakpa ni abu yile ide gye yan mi ofɛ, ni abu kyɔ ngha ba, a ka kwo abu ba inɛ inggisɛ ogbiikwɔ, ongwu nka kye abu wo obaka abɔ, ta a sika kye abu wokɛ obawi. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>N nya abu, o ka tasɛ ba nghataa imbisɔ ngwi abu ka kpa anini mgbi abu ongwi olɛlɛ ngwi a wo abu mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kyatitukwu hona dzili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Mi onɔ nani, inggisɛ angbeka to imbe na nnya iYesu gbɛɛ di iPlatu ngwɔ emi iGalalia angbeka ni eyi mgbi ama takye yi ifɛ ngwi a le fɛ mani. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>IYesu si nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ emi iGalalia ngwu a ngwɔ ma ngha na nghao li emi ali ibwubwe ngha emi iGalalia angbeka ntonaa? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Ei, li ngha ba! Kpaa n nya ema, ni ema kyata mi ali ibwubwe mgbi ema bayɔ, ema ka kwulu dafi ama kpaa kwulu nani. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Inggisɛ iwyodegyata ama nkwulu onɔ ngwi ozu oshigbo mi iSilon gbobu si ma na ma, ema tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ a kyɔ obube ngha angbeka ama nto iJerosalin naa? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Ei, li ngha ba! Nghaduu n nya ema, ni ema kyata mi ali ibwubwe mgbi ema bayɔ, ema kpaa ka wa dzili duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi andundu ogyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Ta iYesu nya ma utsa nɛ gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ oka nose kye ekwɔ ngwi a li kwun di andundu kye ye mi okwɔ mgban. O li ka kpadi gbɛɛ, ni i wa owawa yɔ, kpaa o li tu ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Nɛ o nya inggisɛ nle ngyo okwɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;I mɛ onova eta ngwi ani le ba wa kpadi ekwɔ nɛ gbɛɛ ni ani tu awawa mi ele, kpaa n tu ba. Kye dzɛ ngwuta! Kyɔsinɛ ngwi o le tukwu imbe?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>&lt;&lt;Nghaduu inggisɛ ongyo okwɔ nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;Ongyukwo, di dzanta onova onyi; n ka tishɛ nyɛ ewon gbe ibwa yawon. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Ki non wa owawa onova nkyɛ nɛ, tishi! Ni li ngha bayɔ, kye dzɛ ngwuta.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kyile ongyaa ngbikye <optbreak/> mi egbe otonyidɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>IYesu le tsungwɔ mi egbe otonyidɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda oka, <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>man ongyaa oka dzɛ imbe na ngwu onodzi obube non dotse fulu mɛ onova iwyodegyata, o kilɛ li yagba zunto kpaakpa gbɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Ngwi iYesu din nɛ, o kwun ela ba iyayi si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyaa, a shɛ abu adita mi ootse mgbi abu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>O kye abɔ gbon, labɔlabɔ nɛta, o si kyato dzɛkunto kpaakpa man le tsɛ Imgbasho.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Itingga kyɔ inggisɛ okye okwakye teyi gbɛɛ di iYesu ngyɛlu ootse mi egbe otonyidɔ, o si nya inggisɛ ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ali ikyidu dzɛ yi egbe egyin ngwi eyi ka kyidɔ, nghanɛ ba mi egbe ntonɛni, ni a ngyɛlu ema ootse, kpa no ka li egbe otonyidɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Otsɛ iYesu nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema emi ikpala ntonɛ! Ali inggisɛ mgbi ema li kyi shɛlu mnda naadi itaklimyi mgban mi ifatoba kyen ka weni mi egbe otonyidɔ baa? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Nghanɛ ongyaa nɛ kyɛ mi etɔ mgbi Abrahan, kpaa iSatan bwan adi mɛ onova iwyodegyata. Wanɛ i tishi gbɛɛ nu ma shan adi mi egbe otonyidɔ ba naadi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Ngwi iYesu gbɔdzɛ nɛ nɛ, ayiwi kwu engyikyili mgban. Kpaa inggisɛ ntona duu i kpa ma mi ungwɔ okwulewo ngwi o le kyɔ nani.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi inɛnɛ nkwodzi bɛyi okwuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Nɛta iYesu byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho nɛ dzɛ sinɛ? Li ekyɛ ngwi ani ka kye mba yan? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Dzɛ dafi inɛnɛ nkwodzi, ngwi inggisɛ kye ka fwe mi okwɔ mgban. I she yɛɛ ekwɔ, ingwunɔ li ludɛ mi abɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>IYesu di byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li alungwɔ ngwi ani ka kye esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho mba yan? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Dzɛ dafi ongyaa kye okwuna tablikyi yi ofumbu nshe mi ikpɔkpɔ di bwuo ewon kpatsɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onufɛ okpenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Ta iYesu nyɛ igeli-igeli bɛyi agwɔ emi oshɛ le tsungwɔ ngwi o le lu iJerosalin mani. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Inggisɛ oka byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, li inggisɛ gwee ta ka watɔɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">O nya ma gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>&lt;&lt;Fya mi ofyaafya mgbi ema ni ema kaka mi onufɛ okpenge nani, ikyena inggisɛ kwuba ka fya gbɛɛ nu ma kaka esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho nghaduu a ka yagba ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Otsungwɔ ozu ka kyato yile onufɛ tukwu, ema ka tila to esɛ le tsaabɔ yɛ gbaabɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;Kwulu eyi onufɛ, ongyukwo!&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">&lt;&lt;Nghaduu o ka nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani ye ema hona ye imbe ngwi ema tɔkyɛ ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>&lt;&lt;Ta ema ka gbɛɛ, &lt;Eyi gye diyɛ wa yi abu, abu di tso mi igeli mgbi eyi kpaa!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>&lt;&lt;Nghaduu o dika gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani ye ema naadi imbe ngwi ema tɔkyɛ ba. Lu enggengga mbi ani na, ema emi ali ibwubwe ntonɛni!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>&lt;&lt;Akwɔ omaama bɛyi aba ogyeegye ka dzɛ imbe nani, onɔ ngwi ema di Abrahan yi Adziki yi iJeko bɛyi ama ogbɛɛsɛ duu mi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho kpaa ema abuema a ka kye ema ngwuta lu esɛ mani! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Ibyi inggisɛ ka kyɛ mi onosa yi onɔdɛ, bɛyi aca yi agwudu, dika wa sɔ oga mi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Nghanɛ emi olɛlɛ ka yɛɛ emi ababɔ, emi ababɔ dika yɛɛ emi olɛlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu tsukwu ikye iJerosalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Mi onɔ na emi iFarasi angbeka ba mbi iYesu wa nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dzata imbe nɛ lu imbe oka. IHerude mina ongwɔ abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>IYesu si nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɛ ka nya ogbalinya na gbɛɛ, &lt;N ka dulu emɛsɛ di ngyɛlu ibyi inggisɛ ootse inɛ yi ekeka mi egbe ongwu ta ma, n ka ngyɛlu idɔ mgbi ani.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Nghaduu n ka byi ofɛ mgbi ani abɔ inɛ yi ekeka yi egbetanɛ, lubana i tishi gbɛɛ nu ma ngwɔ oyegbɔ mi imbe oka ba li mi iJerosalin ta.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>&lt;&lt;Ekyi, iJerosalin, iJerosalin, abu nngwɔ ama ogbɛɛsɛ di tsɛ ama ngwu a dɔ ma esɔ mbi abu akwutsɛ, dafi ani gbili okye emi ongwabu kwakye yi eka, dafi onogbi li kwulu engwaan wokɛ asha, kpaa ema nu ani ofɛ ba! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Dika, a dzita udɛ mgbi ema yɛɛ okwudɛ waana. N le nya ema, ema ka di ani wuba nghataa sede ni ema wa gbɛɛ, &lt;Ogbumse li ongwu nba mi iyi mgbi Otsɛ Imgbasho se.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kɛ udɛ inggisɛ iFarasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Egbe otonyidɔ oka nɛ, iYesu kɛ le ka gye oga mi udɛ mgbi inggisɛ iFarasi imɔ oka, a si kye inɛ fyakwun. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Nɛta inggisɛ oka ngwu afɔ yi abɔ weeni ba mbi iYesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Nɛ iYesu byi ama otso ola mgbi iMose bɛyi emi iFarasi ita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ola mgbi eyi noofɛ ongyɛlu ootse mi egbe otonyidɔ naadi i nu ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Kpaa a dede shilididi. Ta iYesu byi inggisɛ na abɔ, man o ngyɛlun ootse di dzanta non lu.<verse eid="LUK 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>IYesu si byi emi iFarasi ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni onyi mbi ema dzɛ yi ongwɛ naadi mnda ngbɛsɛ wokɛ ibuga mi egbe otonyidɔ ma, o ka dulun tɔ plɛ lo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Nghaduu a yagba nu uka ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gbɔdzɛ mgbi ewo oyile esɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Ngwi iYesu difwi dafi ama nba oga ntonɛ le sadu imbe mmwɛ abuoma nɛ, o nya ma utsa nɛ gbɛɛ: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>&lt;&lt;Ni inggisɛ bɔ abu oga mgbi eba okwokyiikwokyi yɔ, ka sisɛ mi imbe mmwɛ ba. Ikyayina inggisɛ oka nshewo ngha abu kpaa a bɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Ni li ngha, inggisɛ nbɔ ema ma, ka ba wa nya abu gbɛɛ, &lt;Ni abu kye itse mgbi abu nu inggisɛ nɛni.&gt; Ta abu ka tu ayiwi yɛ ka sɔkɛ imbe okwushanyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Nghaduu, nu ma bɔ abu oga yɔ, lu ka sɔkɛ imbe ngwi yɛ esɛ tsatsadu mani, ni inggisɛ nbɔ abu wa nya abu gbɛɛ, &lt;Kyato, okani, lu itse ntatase nani.&gt; Ta abu ka dzɛ yi mmwɛ mi inɛ mbi ama ngwu a bɔ ma ntonani. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Lubana ali inggisɛ nkyile ewon esho duu a ka yilen esɛ. Kpaa ongwu n yile ewon esɛ, a ka kyilen esho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Ta iYesu si nya inggisɛ nbɔɔn oga na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni abu kyɔ oga mi onɔ naadi onɔnɔdɛ, ka bɔ emi okaabu ba naadi emi ongwunabu naadi odo abu hona emi aludu ama nwatse dɔ abu ba; ikyena a ka yidɔ bɔ abu ikye oyilen kpaa abu mkpaa. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Ni abu kyɔ oga yɔ, bɔ emi adzɛ, yi ama ngbikye tukwu esɛ, yi ama ntummya, yi ama nbinɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>ta Imgbasho ka kye mse bɛ abu ewo. Ikyekyɛ a ka yagba kpa abu mkpa gbɛ ba, Imgbasho ka yilen kpa abu mi egbe ngwi emi osaan ka kyato mi ikwu mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi andɛfɛ oga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Onɔ ngwi inggisɛ onyi mbi ama nsɔto oga biyan fwo odzɛ nɛ nɛ, o nya iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nka sɔ oga mi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ka gbumse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ oka nose le kyɔ andɛfɛ oga si bɔ inggisɛ kwuba. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Ngwi onɔ oga ma wa gyɔ nɛ, o dɔ ongye ogbɛsɔ mgban gbɛɛ no kɛ ka nya ama ngwu ongwu bɔ ma gbɛɛ, &lt;Ba na, lubana alungwɔ duu ngyɛ le fɛ-fɛ wa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>&lt;&lt;Kpaa ama duu wita o nu itɔdzɛ idzidza-dzidza. Ongwu ababɔ nya ongye ogbɛsɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani gya ikpɛsɛ, ma li kyɛmɛ ngwi ani ka ka kpadi. N tɛkyɛ nu abu, nu ani ofɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>&lt;&lt;Oka gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani gya mnda efefa imbe eda, n kwa le ka mbadi ma aani. Tsuutsu nu ani ofɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>&lt;&lt;Oka di gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani kwa kye ongyaa ofufɛ, nghanɛ n ka yagba kɛ ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>&lt;&lt;Ongye ogbɛsɔ nɛ yidɔ ka nya ongyukwo mgban odzɛ ntonɛ duu. Ta otsungwudɛ nyɛ yi itingga kpakpa man wo ongye ogbɛsɔ mgban ola gbɛɛ, &lt;Lu emi ingɔfɛ plɛ bɛyi emi abɔfɛ mgbi igeli ka gbe emi adzɛ yi ama ntummya yi ama nbinɛ yi ama ngbikye tukwu esɛ duu ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>&lt;&lt;Ongye ogbɛsɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;Ongyukwo, ola ngwi abu wo na ani kyɔ mi ele wa, kpaa imbe ka dzɛ mi ikye inggisɛ angbeka.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>&lt;&lt;Nghanɛ ongyukwo nya ongye ogbɛsɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;Tasɛ lu emi onɔɔfɛ bɛyi ayɛ ofɛ ka bɔ ali inggisɛ ngwu abu di duu nu ma ba, zukwu ni udɛ mgbi ani mbwo. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>N nya ema, inggisɛ ama ngwu ani plɛ bɔ ma ntona onyi kpaa ka ta oga mgbi ani kpanɛ ba!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itɔdzɛ onu abu li ongwafɔ mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Ibyi inggisɛ wafɔ yi iYesu le kɛ, man o kyata nya ma gbɛɛ: <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ntangwɛ otsɔn yi onɔn, owan yi ɛngbɛ mgban, emi ongwunɔn engyulɔ yi engyaa naadi oshishe mgban bayɔ, o ka li ongwafɔ mgbi ani ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Inggisɛ ndi kye ekwatsi mgban kyɛdɔ ani bayɔ, o ka li ongwafɔ mgbi ani ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>&lt;&lt;Ni i dzɛ gbɛɛ onyi mbi ema mina o mbɛ ozu oshigbo yɔ, o ka plɛ sisɛ kyɔ mmbwo mi ungwɔ ngwi i ka kyen ombɛ ozu ma ngyɛ baa? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Bana ki non wo itozu kpaa di yagba ngyɛlu bayɔ, ali inggisɛ ndi duu ka shan isha <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>gbɛɛ, &lt;Amu nɛ kwaabɔ ombɛɛmbɛ kpaa yagba ngyɛlu ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>&lt;&lt;Naadi li ali utɔ nle ka gblika yi utɔ oka. Ka tsekise sisɛ tsɛwɛ ki non ka yagba yi engyilika nghi idubu iwyo oka gblika yi utɔ ndzɛ yi engyilika nghi idubu osu ba? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Non ka yagba ba, o ka dɔ ama ogbɛsɔ mgban nu ma ka yile ide gye ngwu ma ka dzɛ mbombo yi ama mani. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Nghanɛ, inggisɛ mgbi ema ta nkye alungwɔ mgban duu nu ba, o ka li ongwafɔ mgbi ani ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>&lt;&lt;Mmwaa tishi, kpaa ni mmwaa fyumfya wuba ma, a ka kyɔsinɛse non di fyumfya dafi mmwaa? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Dika tishi mi ikpɛsɛ naadi ogbagye ibwa wuba; a ka kye yangwuta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ yɔ, otsungwɔn no fwo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi mmala nbyulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Egbe oka nɛ, ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ bɛyi emi ali ibwubwe wa kwakye ikye ofwo iYesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Nghaduu emi iFarasi bɛyi ama otso ola mgbi iMose wita okwondukwɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nɛ gbela yi emi ali ibwubwe diyɛ le gye ungwogye yi ama kpaa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Nɛ iYesu nya ma utsa sini: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>&lt;&lt;Ni inggisɛ oka mbi ema dzɛ yi mmala nghi ideli onyi ma onyi byulu mi efu, li ekyɛ ngwi o ka kyɔ? O ka dzata ngwusenɛ dɔn iwyo diwyegyanɛ ntona mi imbe ododa lu ka pita onyi nbyulu na nghataa se non tuun baa? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Onɔ ngwi o ka tuun ma, o ka tsatsa kye dɔkɛ olubɔ <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>le lu udɛ. Non wa to udɛ, o ka kwu emi okan bɛyi ama nwotsuudɛ dɔn ela gbɛɛ, &lt;Tsatsa yi ani na; ikyekyɛ ani ka tu mmala nbyulu ma wa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>N nya ema gbɛɛ mi itɔ ofɛ nɛ kpɔɔ atsa ka dzɛ esho kwuba mi ikye inggisɛ alobube onyi nkyata luba mbi Imgbasho ngha inggisɛ ama osaan ngwusenɛ dɔn iwyo diwyegyanɛ ngwu mina okyata ba ntonani.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi anini nbyulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>&lt;&lt;Naadi ni ongyaa dzɛ yi anini nghi iwyo onyi byulu mi ele ma o ka kyɔsinɛ? O ka kye ipitila dɔ kyi waalu ozu di pita yi ɛwɛ ogbebyi nghataa se non di baa? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Onɔ ngwi o ka tu ma, o ka kwu emi okan bɛyi ama nwotsuudɛ dɔn ela gbɛɛ, &lt;Tsatsa yi ani na ikyekyɛ ani ka tu anini nbyulu ma wa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Mi itɔ ofɛ nɛ kpɔɔ, n nya ema, atsa ka dzɛ mi inɛ engyesɔ mgbi Imgbasho mi ikye inggisɛ alobube onyi nkyatitukwu mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi ongwɛ nbyulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>IYesu di kiyayi gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ oka nose dzɛ yi engwengyulɔ nghi efa. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Ongwu ongbungbɛ nya otsɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;Otsani, kye okwudɛ ndzɛ mi ikye mgbi ani ma nu ani.&gt; Nɛ otsɔn si kye ghalu okwudɛ nu engwaan efa ntonani.<verse eid="LUK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>&lt;&lt;Egbe nyɛ gwee ta, ongwan ongwu ongbungbɛ si kye gbelu alungwɔ mgban. O kyato lu ɛsɛ mbombo mi imbe na ma, o kye mbelu awuya mgban duu mi oshishe ayayi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Onɔ ngwi o kye mbelu alungwɔ duu nɛ, okɔtɔndzi enbwa kaka ɛsɛ na duu, man o yɛɛ abubɔ yi unkonyi ogyeegye ba. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Nɛ o kɛ oka kyɔ inggisɛ oka idɔ mi ɛsɛ nani, inggisɛ na kyon dɛsɔ lu okwɔ mgban oka kye inɛ byun obyia. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>O mina gbɛɛ ongwu ki gye ungwogye ngwi obyia ntona le gye mani, kpaa inggisɛ nun unkonyi non gye ba.<verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>&lt;&lt;Mi onɔ ngwi o wa yile itukwu bɛsɛ nɛ, o gbɔ yi ewon gbɛɛ, &lt;Mi udɛ, ama okyɔ otsani idɔ kpaa a dzɛ yi ungwogye ogyeegye gyɔloma, ma mmɛnɛ ani le kwulu enbwa! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>N ka yɛ lu udɛ mbi otsani ka nyan gbɛɛ: Otsɛn, ani kyɔ Imgbasho obube yi abu. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Nghanɛ ani mɛ gyɔ ngwi a ka kwu ani gbɛɛ ongwabu wuba; nu ani yɛɛ dafi emi idɔ mgbi abu mani.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Man o kyato yɛ lu mbi otsɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">&lt;&lt;Nghaduu ngwi o ka kyɛ mbombo mani, otsɔn din ta elela kyɔn won; o tsinya ka tsɛkwulu ongwan, si kwokyi ondu yan.<verse eid="LUK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>&lt;&lt;Ongwan si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Otsɛn, ani kyɔ Imgbasho obube yi abu, nghanɛ ani mɛ ngwi a ka kwu ani di ongwabu wuba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>&lt;&lt;Kpaa otsɔn kwu ongbidɔ mgban ela gbɛɛ, &lt;Vla! Ka kye angwuto ntishi ngha mi ozu kye wa won. Kye ongwashi won ongwufabɔ yi okpafɔ won afɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Lu ka kye andɛfɛ mnda ongyulɔ wa ngwɔlu ni eyi gye di tsatsa. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Ikyena ongwani nɛ kwulu kpaa onɛnɛ o dzɛ oshishe; o byulu kpaa onɛnɛ a din.&gt; Ta a wita oga.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>&lt;&lt;Mi onɔ na, ongwan ongwu ongyukwo nose dzɛ okwɔ. Ngwi o yɛ wa to ondu udɛ nɛ, o fwo ungwɔ ogboogbo yi ifwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Nghanɛ o si kwu ongbidɔ oka ela byun gbɛɛ, &lt;Li alungwɔ le kiyayi?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>O nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;Ongwunabu yidɔ luba udɛ, otsabu kye ngwɔlu andɛfɛ mnda ikyekyɛ o yɛ ise.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>&lt;&lt;Ongwunɔn ongwu ongyukwo si kyitingga kpakpa gbɛɛ ongwu ka kaka udɛ wuba. Otsɔn tasɛ wa tɛkyɛ nun gbɛɛ non kaka. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Kpaa o nu otsɔn uka gbɛɛ, &lt;Di! Onova ntonɛ duu ani kyɔ abu idɔ dafi ofyɛɛ mani, ma akponyi kpaa ani ngha abu adɔ ye ba. Nghaduu abu nu ani ongwɛ mndɔ kpaa gbɛɛ nin kyɔ oga yi emi okɛɛn ba! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Kpaa onɔ ngwi ongwabu nɛ kye mbelu ungwɔ mgbi abu duu yi owagbai engyaa yɛ luba udɛ nɛ, abu ngwɔn andɛfɛ mnda!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>&lt;&lt;Otsɔn si nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;Ongwani, abu dzɛ yi ani alonɔ duu, ma alungwɔ ngwi ani dzɛyan duu li mgbi abu. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Nghaduu dzɛ mbisɔ ngwi eyi ka gye oga di tsatsa, ikyekyɛ ongwunabu kwulu, kpaa onɛnɛ o dzɛ oshishe; o byulu kpaa onɛnɛ a din.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Ongyukwo idɔ okwiinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>IYesu nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ udza oka nose dzɛ o dzɛ yi ongyukwiidɔ ngwu kye inɛ le byun udza. Ta a kwu ongyukwiidɔ nɛ elikwɔ mbi otsungwudɛ mgban gbɛɛ o le gyon awuya. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Nghanɛ, o kwun ela, nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Li ali odzɛ ngwi ani le fwo mi ikpewo abu ngha? Lɔlu ungwɔ mgbi ani ama nbyito abɔ abu tsatsadu wa nin, ikyekyɛ abu mɛ okye inɛ byi ani ungwɔ wuba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>&lt;&lt;Ongyukwo idɔ na yɛ gbɔ yi ewon mi itukwu gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani ka kyɔsinɛ onɛnɛ, ngwi otsungwudɛ mgbi ani le nya yi ani idɔ nɛ? Ani dzɛ yi mfye mɛ oshookwɔ ba, ayiwi li kwu ani obibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Ani ye ungwɔ ngwi ani ka kyɔ wa, ikyegbɛɛ nu ma wa nya yi ani idɔ mmɛnɛ kpaa, inggisɛ ka gbɛ ani mi udɛ mgbi ama mani.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>&lt;&lt;Ta o kwu ama ngye mkpa mbi otsungwudɛ mgban ela onyonyi, o byi ongwu ababɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;Abu gye mkpa mbi otsungwudɛ mgbi ani mɛ sinɛ?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>&lt;&lt;O nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Li ikpɔkpɔ <char style="k">engyie olivi</char> ideli egyata.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">&lt;&lt;Ongyukwo idɔ na nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Kye afɛ mkpa mgbi abu na sisɛ vla, lɔ ideli enɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>&lt;&lt;O diyɛ byi ongwu fan gbɛɛ, &lt;Abu ma, o gye mkpa sinɛ?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;O gbɛɛ, &lt;Li oba alakama (ndzɛ dafi itsikapa nani) idubu onyi.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;Ongyukwo idɔ na nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Kye afɛ mkpa mgbi abu, lɔ ideli egyata.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>&lt;&lt;Otsungwudɛ na tsɛ ongyukwiidɔ ndzɛ yi otsitsi ewo ba na ikyekyɛ o kyungwɔ mi inɛ okwuukwu. Bana inggisɛ emi ɛsɛ ongwi onɛnɛ nghao ye ogbɛwɛbyi ungwɔ mgbi ama ngha inggisɛ emi osa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>IYesu kiyayi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N le nya ema, kye aludu ngwi abu dzɛyan kwu uka yi inggisɛ mi ɛsɛ nɛni, ikyegbɛɛ ni i wa dzɛma wuba kpaa, a ka gbɛ ema mi udɛ ogyegwu.<verse eid="LUK 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ongwu ndzɛ yi oyɛyɛ mi ungwɔ ogyɛngyɛ ma, o ka dzɛ yi oyɛyɛ mi ungwɔ okwukwo kpaa, inggisɛ n yagba kye inɛ byi ungwɔ ogyɛngyɛ saan ba, ungwɔ okwukwo kpaa o ka yagba kye inɛ byin saan ba. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Nɛ kini ema di dzɛ yi oyɛyɛ mi aludu ongwi ɛsɛ nɛ ba, li emɛ ka kye awuya otsitsi ongwi nkyɛ mbi Imgbasho wo ema abɔ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Ma ni ema di dzɛ yi oyɛyɛ mi ungwɔ mgbi inggisɛ oka ba ma, li emɛ ka kye ungwɔ mgban kye nu ema gbɛɛ no yɛɛ mgbi ema?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>&lt;&lt;Ongbidɔ onyi ka yagba kyɔ engyukwo efa idɔ ba. Lubana o ka di onyi tanyi diyɛ di oka kpan itukwu, hona o ka gha yi onyi yɛ lu ka bɛkɛ yi oka. Ema ka yagba kyɔ Imgbasho idɔ bɛyi udza ononyi gbɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Mi onɔ ngwi emi iFarasi, ama ngwu udza kpa ma kpakpa fwo odzɛ nɛ duu mata, a wita onyan odzɛ agya. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema li ama nfwo ewema ikwɔ gbɛɛ di ema le saan mi inɛ inggisɛ, nghaduu Imgbasho ye itukwu mgbi ema. Bana ungwɔ ndzɛ yi mmwɛ mbi inggisɛ ma li ungwɔ idza mi inɛ Imgbasho.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsootso mgbi iYesu angbeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>&lt;&lt;Ola mgbi iMose bɛyi ungwɔ ama ngwi ama ogbɛɛsɛ lɔ ma a gbɔn nghataa ba onɔ mgbi iJɔn okyɔ iBatisima. Wita mi onɔ na, a le gbɔ Esɔ Osuse mgbi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho, ali inggisɛ duu le kaka ele mi mfyumfye. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Sunɔ ba onu esho yi esɛ byulu ngha onu ambɛ onyi byulu mi ola.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>&lt;&lt;Ali inggisɛ ngwu gha yi owan yɛ lu ka kye ongyaa oka yɔ, li amah ngwi o le kyɔ, inggisɛ nkye ongyaa ngwu gheeba yi oban le kyɔ amah.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi inggisɛ udza bɛyi iLadzaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ udza oka nose dzɛ nli wo angwuto omuma shinishini di tishi ndlɛndlɛ, o di dzɛ mi oshishe omyɛɛ-myɛɛ alegbe-alegbe. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Mi onufoka mgban a li kye inggisɛ obibɔ ba wa lakɛ, o saasu ewo a li kwun di iLadzaru, <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>o li mina ogye ambulu ungwogye ama nli ngwuta mi adinyatsɛ ogye ungwogye mgbi inggisɛ udza nani. Obwe li ba wa kpanan ifwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>&lt;&lt;Ta inggisɛ obibɔ na wa kwulu, engyesɔ emi esho kyon lu mi iyayi Abrahan. Inggisɛ udza na kpaa wa kwulu, a kyon ndzi. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>O lu udola (ihade) ka dzɛ mi isɔ kpakpa, o kyile inɛ esho si di Abrahan mbombo, iLadzaru sɔdzɛ yan. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>O kwun ela kɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;Abrahan Otsɛn, di ani elela dɔ iLadzaru esɔ no kye ongwufabɔ bakɛ eni wa yulu ani idɛ, bana n dzɛ mi isɔ okwulewo mi ola nɛni!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>&lt;&lt;Nghaduu Abrahan nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Ongwani, wɛ mi onɔ ngwi abu dzɛ oshishe, abu tu ungwɔ ama osuse-osuse, nghaduu iLadzaru tu ungwɔ ama obube, nghaduu onɛnɛ o sɔ kpan, kpaa abu yɔ dzɛ mi isɔ kpaakpaa. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Ongyɛɛngyɛ mgbi ungwɔnɛ duu, ikplishɛ ladzɛ mi idzidzɛ mgbi eyi, ongwi inggisɛ oka ka fa kɛ mbi oka gbɛ ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>&lt;&lt;Ta inggisɛ udza na nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;N tɛkyɛ nu abu, Abrahan otsɛn, dɔ iLadzaru esɔ kɛ udɛ otsani, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>bana ani dzɛ yi engwunani mgbi ifu engyulɔ nghi eda toma. No kɛ ka kwo ma adɔ ikye onu ma ka ba imbe isɔ owulewo nɛ ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>&lt;&lt;Abrahan nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;Emi engwunabu dzɛ yi ola mgbi iMose bɛyi afɛ mgbi ama ogbɛɛsɛ okwo ma adɔ, nu ma fwo ma.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ udza na gbɛɛ, &lt;Ei, otsani Abrahan, nana ta ka mɛ ba. Kpaa ni inggisɛ oka kyato mbi emi ikwukwɔ yɛ kɛ mboma ta a ka kyatitukwu mi ali ibwubwe mgbi ama.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>&lt;&lt;Abrahan gbɔ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;Kini a fwo ola mgbi iMose bɛyi afɛ mgbi ama ogbɛɛsɛ bayɔ, ni inggisɛ oka kyɛɛ mbi emi ikwukwɔ kpaa a ka nu itukwu mi ele ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Obube, oyɛyɛ, idɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>IYesu nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ungwɔ ama nli nu inggisɛ kyɔ obube ma li kyɛmɛ a ka ba, nghaduu ahoo mi ikye inggisɛ ngwu ungwɔ obube ntonɛ nyɛ mbon ba mani. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>I tatase nu ma kye ikwɔɔ shaan onbukwɔ kyon ngwuta mi ekyoo okwukwo ngha non nu onyi mi idzidzɛ ɛngbɛ ntonɛ kyungwɔ obube. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Nghanɛ, gbɛwɛbyi ewema na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">&lt;&lt;Ni ongwunabu kyungwɔ obube, fwa yan, ki non kyatitukwu yɔ, dzanta yi obube mgban. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Ki non kyɔ abu ungwɔ obube akpe egyafa mi egbe onyi, diyɛ ba mbi abu akpe egyafa gbɛɛ, &lt;Ani kyatitukwu yɔ,&gt; dzanta yi obube mgban.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Ama ogbikye iYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mbwo eyi oyɛyɛ onuunu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Otsɛ iYesu si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni oyɛyɛ mgbi ema le gyɛngyɛ dafi inɛnɛ nkwodzi yɔ, ema ka nya ita ulɔ nɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;Kwɔlu ewabu yi akpa, kye ewabu ka kwokɛ mi ekyoo okwukwo,&gt; ta o ka fwo ema.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>&lt;&lt;Kyi kye gbɛɛ onyi mbi ema dzɛ yi ongbidɔ nle shin okwɔ naadi le kye inɛ byin ifyungwɔ. O ka nya ongbidɔ na mi onɔ ngwi o kyɛɛ okwɔ ma gbɛɛ, &lt;Ba i kɛ ka sisɛ gye ungwogye onɛnɛɛ&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Ungwɔ ka dzɛ ngha ba, o ka gbɛɛ, &lt;Kyɔ ungwogye ngwi ani ka gye mi otu nɛni, kye angwuto wo ewo, fɛ ni ani gye di wa ta, abu ka wa gye mgbi abu olɛlɛ baa&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Ongyukwo na ka ta ongbidɔ na angba mi ikyegbɛɛ di o kyungwɔ ngwi o nyan gbɛɛ non kyɔ maa? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Mbi ema kpaa, li ngha ndzɛ aali, mi onɔ ngwi ema kyungwɔ ngwi a wo ema duu ma, gbɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;Eyi li ɛngbɛ ama okyidɔ, eyi mɛ ogbɛ umba ba, eyi kyidɔ ongwi i wo imbisɔ ngwi eyi ka kyɔ mata.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu ngyɛlu inggisɛ iwyo otsoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Ngwi iYesu tɔ ofɛ le kɛ iJerosalin nɛ, o nyɛ otsee mgbi iSamaria bɛyi iGalalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Dafi o le kɛ oka kaka agwɔ oka nɛ, emi otsoma nghi iwyo si tun. A kwulɛsɛ mbombo <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>si kwun ela mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;iYesu, Ongyukwo, di eyi elela!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Dafi iYesu di ma nɛta, o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Lu na, ka kye ewema tso ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt; Ngwi a tɔ ofɛ le kɛ nɛta, otsoma gbosa loma.<verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Onyi mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama di dafi otsoma gbosa lon nɛta, o yidɔ ba le tsɛ Imgbasho mi ela okwukwo. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>O ba wa lakɛ esɛ mi iyayi iYesu yɛ tan angba. O li inggisɛ iSamaria. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>IYesu byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li inggisɛ iwyo ngwu otsoma gbosa loma baa? Inggisɛ egyanɛ ntona kɔ? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Inggisɛ onyi kpaa yidɔ o wa tsɛ Imgbasho ba se li ingyoga nɛ taa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Man o nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyato lu, oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi abu nu abu watɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obaaba mgbi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Emi iFarasi angbeka byi iYesu ita onɔ ngwi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ka ba mani, o nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ka ba dafi ema gbe inɛ byi na ba, <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>naadi inggisɛ ka gbɛɛ, &lt;O dzɛ na, hona o dzɛ aali ba,&gt; bana esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho dzɛ mi idzidzɛ ema.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naadi dzɛ mi itukwu mgbi ema.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Nghanɛ o nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɔ kyɛma ngwi ema ka mina odi egbe onyi mi egbe mgbi <char style="k">Ongwɛ Inggisɛ, </char> kpaa ema ka di ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Inggisɛ angbeka ka nya ema gbɛɛ, &lt;O dzɛ aali!&gt; Naadi &lt;O dzɛ na!&gt; Nghaduu ka yama kyɛdɔ ma ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Dafi mmbwo li naabɔ ni esho agya onyi gbosa nghataa ka tɔ agya oka nɛ, li ngha ngwi egbe mgbi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ kpaa ka dzɛ aali. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Kpaa ababɔ adzɛ ka kyɔn mi ungwɔ kwuba kyɛmɛ, etɔ emi onɛnɛ dika fwan.<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>&lt;&lt;Dafi i dzɛ mi egbe mgbi iNua nani, li ngha nka wa dzɛ mi egbe ngwi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka yɛ ma aali. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Ali inggisɛ duu le gye yɛ wa, engyulɔ le kye engyaa, a kye engyaa le nu eba nghataa ba mi egbe ngwi iNua kaka uwaa okwukwo nani. Ta eni ayɔ ba wa dzili ma duu.<verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>&lt;&lt;Di li ungwonyi dafi mi onɔ mgbi iLoti mani. Ali inggisɛ tole gye yɛ wa, a tole kyummya, le kya etɔ dile mbɛ ozu. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Kpaa mi egbe ngwi iLoti tasɛ mi ogalu iSodon ma, ola bɛyi enotse nli nu ola gbɛ mfyumfye kya mi esho ba esɛ wa dzili ma duu.<verse eid="LUK 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>&lt;&lt;Li ngha nka dzɛ mi egbe ngwi a ka kye Ongwɛ Inggisɛ tso ma aali. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Mi egbe na, inggisɛ ndɔdzɛ ikyendu mgban no ka tashulu ba ikye owa gbelu okye mgban mi ozu ba. Ka li ungwonyi yi inggisɛ ndzɛ okwɔ, no ka yɛ ba udɛ owa kye unkonyi ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Wɛ ungwɔ nkyɔ owa iLoti nani. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Ali inggisɛ nmina odzɛ oshishe yɔ, oshishe mgban ka byulu, ongwu ndzata oshishe mgban gbɛɛ no byulu yɔ, ka yɛ tun. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>N nya ema mi otu nani, inggisɛ efa ka lato akwulo onyi; a ka kyi kyelu onyi dzata oka. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Engyaa efa ka tole kpinangwɔ yi ewoma mi ikwɔɔ; a ka kyelu onyi dzata oka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>(Inggisɛ efa ka to okwɔ; a ka kyi kyelu onyi dzata oka.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olɔɔlɔ kwuba dzɛ yi ambulu nɛ ba.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Engwafɔ mgbi iYesu si byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li mi ole, Otsɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">O nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li imbe ngwi ungwɔ ikwukwɔ la ma ngwi mpo li kwakye aali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi owakwadɛ o biibɛ odzɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Nɛ iYesu nya engwafɔɔn utsa otso ma gbɛɛ nu ma le bibɔ alonɔ, nu ma ka ndɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>O gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Mi ogalu oka ma inggisɛ ogbiikwɔ oka dzɛ nli mio Imgbasho hona kye inggisɛ wuuta ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Nɛ owakwadɛ oka dzɛ mi ogalu na nli ba mbon le tɛkyɛ mi ikye emyɛmyɛ mgban gbɛɛ, &lt;Ya ani abɔ mi ikye inggisɛ ngwu kwokyi odzɛ yi ani nɛni.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>&lt;&lt;Onɔ she ngwi ongye ogbiikwɔ na fwa okyungwɔ mi ele. Nghaduu mi ongyɛɛngyɛ nɛ, o gbɔ yi ewon gbɛɛ, &lt;Dafi ngwi ani li mio Imgbasho hona kye inggisɛ wuuta ba nɛ kpaa, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>mi ikye okakewo ngwi owakwadɛ nɛ kale nu ani nɛ, n ka di mi ele azukwu no tu emyɛmyɛ mgban. Ni ani kyɔ ba, o ka nin ndɛngyɛ yi okakewo mgban oba alonɔ nɛni!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Man Otsɛ iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gadɔ mi odzɛ ngwi ongye ogbiikwɔ ebɛbɛ na gbɔ mani. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Nghanɛ Imgbasho ka yagba gbiikwɔ emyɛmyɛ wo emidan, ama nle makwɔ yan otu yi onɔ le mina abɔ oyaaya nɛ baa? O ka kiyayi ofwɔ ma ngwutaa? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>N nya ema, o ka di gbɛɛ a tu emyɛmyɛ plɛ jo. Nghaduu, onɔ ngwi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka yɛ ma, o ka tu oyɛyɛ onuunu mi ɛsɛ nɛ joo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi inggisɛ iFarasi yi <optbreak/> inggisɛ ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>IYesu diyɛ gbɔ utsa nɛ nya ama ndzɛ yi abɔ otsigɛgɛ gbɛɛ ama le saan yuoma, di kye angbeka wuuta ba ma gbɛɛ <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ efa kɛ ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin oka bibɔ. Onyi li inggisɛ iFarasi, oka li inggisɛ ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Inggisɛ iFarasi na kwuzunto le bibɔ mi ikye ewon gbɛɛ: &lt;Imgbasho, ani ta abu angba ikyegbɛɛ ani dzɛ dafi inggisɛ angbeka ba; dafi ama ofofɛ yi emi ali ibwubwe yi emi amah hona dafi inggisɛ ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ nɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Ani li tukwondu akpe efa mi ikyidu onyi, ani di li nu Imgbasho onyi mi ikye iwyo mi alungwɔ ngwi ani tu duu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>&lt;&lt;Kpaa inggisɛ ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ na dzɛkɛ fyata, o yagba kyile inɛ esho kpaa ba, o kye abɔ mgban bɛkɛ igɛgɛ si gbɛɛ, &lt;Imgbasho, di ani elela, ani li inggisɛ alobube.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>&lt;&lt;N nya ema gbɛɛ inggisɛ nɛ lu udɛ mgban yi emyɛmyɛ mi inɛ Imgbasho ngha inggisɛ oka nani. Bana ali inggisɛ ta nkyile ewon esho a ka yilen esɛ, ongwu ndi yile ewon esɛ a ka kyilen esho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu yi ɛngbɛ ama oshilɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Inggisɛ gbe ɛngbɛ ama oshilɛlɛ ba mbi iYesu ikye no wa kye abɔ gbo ma. Ngwi engwafɔɔn di ngha nɛta, a kwɔ ma oba mbon. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Kpaa iYesu kwu ɛngbɛ ntona ela ba mbon si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dzata ɛngbɛ ntonɛ nu ma ba mbi ani, ka kwɔ ma ba, lubana esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho dzɛ ikye itɔ ntonɛni. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>N le nya ema otsitsi, ali inggisɛ ngbɛ esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho dafi ongwongbɛ ba ka kaka ele ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inggisɛ aludu ogbe inggisɛ teyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Ongyukwo oka ogbe inggisɛ teyi byi iYesu ita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse osuse, li alungwɔ ngwi ani ka kyɔ kyɛmɛ se n ka tu oshishe igyegwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>IYesu byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;I kyɔsinɛse ngwi abu le kwu ani di osuse? Inggisɛ onyi kpaa le saan ba se li Imgbasho yuon. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Abu ye ola ntonɛni: &lt;Ka ndaamah ba, ka ngwɔ inggisɛ ba, ka yimi ba, ka kyɔ obwɛndɛ atsika ba, sunu otsabu yi onabu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani ngyo ola ntonɛ duu kyɛ onɔ ngwi ani li ongbɛ ma jo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Ngwi iYesu fwo ungwɔnɛ nɛ, o nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɔ onyi kwoba mbi abu kpɔɔ. Gbelu alungwɔ ngwi abu dzɛyan duu gbe gya kye udza nu emi adzɛ, taman abu ka dzɛ yi aludu mi esho. Ta yɛ wa kyɛdɔ ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Mi onɔ ngwi inggisɛ na fwo ungwɔnɛ nɛ, o buntse. Lubana o li inggisɛ ndzɛ yi aludu kpakpa. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>IYesu di dafi o shɛ ewo ta ba nɛ, o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka fyumfye kpakpa ni inggisɛ udza kaka esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Mi otsitsi yɔ, ka sunɔ ba ni ilakwumyi nyɛ ifo edi ngha onu inggisɛ udza kaka esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Ama nfwo odzɛ nɛ byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li emɛ tsatso ka watɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɔ nli kyɛmɛ-kyɛmɛ mbi inggisɛ ba li kyɛmɛ-kyɛmɛ mbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>IPyita nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dii! Eyi dzata alungwɔ ngwi eyi dzɛyan duu kyɛdɔ abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, ali inggisɛ ngwu dzata udɛ naadi owan hona emi ongwunɔn naadi ama omban hona emi ongwan mi ikye esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho yɔ, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>a ka yilen nu ma kwuba mi onɔ ngwi eyi wele nɛni. A dika tu oshishe igyegwu mi onɔ ongwi iyayi kpaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu diyɛ gbɔdzɛ ikwu ewon <optbreak/> akpe ongwu ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>IYesu gbe ama ogbikyon iwyodefa ntona lu enggengga ka nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi le lu iJerosalin, ta alungwɔ ngwi oyegbɔ lɔ mi ikye Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ma duu ka mbwumbwo. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>A ka kyon wo Udzengye abɔ. A ka nyan odzɛ agya, fyan ito, kyanggwɔ kyin, gbon onitse diyɛ ngwɔn. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Mi egbe ongwu ta ma o ka kyato mi ikwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Nghaduu engwafɔ mgban yagba difwi ungwɔ ntonɛ onyi ba. Itan daada loma, a di yagba ye ungwɔ ngwi iYesu le gbɔdzan ma ba.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu kwulu obinɛ obibɔ inɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Dafi iYesu le to kwɛkwɛ mi iJeriko nɛ, inggisɛ obinɛ oka sɔdzɛ mi ondoofɛ, le bibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Mi onɔ ngwi o fwo ibyi inggisɛ le nyɛ nɛ, o byita ungwɔ nle kiyayi mani. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>A nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li iYesu ongwi iNadzareti le nyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>O kwu ela mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IYesu, Ongwɛ iDevedi, di ani elela!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Ama nto iyayi mbon fan ela nyan gbɛɛ no tukwondu, kpaa o di kwu ela okwukwo nghaangha, &lt;&lt;Ongwɛ iDevedi, di ani elela!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Nɛ iYesu kwulɛsɛ woola gbɛɛ nu ma kye inggisɛ obinɛ na ba mbon. Ngwi o ba kwɛkwɛ nɛta, iYesu byun gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>&lt;&lt;Li alungwɔ ngwi abu mina gbɛɛ ni ani kyɔ abu ele?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">O gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ani mina odinɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>IYesu si gbɔ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inɛ no kwulu lo abu; oyɛyɛ mgbi abu nu abu yɛɛ saan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Labɔlabɔ mata, o si dinɛ, kyɛdɔ iYesu, dile tsɛ Imgbasho. Ngwi inggisɛ duu di ungwɔnɛ nɛ, ama kpaa tsɛ Imgbasho.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">IYesu bɛyi iDzakyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>IYesu kaka iJeriko nyɛ-nyɛ le lu. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Ongyulɔ dzɛ imbe na ngwu a li kwun di iDzakyu; o li ongyukwo mgbi ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛɛ di dzɛ yi aludu. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>O mina odi itɔ inggisɛ ngwu iYesu dzɛ mani, nghaduu ngwi o shigbo ba nɛ, o yagba odin ba ikye ibyi inggisɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Nɛ o tsinya lu iyayi ka tɔkɛ ekwɔ andundu ni ongwu din, ikyesinɛ iYesu kyɛ le nyɛ ofɛ nani.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Ngwi iYesu to imbe na yɛyɛ nɛta, o ndinɛ kɛ esho si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IDzakyu, tashulu vla-vla. Li kyɛmɛ-kyɛmɛ n ka kaka udɛ abu inɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Nɛ o tashulu vla si gban yi atsa.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Inggisɛ tsatsa di ungwɔnɛni man, a wita ondandu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O le kɛ ingyoga mi udɛ inggisɛ ali ibwubwe.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A kye ama ogbɛ udza ifyɛ gbɛɛ a li inggisɛ imɔ ba.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Nghaduu iDzakyu dzɛkunto gbɔ yi Otsɛ iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dii, Otsɛ! Mmɛnɛ jo n ka kye ayɛ ungwɔ mgbi ani ngwi ani tulun kyi nu ema adzɛ, ki ani kyɔ inggisɛ ogye, ni li ekyɛkyɛ kpaa, n ka kpa otsungwɔn mkpa akpe enɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>IYesu gbɔ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inɛ nɛ abu yi emidabu duu tu owatɔ-watɔ, ikyesinɛ inggisɛ nɛ kpaa, li ongwɛ Abrahan. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Bana Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ba ikye owa pita yɛ dulu ungwɔ nbyulu ma watɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi engbidɔ iwyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Dafi a le gadɔ mi ungwɔnɛ nɛ, iYesu kiyayi onya ma utsa, ikyesinɛ o dzɛ kwɛkwɛ yi iJerosalin, man inggisɛ tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ka byakpa ba akponyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>IYesu gbɔgbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ongwɛ utɔ oka wewo okɛ anengye adzi nu ma ka kye abɔ utɔ dɔn ikye di yidɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Nɛ o kwu engbidɔ mgban nghi iwyo ela si nu ali inggisɛ mgbi ama awuya ngwi mɛ dafi awuya okpa idɔ ofyia eta sini. O gbɛɛ, &lt;Kyelu awuya nɛ fashi abɔ di tu ungwɔ ele na, duuse nin wa yidɔ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>&lt;&lt;Nghaduu emi ɛsɛ udan dun tanyi man a dɔ inggisɛ angbeka esɔ mbon oka gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;Eyi mina gbɛɛ inggisɛ nɛ no ka li utɔ mgbi eyi ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>&lt;&lt;A gyon utɔ man o yɛ luba udɛ. Ta o dɛsɔ mbi engbidɔ ngwu ongwu nu ma awuya ma, ikye oye eni owaawa ngwi a tu mi ele mani.<verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>&lt;&lt;Inggisɛ ongwu ababɔ ba wa gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;Ongyukwo, awuya ngwi abu kye nu ani ma yɛ mbwumbwo nghi iwyo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>&lt;&lt;Ongyukwo nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;N nu abu abɔ ongbidɔ mgbi ani osuse. Ikyegbɛɛ abu dzɛ yi oyɛyɛ mi ungwɔ ogwee nɛ, kye inɛ byi igeli okwukwo nghi iwyo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>&lt;&lt;Ongwu fan ba wa gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;Ongyukwo, awuya mgbi abu yɛ mbwumbwo nghi eda.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>&lt;&lt;Ongyukwo mgban si nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;Kye inɛ byi igeli okwukwo nghi eda.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>&lt;&lt;Nɛ ongbidɔ oka di ba wa gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;Ongyukwo, awuya mgbi abu dzɛ na; ani kye da mi ayangwuto. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Ani tsimio abu, ikyesinɛ abu li inggisɛ ngwu fyumfye ali kpakpa. Abu li dulu mi imbe ngwi abu kye da ba, di li shɛ mi imbe ngwi abu kya ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>&lt;&lt;Ongyukwo mgban nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;N ka gbɔ abu ikwɔ mi elodzɛ mgbi abu, abu ongbidɔ imbali nɛni, abu ye gbɛɛ ani li inggisɛ ofyumfye ali, n li dulu mi imbe ngwi ani kye da ba, di li shɛ mi imbe ngwi ani kya ba. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Kyɔsinɛse ngwi abu kye awuya mgbi ani ka wokɛ mi ozu awuya ba? Mi oyɛɛyɛ mgbi ani, n kika tu eni owaawa mi efu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>&lt;&lt;Ta o nya ama nkwudzɛ to yan ma gbɛɛ, &lt;Gbɛlu awuya na mi abɔ mgban kye nu inggisɛ ndzɛyan nghi iwyo nani.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>&lt;&lt;A gbɔgbɛɛ, ongyukwo, &lt;Ongwu na tsekise dzɛ yi iwyo wa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>&lt;&lt;O nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;N nya ema gbɛɛ mbi ali inggisɛ ntulun ma a dika mbwon ele kpɔɔ, kpaa ama ndzɛ yi unkonyi ba ma, ongwi o dzɛyan ma kpaa a ka kyi gbɛlu. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Kpaa emi ikyili mgbi ani ngwu mina gbɛɛ nin ka dzɛ utɔ mi ikye ma ba nɛ, gbe ma ba wa ngwɔ ma mi iyayi ani mmɛnɛni.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okakaakaka onghaangha mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Ngwi iYesu gbɔdzɛ nɛ ngyɛ nɛ, o kye ofɛ dikye olu iJerosalin. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Dafi o wa to kwɛkwɛ mi ongwɛ igeli ngwi a li kwun di iBɛtifege yi iBetani mi undɔ ngwi a li kwun di unggwɔ mgbi Olivi nɛ, o dɔ engwafɔɔn efa esɔ nya ma gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>&lt;&lt;Lu mi ogalu ndzɛ ema iyayi nani, ni ema kaka ele yɔ, ema ka di ongwɛ itaklimyi shadi mmanani, ngwi inggisɛ onyi kpaa tɔɔn ye waba. Kyi shɛlu ba mmɛnɛni. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Kini inggisɛ byi ema gbɛɛ, &lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema le shan yɔ?&gt; Nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;Odzɛ wo Otsɛ yan.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Ama ngwu iYesu dɔ ma esɔ ma si kɛ ka di itaklimyi dafi o tsekise nya ma mani. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Ngwi a le shan nɛta, emi otsungwɔn byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema le shɛ itaklimyi nɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>A nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Odzɛ wo Otsɛ yan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>A kyen ba wa nu iYesu, man kye angwuto mgbi ama kye tukwu ongwɛ itaklimyi na ekpo di ya iYesu abɔ dɔkɛ ele. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Dafi o tɔɔn le kɛ nɛ, ibyi inggisɛ gbe angwuto le tasɛ mi ofɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Ngwi o ba kwɛkwɛ mi imbe ngwi ofɛ nyɛ lu unggwɔ Olivi nɛ, engwafɔ duu wita le tsatsa dile tsɛ Imgbasho mi ela okwukwo mi alungwɔ okwulewo ngwi ama di nani. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Le gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;Mse no dzɛ yi utɔ ongwu nba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">mi iyi mgbi Otsɛ Imgbasho nɛni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Iyu mi esho bɛyi okwɔkwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">mi imbe Onghaangha duu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Emi iFarasi angbeka mi idzidzɛ ibyi inggisɛ ntona gbɔ yi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, fwa yi engwafɔ ntonɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema, kini a dede kpaa, akwutsɛ ka gbaakwɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Ngwi iYesu ba kwɛkwɛ wa di iJerosalin nɛ, o tsukwu mi ikye inggisɛ emi igeli nani. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>O gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni abu, ki ye ungwɔ ama nka ba yi abu iyu inɛ kpaa ta. Nghaduu onɛnɛ i daada mi inɛ mgbi ema. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Egbe ka wa kwulu abu abɔ ngwi emi ikyili mgbi abu ka loka kye abu wo idzidzɛ di fyi abu mi ali agya duu. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>A ka fyi abu bɛkɛ esɛ, abu yi inggisɛ ama nto yi abu duu. A ka dzata ikwutsɛ onyi kpaa dɔ ikye oka ba, ikyesinɛ abu fwa o difwi onɔ ngwi Imgbasho ba owa dulu abu watɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu mi ozu okwukwo osunu <optbreak/> Imgbasho mi iJerosalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Ta iYesu kaka ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin man wita olɔlu ama nle kyummya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A tole kye ungwɔ ama ofifɛ gya mmala, ingyakpa, mndɔ yi engyie, eneekwɔ yi mmwaa.</char></note> tasɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɛ lɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;Ozu mgbi ani ka li ozu obibɔ; kpaa ema kye yɛɛ imbe odaada mgbi emumyi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Alegbe o le tso mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin nani. Kpaa engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho, etsetse mgbi ola mgbi iMose bɛyi emi angbodzi inggisɛ le fya gbɛɛ ama ki ngwɔn. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Nghaduu a tu ofɛ onyi ongwɔn ba, ikyesinɛ ali inggisɛ kye itukwu shakɛ mi elodzɛ mgban.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">A byi iYesu ita mi odzɛ mfye mgban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Egbe oka mi idzidzɛ egbe ntonɛ nɛ, iYesu le tso ibyi inggisɛ mi ifoozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin dile gbɔ Esɔ Osuse, ta engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ama otso ola mgbi iMose bɛkɛ yi ama okye ɛsɛ teyi, ba mbon. <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>A gbɔ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nya eyi, li mi ali mfye ngwi abu le kyungwɔ ntonɛ, li emɛ nu abu mfye nɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani kpaa ka byi ema ita. Nya ani na, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>iBatisima mgbi iJɔn nɛ, kyɛ mbi Imgbasho mi esho naadi kyɛ mbi inggisɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>A si tsɛwɛ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini eyi gbɛɛ, &lt;Kyɛ mbi Imgbasho mi esho yɔ,&gt; o ka byita gbɛɛ, &lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema nun oyɛyɛ ba?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Kpaa ni eyi gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;Kyɛ mbi inggisɛ yɔ,&gt; ali inggisɛ duu ka tsɛ eyi akwutsɛ, ikyesinɛ a kye gbɛɛ iJɔn li oyegbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Nɛ, a nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi ye imbe ngwi i tɔkyɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngyɛse ani kpaa ka nya ema itɔ mfye ngwi ani kye le kyungwɔ ntonɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsa mgbi ama ngwu a kye okwɔ <optbreak/> dɔ ma ubɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>IYesu si kiyayi o nya inggisɛ utsa nɛni gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ oka nose ye ekwɔ ama onaana mi okwɔ mgban man kye nu emi okwɔ angbeka mi ondu odzɛɛdzɛ, si lu agaba onɔ kɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Ngwi onɔ oshɛ etɔ wa gyɔ nɛ, o si dɔ ongbidɔ mgban esɔ mbi ama ngwu o kye okwɔ dɔ ma ubɔ ntonani, ikyegbɛɛ nu ma nun awawekwɔ nli mgbi ongwu mi okwɔ nani. Nghaduu ama ngwu o kye okwɔ dɔ ma ubɔ ntona gbon ibe lɔn onya lu abubɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>O di dɔ ongbidɔ oka esɔ, ongwu na kpaa a di gbon nun ayiwi saan, lɔn onya lu abubɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>O di dɔ inggisɛ ongwu ta esɔ kpɔɔ, a gbon ibe tan mmya di lɔn onya tasɛ lu.<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>&lt;&lt;Ta otsungwɔ okwɔ na gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;N ka kyɔsinɛ dɛn? Ani ka dɔ ongwani esɔ, ongwu nkpɛn itukwu nɛni; i kyayina a ka nun mmwɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>&lt;&lt;Nghaduu ngwi ama o kye okwɔ dɔ ma ubɔ ntona dun nɛ, a kye ondu wɛɛsɛ yi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;Nɛnɛ li ongwɛ ogye okwudan aani. Detse ni i gbongwɔn, ni okwudɛ nɛ yɛɛ mgbi eyi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>A si kwon tasɛ mi okwɔ man gbongwɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">&lt;&lt;Nghama li alungwɔ ngwi otsungwɔ okwɔ na ka kyɔ yi ama? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>O ka ba wa kye ama ngwu o kye okwɔ dɔ ma ubɔ ntona tsatsaduu kye ngwɔlu di yile okwɔ na nu inggisɛ angbeka.&gt;&gt; Mi onɔ ngwi inggisɛ ntona fwo ungwɔnɛ nɛ, a gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɔnɛ no ka dzɛ ngha ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>IYesu kye inɛ byi ma yɛyɛ si byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nghanɛ li alungwɔ ngwi olɔɔlɔ nɛ tso dɛn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ikwutsɛ ngwi ama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ombɛ ozu fwan mani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">li <char style="k">ongwu</char> yɛ kwulu ikye ozu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Ali inggisɛ ngbɛsɛ gyɛkɛ ikwutsɛ na ka gbobu ambulu-ambulu, kpaa inggisɛ ngwu i ka gyan ma o ka jiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Etsetse mgbi ola bɛyi engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho le pita ofɛ ngwi ama ka bwan tsoli, ikyesinɛ a ye ta gbɛɛ o gbɔ utsa nɛ li mi ikye mgbi ama. Nghaduu a le tsimio ibyi inggisɛ.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okpaa udza ifyɛɛ mbi iSidza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Nɛ a gbinɛbyin saan. A dɔ ama owodi esɔ, ama nkyɔ ɛwɛ gbɛɛ ama li emi otsitsi mani. A weka obwa iYesu mi ungwɔ ngwi o gbɔ adzi nu ma kyon nu mi abɔ mfye mgbi iGɔna. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Ama owodi ntona si byi iYesu gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Otsetse, eyi ye abu li gbɔdzɛ di tsungwɔ nle yɛyɛ, abu di li kye idzidza dzɛ ba, kpaa li tso ofɛ mgbi Imgbasho yɛyɛ yi otsitsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Li ayin ni eyi kpa udza ifyɛɛ nu iSidza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">iSidza</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Li iyi utɔ mgbi emi iRoma.</char></note> naadi li ayin ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>O difwi ɛwɛ mgbi ama nɛta o gbɔ yi ama gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>&lt;&lt;Kye udza ma tsen n di, li onodzi bɛyi olɔɔlɔ mgbi emɛ dɔ efu dɛn?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li mgbi iSidza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kye ungwɔ mgbi iSidza nu iSidza, mgbi Imgbasho nu Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>A yagba bwan yi elodzɛ ondu mi elodzɛ ngwi o gbɔ mmana mi ododa na ba. Man i kwulu ma ewo mi uka nani, a si yɛɛ shilididi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okyɛɛ-kyɛɛ mi ikwu <optbreak/> bɛyi ongyaa okyeekye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Emi iSadusi angbeka, ama ngbɛɛ okyɛɛ-kyɛɛ mi ikwu dzɛma ba ma, ba mbi iYesu yi ita. <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, iMose lɔ afɛ nu eyi gbɛɛ kini ongwunɔ inggisɛ kwulu dzata ongyaa, kpaa o dzɛ yi ɛngbɛ bayɔ, ongyulɔ na ka yile owakwadɛ na kyɛmɛ-kyɛmɛ, ikye otu ɛngbɛ mi ikye ongwunɔn nani. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Nose emi ongwunɔ ifu nghi egyafa to. Ongwu ababɔ kye ongyaa ta kwulu tu ongwɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Ongwu fan <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>bɛyi ongwu ta yilen owakwadɛ, li ungwonyi nghataa ongwu gyafa, kpaa a tu ongwɛ ba man a kwulu duu. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Ongyɛɛngyɛ duu ongyaa na kpaa wa kwulu. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Nghanɛma, mi egbe olɛlɛ ngwi emi ikwukwɔ ka kyato ma, o ka li owa emɛ, ngwi engyulɔ egyafa ntona duu kyon?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ emi egbe nɛ li le kye engyaa, a dile kye engyaa nu engyulɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Kpaa ama ngwu a kye ma wuuta gbɛɛ di a mɛ owo atɛ mi onɔ na bɛyi mi okyɛɛ-kyɛɛ mi ikwu a ka yama kye ongyaa hona bongyulɔ ba, <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>bana a ka kwulu wuba, a to dafi engyesɔ. A li emi ongwɛ Imgbasho, ikyekyɛ a li ama ngwu a kyile ma mi ikwongye. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Nghaduu mi utsa mgbi oshɛ okwoola, iMose kpaa tso gbɛɛ emi ikwukwɔ kyato mi ikwu, bana o kwu Otsɛ Imgbasho gbɛɛ, Imgbasho mgbi Abrahan, yi Adziki bɛyi iJeko. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Ongwu li Imgbasho mgbi emi ikwukwɔ ba, kpaa mgbi emi oshishe, bana mbon alungwɔ duu dzɛ oshishe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Etsetse mgbi ola angbeka si gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O nu uka saan, Otsetse!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Man a byun ita onyi wuba.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IKrestu ma li Ongwɛ emɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Ta iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔnɛse ngwi a gbɛɛ iKrestu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:41</char><char style="fq" closed="false">iKrestu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngwu a li kwu di </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">iMedzaya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ongwu Otsɛ Imgbasho zondu gbɛɛ o ka wa dulu ɛsɛ watɔ.</char></note> li ongwɛ iDevedi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>IDevedi abɔn gbɔ mi afɛ mgbi iPaslami gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt; &lt;Otsɛ Imgbasho gbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">yi Otsɛ mgbi ani gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Sɔkɛ abugye mgbi ani<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>nghataa nin nu engyikyili mgbi abu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">yɛɛ itse mgbi abu ogbe afɔ dɔ efu.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>IDevedi kwun gbɛɛ Otsɛ. Nghanɛ o dika li ongwan sinɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Ngwi inggisɛ duu le fwon nɛ, iYesu nya engwafɔɔn gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>&lt;&lt;Gbɛwɛbyi etsetse mgbi ola, ama nli kpa ma okyikyɛ kpatsɛ yi angwuto owulu-wulu di li kpa ma onu ma le ta ma angba mi ifyidu kyɛ, a di li kye itse imɔ mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda bɛyi imbe ama oshewo mi oga. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>A di li kyɔ emi owakwadɛ ogye mi ungwɔ ngwi a ki kye kyɔ oyabɔ mi udɛ mgbi ama di li kyile ewoma esho mi ibɔ obɔ tunto. Itɔ inggisɛ ntona a ka nghao nu ma adzɛ timbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Umba onuunu mgbi owakwadɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Dafi iYesu kyile inɛ esho nɛ, o di emi awuya kye umba mgbi ama le wokɛ mi okye ogbɛ umba mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>O diyɛ di owakwadɛ ngwu dzɛ adzɛ kye anini nghi efa wa wokɛ okye ogbɛ umba. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, owakwadɛ ndzɛ adzɛ nɛ nu ngha angbeka ntona duu. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Lubana emi awuya ntonɛ duu fwɛ-fwɛ mi aludu mgbi ama kye nu; kpaa ongwu mi abubɔ mgban kye ungwɔ ngwi o ka dzɛ oshishe mi ele duu kye nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gbɔdzɛ ambɛ ongyɛɛngyɛ <optbreak/> mgbi ɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Engwafɔɔn angbeka le gbɔdzɛ mi mse bɛyi idabɔ ngwi a kyɔ mi akwutsɛ ongwi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin bɛyi umba ngwi a kye nu Imgbasho. Nghaduu iYesu gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>&lt;&lt;Ungwɔ ngwi ema di mmɛnɛ nɛ, onɔ kyɛma ngwi a ka dzata ikwutsɛ onyi dɔ ikye oka ba; ama duu a ka kye bulu tukwu esɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Nɛ a byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsetse, li engga ngwi ungwɔ ntonɛ ka kyɔ? Naadi li ali ambɛ ka tso gbɛɛ ungwɔ ntonɛ dzɛ kwɛkwɛ okyɔɔkyɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Gbɛwɛbyi adzi nu ma ka kpagyama wo ba. Ikyesinɛ inggisɛ kwuba ka ba mi iyi mgbi ani, le kye ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;Li ani ongwu ma aani,&gt; dika gbɛɛ, &lt;Onɔ ma gyɔ wa.&gt; Nghaduu ka kyɛdɔ ma ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Onɔ ngwi ema fwo odzɛ ika bɛyi ablodzɛ, ka mio ba. Ungwɔ ntonɛ ka kyɔ kyɛmɛ duuse, kpaa ongyɛɛngyɛ mgbi ɛsɛ ka ba labɔlabɔ ma ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Ta iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ɛsɛ oka ka kyɛɛ ika yi ɛsɛ oka, esutɔ oka dika kyɛɛ ika yi esutɔ oka. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Ikpɛsɛ osuusu ka dzɛ kpakpa, onikyɔ enbwa omba enbwa bɛyi ootse ibwubwe ka gbɔfwɛ mi imbe idzidza-dzidza, yi ungwɔ ama okwulewo bɛyi ambɛ ama okwukwo mi esho.<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>&lt;&lt;Kpaa duuse ni ungwɔ ntonɛ kyɔ, a ka gbe abɔ dɔ ema ewo dika nu ema okɔtɔndzi adzɛ. A ka kye ema nu mi ozu okwakye mgbi emi iJuda bɛyi obawi, dika kye ema ba mi inɛ mgbi emi utɔ bɛyi emi iGɔna, tsatsadu mi ikye iyi mgbi ani. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Ungwɔnɛ ka nu ema ofɛ okyɔ obwɛndɛ mgbi ani. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Nghaduu bwa itukwu mgbi ema, no ka kaka ema ewo dafi ema ka na ewema duuse ni egbe wa gyɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Lubana ani ka nu ema elodzɛ bɛyi ozoyeye ngwi engyikyili mgbi ema ka yagba onatsondu yi ema ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Ama omba ema, engwunema, emi odo ema bɛyi emi oka ema, ka wa kye ema gya, a dika ngwɔ ema angbeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Inggisɛ duu ka di ema tanyi mi ikye iyi mgbi ani. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Nghaduu alotu mgbi ema onyi ka kwɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Mi okwulɛsɛ mgbi ema kpɔklɔɔ ema ka tu oshishe.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu gbɔ odzili-dzili mgbi <optbreak/> iJerosalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>&lt;&lt;Onɔ ngwi ema wa di emi oblakwutsɛ kpakɛkɛ wo iJerosalin ma, ye na gbɛɛ odzili-dzili mgban dzɛ kwɛkwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Nghanɛ ama nto iJudia nu ma tsinya lu unggwɔ, ama nto ogalu nu ma tasɛ, ama ndi nto esisɛ nu ma ka yɛ kaka ogalu ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Lubana nɛnɛ li onɔ ngwi Imgbasho ka nu emi ogalu nɛ adzɛ kpakpa ikye ombwumbwo ungwɔ ngwi a tsekise lɔ mani. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Ka kwulewo kpakpa mbi engyaa ama nto yi ifewo mi egbe ntona bɛyi enengwɛ ama nto yi engwɛ abɔ! Okakewo ka dzɛ kpakpa mi ɛsɛ na bɛyi itingga mgbi Imgbasho mi ikye inggisɛ ntonɛni. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>A ka ngwɔ angbeka yi okwusunkli dika kwu angbeka ofyɛɛ gbe ma lu kpatsɛ ɛsɛ duu. Udzengye ka kye afɔ tɔdɔ iJerosalin nghataa onɔ mgbi Udzengye ka wa ngyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obaaba mgbi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>&lt;&lt;Ambɛ ka wa tɔ mi onɔ yi ofyia bɛyi mcɛ. Mi ikpɛsɛ, ɛsɛ duu ka dzɛ mi isɔ bɛyi okakewo mi owulu-wulu yi okadu-kadu mgbi ekyoo okwukwo. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Ibyi inggisɛ ka dzɛkwulu yi imio, mi odifwi-difwi mgbi ungwɔ ngwi kyɛ le ba ɛsɛ nɛ mani, lubana ali mfye ongwi esho duu ka suusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Mi onɔ na a ka di Ongwɛ Inggisɛ kyɛ le ba mi akpa mi esho yi mfye bɛyi okwɔkwɔ oshewo. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Onɔ ngwi ungwɔ ntonɛ wita okyɔɔkyɔ ma, kyato dzɛkunto kyile ikye mgbi ema esho, lubana owatɔ-watɔ mgbi ema dzɛ kwɛkwɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ungwɔ okpayi-kpayi mi <optbreak/> ekwɔ andundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Ta iYesu nya ma utsa nɛ gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Kyidi andundu bɛyi ekwɔ angbeka duu na. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Onɔ ngwi a wita okyinda ma, ema li di abuema di ye gbɛɛ akyonova dzɛ kwɛkwɛ wa. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Ngwi i dzɛ nghanɛ, ni ema di ungwɔ ntonɛ le kyɔ yɔ, ye na ta gbɛɛ esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho dzɛ kwɛkwɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>&lt;&lt;N nya ema otsitsi, etɔ nɛ ka nyɛ ba nghataa se ungwɔ ntonɛ ka kyɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Esho yi esɛ ka wa nyɛ, kpaa elodzɛ mgbi ani ka yama nyɛ ba.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adɔ okwookwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>&lt;&lt;Gbɛwɛbyi na, ka kye itukwu mgbi ema dzɛ mi ungwɔ ogyeegye yi ungwɔ owa fya bɛyi itukwu oshanyɛ mi oshishe ongwi ɛsɛ nɛ ba, ikye ni egbe na ka fa tu ema bwabwa <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>dafi ukya ba mani. Lubana egbe na ka ba mbi ali inggisɛ ndzɛ ɛsɛ duu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Lasisa le ngyo alonɔ na, di bibɔ gbɛɛ ni ema yagba watɔ mi ungwɔ ama nka wa kyɔ duu, adzi ni ema wa yagba kwudzɛ mi inɛ Ongwɛ Inggisɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Alegbe mi onɔ, iYesu li le tsungwɔ mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin, kpaa mi otu yɔ o li lu ka la undɔ ngwi a li kwun di unggwɔ olivi nani. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Ali ebgegbe inggisɛ kwuba li tɔ owa fwon mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">IJuda gbela okye iYesu gya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi mgbi ibredi ngwi a li kye okwuna wele ba ma le gyɔ, <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>nɛta engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi etsetse mgbi ola le pita ofɛ ngwi ama ka ngwɔ iYesu daada, bana a le mio ibyi inggisɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Nghanɛ iSatan kaka mbi iJuda ongwu a li kwun di Iskarɔti, nli onyi mbi emi iwyodefa ntonani. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>O kɛ mbi engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ama nle ngyo mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin nani, ka kye ondu wɛɛsɛ yi ama dafi ongwu ka kye iYesu gya mani. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>I kpaa ma nɛta a gbela onun awuya. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>O gbela, dile pita ofɛ ngwi ongwu ka kye iYesu gya yi ama onɔ ngwi ibyi inggisɛ ka dzɛyan ba mani.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ungwogye mgbi iYesu ongwi olɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Egbe ibredi ngwi a kye okwuna wele ba ma gyɔ, ngwi a ka ngwɔ ongwummala mgbi oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>IYesu dɔ iPyita bɛyi iJɔn esɔ, gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Lu na ka wewo oga ongwi eyi ka gye yi eweyi mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>A byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li mi ole ngwi mina abu gbɛɛ ni eyi ka wewo oga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>IYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dafi ema kaka ogalu mata, inggisɛ nkye ishe eni ka kpatsɛ ema. Kyɛdɔn ka kaka udɛ ngwi o ka kaka mani, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>di nya otsungwudɛ na gbɛɛ, &lt;Otsetse byita gbɛɛ: Ozu ingyoga kɔ, ngwi ani ka wa gye oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi bɛyi engwafɛɛn?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Ta o ka tso ema ifoozu ogbada-gbada ongwi esho, bɛyi okye duu mi ele. Kye mɛlu imbe mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>A si lu ka di alungwɔ duu yɛyɛ dafi iYesu teyi nya ma mani. Ta a wewo oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi mi ele.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Ngwi obyi ma wa gyɔ nɛ, iYesu bɛyi ama ogbikyon sisɛ ogye oga. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Man o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N mina kpakpa ogye oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi nɛ yi ema duuse nin wa gyadzɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>N le nya ema, ani ka gye oga nɛ wuba, nghataa sede ongwi a ka wa gye mi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Onɔ ngwi o kyi kyelu ibwɛ mgbi eneekwɔ nɛ, o ta Imgbasho angba si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbɛ wa yi ewema na. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Bana n nya ema, n ka yama wa eneekwɔ mgbi ekwɔ onaana nɛ wuba nghataa esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho ka wa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Ta o kyi kyelu ibredi di ta Imgbasho angba kye mwalu, yilen kye nu ma, gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ikpewo mgbi ani ngwi a kye nu ikye ema; kyungwɔnɛ ikye ole wɛ ani na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Mi itɔ ofɛ na kpɔɔ, ngwi a gye ungwogye ngyɛ nɛ, o kyi kyelu ibwɛ, gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ibwɛ mgbi ondu odzɛɛdzɛ ofufɛ yi eyi mgbi ani ngwi a kye kyi ikye ema. <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Nghaduu abɔ mgbi inggisɛ nle pita ani ikye ma, wo le gye ungwogye mmɛnɛ yi ani. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Bana Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka kwulu kyɛmɛ-kyɛmɛ dafi a lɔ ikyon mani, kpaa ahoo mi ikye inggisɛ nkye Ongwɛ Inggisɛ gya mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>A wita obyi ewoma ita ongwu nka kyɔ itɔ ungwɔnɛ mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama mani.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Angwodzɛ di tɔ mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama gbɛɛ li emɛ mbi ama shewo ngha. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>IYesu si nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Utɔ mgbi Udzengye mi ɛsɛ nɛ li si emidama; man ama ogbe inggisɛ teyi ntona di li yɛ gbɛɛ ama li abuge mgbi ali inggisɛ duu. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Kpaa mbi ema no ka dzɛ ngha ba. Nghaduu ongwu nshewo ngha mi idzidzɛ ema ma non yile ewon esɛ yɛɛ dafi ongbɛ ogyɛngyɛ mani, ongwu ngbe inggisɛ teyi ma no yɛɛ dafi ongbidɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Bana li emɛ le kpɔngɔ ngha? Inggisɛ ngwu sɔɔsɔ ma naadi, ongwu nle kyidɔ ma? Ongwu nsɔɔsɔ na ngha! Ani dzɛ mi idzidzɛ ema dafi ongbidɔ mani. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Ema li ama nfyi ani anya mi onɔ imbadi mgbi ani. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>N di kye esutɔ nu ema, dafi Otsani kye nu ani mani, <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>ikyegbɛɛ ni ema gye di wa mi imbe ungwogye mgbi ani mi esutɔ mgbi ani di sɔkɛ itsuutɔ, le gbɔ agwɔ mgbi Israi iwyodefa ikwɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>&lt;&lt;ISaimɔn, iSaimɔn, iSatan pita ofɛ owa kye kwɔɔlu ema dafi a li kwɔɔ ekwu mi okwuga nɛni. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Kpaa ani bibɔ mi ikye abu, iSaimɔn, gbɛɛ ni oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi abu ka yɛyikpa ba. Ma onɔ ngwi abu kyata yɛ luba yɔ, fyi emi engwunabu mfye itukwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Nghaduu iPyita nun uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ani wewo okaka obawi diyɛ kwulu yi abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>IYesu nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N nya abu, iPyita, inɛ nɛni ogbigbi ka teela waba ta abu ka tangwɛ ani akpe eta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>IYesu di byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɔ ngwi ani dɔ ema esɔ yi ashiko ba, igbe hona okpafɔ ba ma, ungwɔ kwo ema obaa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkonyi kwo eyi oba ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nghaduu onɛnɛ ni ema dzɛ yi ashiko yɔ, kye, bɛyi igbe kpaa; ma kini ema dzɛ yi okwusunkli bayɔ, kye angwuto mgbi ema gya yɛ gya onyi na. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Afɛ lɔ gbɛɛ: &lt;A gbɔn mmbwo wokɛ yi ama ofoola&gt;; n di nya ema gbɛɛ ungwɔnɛ ka mbwumbwo mbi ani kyɛmɛ. Ɛɛn, ungwɔ ngwi a lɔ mi ikpewo ani na le kɛ ombwumbwo wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Engwafɔɔn si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Di, Otsɛ, okwusunkli efa to mmɛnɛ na.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">IYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;I gyɔ ngha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu bibɔ mi Unggwɔ Olivi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>IYesu tasɛ dafi o li teyi kyɔ mani lu mi Unggwɔ Olivi, nɛ engwafɔɔn kyɛdɔn. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Ngwi o ka kaka imbe na nɛ, o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Bibɔ na adzi ni ema ka gbɛsɛ mi igyila ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>O gblekɛ gwee dzata ma, o gbe akwafɔ kwɛsɛ si bibɔ gbɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>&lt;&lt;Otsɛn, ni li oweka mgbi abu yɔ, kyi kyelu ibwɛ adzɛ nɛ mbi ani; nghaduu ka kyɔ mi oweka mgbi ani ba, kpaa kyɔ mi oweka mgbi abu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Man ongyesɔ mi esho mblegba tun di fyonfye itukwu. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Ngwi o kaka isɔ kpakpa nɛ, o bibɔ mi itukwu onyi, man andzɛ mgban kyata yɛɛ dafi eyi mani le wulɔ kyikɛ esɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Onɔ ngwi o kyato mi ibɔ nɛ, o wa tu engwafɔɔn tole nuna ikyekyɛ a kyelela ndɛngyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>O byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi ema le nuna? Kyato bibɔ na ikyegbɛɛ ni ema ka gbɛsɛ mi igyila ba mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A bwa iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Ngwi iYesu kale gbɔdzɛ nɛ, ibyi inggisɛ wa kaka, ta inggisɛ ngwu a li kwun di iJuda, nli onyi mbi emi iwyodefa, teyi ma. O ba kwɛkwɛ wa kye ondu kwo iYesu ataka, <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>nghaduu iYesu byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IJuda, li mi ondu okwo ataka ngwi abu ka kye Ongwɛ Inggisɛ gyaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Ngwi ama nkyɛdɔ iYesu di dafi ungwɔ ka wa kyɔ nɛ, a gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsɛ, ni eyi gblibe yi okwusunkli mgbi eyii?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Onyi mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama kyi kwɔdzɛ adɔ abugye mgbi ongbidɔ mgbi okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Kpaa iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;I gyɔ ngha!&gt;&gt; Man o si yile inggisɛ na adɔ bɛkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Nɛta iYesu nya engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ama nle ngyo mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin bɛyi engyukwo emi iJuda, ama nba mbon na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛse, ngwi ema ba mbi ani yi okwusunkli bɛyi okwuta dafi ani li inggisɛ ofofɛ nghaa? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Alegbe ani li dzɛ yi ema mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin, kpaa ema bwa ani ba. Nghaduu nɛnɛ li onɔ mgbi ema ngwi iyifu sɔ utɔ aani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IPyita tangwɛ iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Nghanɛ a bwa iYesu, a kyon lu udɛ mgbi okwukwo inggisɛ ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho. IPyita kyɛ ma iyikpa mbombo. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>A kye ola wo ifyɛ le wɛ, iPyita kpaa sɔ le wɛ yi ama. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Ongwongyiidɔ din dafi o sɔdzɛ le wola nɛ, o din inɛ si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nɛ kpaa dzɛ yi iYesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Nghaduu o tangwɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyaa, ani yama yen ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Ngwi onɔ kɛ gwee nɛ, inggisɛ oka di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu kpaa li onyi mboma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">IPyita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyulɔ, li ani ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>I mɛ dafi obyi onyi sini ta inggisɛ oka biibɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsitsi inggisɛ nɛ li kyɛ yan, bana o li inggisɛ iGalalia.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Nɛ iPyita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nɛ, ani yama ye ungwɔ ngwi abu le gbɔ na ba!&gt;&gt; Labɔlabɔ ngwi o kale gbɔdzɛ nɛta, ogbigbi teela. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Otsɛ iYesu si kyata inɛ byi iPyita yɛyɛ. Man iPyita wɛ odzɛ ngwi iYesu gbɔ yan mani gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Duuse ni ogbigbi wa teela mi otu inɛ nɛni, abu ka tangwɛ ani akpe eta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Man iPyita tasɛ lu esɛ ka tsukwu kpakpa.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Ama nle ngyo iYesu ma wita onyan agya dile gbon ibe. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>A kye ungwɔ bwan inɛ di byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Yegbɔ ka! Li emɛ kye ungwɔ gbo abu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>A di gbɔ agya angbeka kwuba nyan.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A kye iYesu ba inai iPlatu <optbreak/> bɛyi iHerude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Ngwi egbe wa fa nɛ, okwakye mgbi engyukwo emi iJuda, ngwi engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho yi etsetse mgbi ola ba wa kwakye nɛ, a kye iYesu kɛ mboma. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni abu li iKrestu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:67 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ongwu Imgbasho zondu gbɛɛ o ka wa dulu ɛsɛ watɔ ma mani. </char></note> mayɔ, nya eyi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">IYesu nu ma uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni ani nya ema kpaa ema ka nu ani oyɛyɛ ba, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>ma ni ani byi ema ita kpaa ema ka yagba onu ani uka ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Nghaduu i wita mi onɛnɛ lu iyayi, Ongwɛ Inggisɛ ka sɔ mi abugye mgbi Imgbasho Ongha yi mfye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Ama duu byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li abu nɛ li Ongwɛ Imgbashoo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema gbɛɛ ani li ongwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Ta a di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔnɛ ngwi eyi di mina obwɛndɛ angbeka? Bana eyi abueyi fwo mi ondun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">A kye iYesu ba iyayi iPlatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Ta ibyi inggisɛ ama nkwakye duu kyato kye iYesu kɛ mbi iPlatu iGɔna mgbi emi iRoma. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>A le mwonya odzɛ ban gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eyi tu inggisɛ nɛ le nu emideyi boofɛ. O di fwa gbɛɛ nu ma ka kpa udza ifyɛɛ nu iSidza ba. O di gbɛɛ ongwu li iKrestu, Utɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Nɛ iPlatu byi iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li utɔ mgbi emi iJudaa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">IYesu nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɛɛn, li ngha dafi abu gbɔ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>IPlatu si diyɛ nya engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ibyi inggisɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N di inggisɛ nɛ yi obube ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Kpaa a nghao biibɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O le tsungwɔ di ba yi okakewo mi ali imbe duu mi iJudia. O wita mi iGalalia ba wa kaka iJudia mmɛnɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Dafi iPlatu fwo odzɛ nɛ nɛ, o byita kini iYesu li inggisɛ iGalalia yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Ngwi o ye gbɛɛ iYesu kyɛ mi iGalalia imbe ngwi iHerude li utɔ nɛ, o kyon dɛsɔ lu mbi iHerude, ongwu nose kpaa baaba dzɛ iJerosalin mi onɔ nani.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Ngwi iHerude di iYesu nɛ, i kpan kpakpa, bana onɔ kɛ ngwi o le mina odin. Mi odzɛ mgban ngwi o fwo ma, i minan odin no kyungwɔ okwulewo ngwi o le kyɔ mani. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Nɛ iHerude byi iYesu ita kwuba, nghaduu o nun uka ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Nɛta engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ama otso ola mgbi iMose kyatunto si mwonya odzɛ ban mi ali itɔ ali ibwubwe duu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Ta iHerude bɛyi eblakwutsɛ mgban nya iYesu odzɛ agya diyɛ shan isha ikwangha. A kye angwuto utɔ okwɔkwɔ won ewo, yilen lu ka nu iPlatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Egbe na iHerude yi iPlatu yɛɛ uka, bana a tsekise dzɛ mi ikyili yi ewoma.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>IPlatu si kwu engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho yi ama ogbe inggisɛ teyi bɛyi ibyi inggisɛ kwakye, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>si nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema kye inggisɛ nɛ ba mbi ani gbɛɛ li ongwu le wɛ ibyi inggisɛ odzɛ gbɛɛ nu ma kyɔ odzɛ oshiishi. Ani kya mi inɛ mgbi ema nghaduu, n din yi ungwɔ ngwi ema le dulu ongwufabɔ mbon na ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>IHerude kpa tun yi obube ba, bana o yilen dɛsɔ ba wa nu eyi; dafi ema di nɛ, inggisɛ nɛ kyɔ unkonyi mɛ ngwi o ka kwulu ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Nghanɛ, n ka nu ma gbon ibe ta dzanta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>(IPlatu gbɔ ngha ikyesinɛ mi onɔ oga owɛ owatɔ-watɔ mgbi emi Israi ma, li wogyɔ gbɛɛ o ka dulu onyi mbi ama nwoto obawi ikye emi iJuda.)<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>A si feela ondonyi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngwɔlu inggisɛ nɛni! Dzata iBaraba nu eyi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>(IBaraba wodzɛ obawi ikyegbɛɛ o kyɔ ablodzɛ mi igeli di ngwɔ inggisɛ.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Dafi iPlatu mina odzata iYesu nɛ, o di gbɔdzɛ yi ama. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Nghaduu a kiyayi yi ela ofaafa gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbokwon! Ngwɔlun!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>IPlatu gbɔ yi ama akpe ongwu ta ma gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Mi ekyɛ? Li ali alobube ngwi o kyɔ? Ani tun yi obube mɛ onon kwulu ba. Nghanɛ n ka nu ma gbon ibe ta dzanta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Kpaa a kiyayi ofeela gbɛɛ nu ma ngwɔn, man ela mgbi ama nghan. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Nɛ iPlatu yɛ gbela yi owitukwu mgbi ama. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>O dulu inggisɛ nwodzɛ obawi ikyegbɛɛ o kyɔ ablodzɛ di ngwɔ inggisɛ, ongwu ibyi inggisɛ ntona mina mani, di dzata iYesu nu ma dafi a mina mani.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A gbokwo iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Dafi ama oblakwutsɛ kye iYesu le lu nɛ, a bwa iSaimɔn inggisɛ mi iSirini, ongwu tɔkyɛ mi okwɔ le kaka igeli nani, man a bwan kye ekwatsi mgbi iYesu nun gbɛɛ no kye kyɛdɔn. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Ibyi inggisɛ kyɛ ma iyikpa, bɛyi engyaa ama nle kyelela dile tsukwu won. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Kpaa iYesu kyata inɛ di ma si gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Engwengyaa emi iJerosalin, ka tsukwu ikye ani ba; tsukwu ikye ewema bɛyi ɛngbɛ mgbi ema na. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Bana onɔ kyɛma ngwi ema ka gbɛɛ, &lt;Mse dzɛ yi engyaa ama nli ogyoma, ifu nmbongwɛ ba yi abɛ ngwi a nghaan ye waba mani!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Ta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt; &lt;A ka gbɔ yi unggwɔ ntonɛ gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt;Yulu tukwu eyi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">Bɛyi undɔ ntonɛ gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt;Gbobu tukwu eyi!&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Bana ni inggisɛ kyungwɔ ntonɛ mi onɔ ngwi ekwɔ li eyuyu waali, ni ekwɔ wa ngwɔ ma ka dzɛ sinɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Ama ofofɛ nghi efa angbeka kpaa a kye ma tɔ owa ngwɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Ngwi a ba imbe ngwi a li kwun di dingbo nɛ, a kyon gbokwo ekwatsi, ama ofofɛ ntona kpaa a kye ma gbokwo ekwatsi, onyi mi abugye yi oka mi abubɛ mgban. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Nɛ iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsani, dzamata, bana a ye ungwɔ ngwi a le kyɔ ba.&gt;&gt; Man a kyen angwuto kye ghalu mi efa ogboogbo.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Inggisɛ ibyibyi kwuto le di; nghaduu ama ogbe inggisɛ teyi tole nyan agya gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;O li dulu angbeka watɔ; non dulu ewon tɔ ki non li iKrestu mgbi Imgbasho, ongwu Imgbasho dulu gbɛɛ o ka wa dulu ɛsɛ watɔ ma yɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Ama oblakwutsɛ kpaa ba wa fan ɛsɛ. A kye eneekwɔ omama kye nun <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini abu li utɔ mgbi emi iJuda yɔ, dulu ewabu tɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>A lɔ ambɛ bɛkɛ ekwatsi mi ikye mgban gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li Utɔ mgbi emi iJuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Onyi mbi ama ofofɛ ngwu a gbokwo ma yan nyan agya gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Abu li iKrestu ma baa? Dulu ewabu tɔ bɛyi eyi lɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Nghaduu oka na kyɔkyɔ yan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu li mio Imgbasho lo, bana abu kpaa dzɛ mi odzili-dzili nɛni? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Eyi yɔ, eyi le gbiisɔ ayin, bana eyi tu ungwɔ nmɛ mi ali ibwubwe ngwi eyi kyɔ. Kpaa inggisɛ nɛ yama kyɔ unkonyi obube ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Ta o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;IYesu, wɛ ani mi onɔ ngwi abu kaka esutɔ mgbi abu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>IYesu si nyan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsitsi n nya abu, inɛ nɛ abu ka dzɛ yi ani mi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikwu iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Ta ngwi onɔ dɔ idzidzɛ udɛ nɛ, ɛsɛ duu yifu nghataa obyi eta ongwi onɔdɛ, <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>bana onɔ tsɛ wuba. Man angwuto ngwi a kye tsɛ onufɛ idzidzɛ ozu osaan mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin na si gbua efa. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Ta iYesu makwɔ mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsani, n kye onodzi mgbi ani wokɛ abɔ mgbi abu.&gt;&gt; Ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ mata, o si yulu.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Dafi ongyukwo mgbi ama oblakwutsɛ mgbi iRoma di ungwɔ nkyɔ nɛ, o tsɛ Imgbasho di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Otsitsi inggisɛ nɛ le saan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Ngwi ibyi inggisɛ ama nkwakye odi ungwɔ nle kiyayi di ungwɔ nkyɔ nɛ, eka kwowina loma ta a lu. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Nghaduu emi odon duu, bɛyi engyaa ama nkyɛdɔn mi iGalalia kwulɛsɛ fyata le di ungwɔ ntonɛni.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ondziindzi mgbi iYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Mi onɔ na inggisɛ oka dzɛ ngwu a li kwun di iJose, ongwu li onyi mbi ama odi mi ola mgbi emi iJuda, o li inggisɛ osuse dile saan kpaa, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>ongwu gbela yi owitukwu bɛyi okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi emidan ama odi mi ola mi ikye iYesu na ba. O li inggisɛ mi ogalu Arimatia ayɛsɛ mgbi iJudia o dile fɛ obaaba mgbi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Inggisɛ nɛ kɛ mbi iPlatu ka bɔn ikwɔ mgbi iYesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Ta o kye sulu ikwɔ mgbi iYesu ba esɛ, o si kye angwuto onzundzɛ ndiwon kyon ka ndzi mi endzi ngwi a cɛfo mi ikwutsɛ, ongwi a teyi kye ikwɔ ndzi mi ele ye waba mani. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Ungwɔnɛ kyɔ egbe idɔ eda mi onɔdɛ, ngwi a le wewo ikye egbe otonyewo.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Engyaa ama nwafɔ yi iYesu mi iGalalia ntona kyɛdɔ iJose wa di endzi di di dafi a kyon ka ndzi mi ele mani. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Nɛ a yɛ lu ka mɛ ungwɔ ogbungbɛ yi engyie ngwi a ka kye gyuon ewo. Nghaduu a tonya mi egbe otonyewo dafi ola mgbi ama gbɔ mani.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Okyɛɛ-kyɛɛ mi ikwongye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Mi egbe ongwi ababɔ mi ikyidu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:1</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Egbe ongwi ababɔ mi ikyidu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbi emi iJuda yɔ, li egbe iLadi.</char></note>, mi egbegbe byibyiibyi, engyaa ntona kye ungwɔ ogbungbɛ yi engyie ngwi a mɛ ma, kɛ endzi. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>A kɛ ka di a kyi mulu ikwutsɛ ma mi ondendzi, <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Ngwi a kaka ele nɛ, a tu ikwɔ mgbi Otsɛ iYesu ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Dafi a le tsɛwɛ mi ele nɛ, vla nɛta engyulɔ nghi efa kwulɛsɛ kwɛkwɛ yi ama, wo angwuto onzundzɛ dafi mmbwo onaabɔ mani. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Imio wo engyaa ntona ta a si kye inɛ kwɛsɛ, engyulɔ ntona nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔnɛ ngwi ema le pita inggisɛ oshishe mi imbe emi ikwukwɔ? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>O dzɛ mmɛnɛ ba; o kyɛɛ mi ikwu! Wɛ dafi o tsekise nya ema, ngwi o ka dzɛ yi ema mi iGalalia mani gbɛɛ: <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>&lt;A ka kye Ongwɛ Inggisɛ wo emi ali ibwubwe abɔ kyɛmɛ, a ka gbokwon mi ekwatsi nghataa o ka kwulu, kpaa mi egbe ongwu ta ma o ka kyɛɛ mi ikwu.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Ta engyaa ntona wɛ elodzɛ mgban.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Ngwi a yɛ mi endzi luba nɛ, a kye ungwɔ ntonɛ duu kye nya ama ogbikye iYesu iwyodonyi ntonani bɛyi angbeka duu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Li iMeri iMagidalin yi iJoana bɛyi iMeri onɔ iJɛnsi, bɛyi angbeka nto yi ama, nya ama ogbikye iYesu odzɛ nɛni. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Nghaduu ama ogbikye iYesu nu engyaa ntona oyɛyɛ ba, ikyekyɛ elodzɛ mgbi ama dzɛ dafi li odzɛ ikwangha mani. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Nɛ iPyita kyato tsinya lu mi endzi. O ka klɛsɛ di mi idzidzɛ endzi man di angwuto ngwi a kye ikwɔ mgbi iYesu ndiwo ma lato yuoma, ta o si yɛ lu, le tsɛwɛ yuon ungwɔ nkyɔ nani.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mi ofɛ okɛ Emau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Nɛ mi egbe nata ama okyɛdɔ iYesu efa le kɛ agwɔ oka ngwi a li kwun di Emau, ngwi mɛ dafi imai egyafa sini okyɛɛ kɛ iJerosalin. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>A le kponya yi ewoma mi ungwɔ ama nkyɔ duu. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Dafi a le gbɔdzɛ dile kponya mi ungwɔ ntonɛ yi ewoma nɛ, iYesu abuon ba wa wafɔ yi ama; <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>kpaa a tukwu ma inɛ odifwin.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Nɛ iYesu byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li ekyɛ ngwi ema le gbɔ le kɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">A kwulɛsɛ, a shɛ inɛ ta ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Onyi mbi ama efa na, ongwu a li kwun di iKlopa, byun gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li abu ta li ingyoga mi iJerosalin ngwu ye ungwɔ ama nkyɔ mi egbe ntonɛ ba dɛɛn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Nghaduu iYesu byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li alungwɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">A gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li odzɛ mgbi iYesu inggisɛ ongwi iNadzareti. O li oyegbɔ, elodzɛ mgban dzɛ yi mfye bɛyi okyɔɔkyɔ mi inai Imgbasho yi inggisɛ duu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Engyukwo ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ama ogbe eyi teyi kyon nu ama ndzɛ yi mfye nu ma ngwɔn ikwɔ ikwongye, di kyon gbokwo mi ekwatsi; <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Ma eyi gbekabyi gbɛɛ o li ongwu nkyɛ owa dulu emi Israi watɔ mani. Ma li ekyɛ oka, nghaduu li egbe ongwu ta inɛ ngwi ungwɔ ntonɛ kyɔ waani. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Nghanɛ, engyaa angbeka mi idzidzɛ mgbi eyi kyungwɔ okwulu eyi ewo. A kɛ endzi mi egbegbe ototu nɛni, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>kpaa yama tu ikwɔ mgban ba. A yɛ ba wa nya eyi gbɛɛ di ama di inɛ odiidi mgbi engyesɔ, ngwu nya ma gbɛɛ o dzɛ oshishe. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Nɛ emideyi angbeka kɛ endzi ka di dafi engyaa ntona tsekise gbɔ mani, nghaduu ongwu yɔ a din ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Ta iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔnɛ ema li ikwangha ngha, di kyɔnɛ ngwi ema kyɔ itukwu lɔɔ onoyɛyɛ mi alungwɔ ngwi ama ogbɛɛsɛ gbɔ dzɛ esɛ ngha? <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Dzɛ mbisɔ ngwi iKrestu ma ka gbiisɔ mi ungwɔ ntonɛ diyɛ kaka udɛ mgban okwɔkwɔ mi esho baa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>O si nu ma osa mi ungwɔ ngwi Afɛ gbɔ mi ikye ongwu, wita mbi iMose bɛyi oyegbɔ angbeka duu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Dafi a dzɛ kwɛkwɛ okaka agwɔ ngwi a le kɛ ma nɛ, iYesu kyɔ dafi o ka nyɛ lu iyayi mani. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Nghaduu a tɛkyɛ yan kpakpa gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;dzɛ yi eyi, bana onɔ dzɛ kwɛkwɛ ogbɛsɛ egbe inɛ nɛ kpaa le ngyɛ wa.&gt;&gt; Man iYesu kaka ikye oka dzɛ yi ama.<verse eid="LUK 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Ngwi o sɔkɛ ogye ungwogye yi ama nɛ, o kyi kyelu ibredi, kye mse bɛ ele, kye mwalu si kye nu ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Ta inɛ mgbi ama kwulu a si difwin, man o byulu wo ma inɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Engwafɔ ntona byi ewoma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngwi o le gbɔdzɛ yi eyi mi ofɛ le kɛ dile nu eyi osa mi ungwɔ ngwi Afɛ gbɔ ma, itukwu gbɛɛgbɛ lo eyi baa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>A si kyato akponyi yɛ luba iJerosalin. A wa tu iwyodonyi ntona bɛyi angbeka kwakye to imbe nani <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li otsitsi! Otsɛ iYesu kyɛɛ mi ikwu, o di mblegba tu iSaimɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Ta ama okyɛdɔ iYesu efa ntona nya ma ungwɔ ngwi kyɔ mi ofɛ, dafi ama di difwi iYesu mi onɔ ngwi o kye mwalu ibredi mani.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu mblegba tu engwafɔ mgban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Mi onɔ ngwi a kale gbɔdzɛ mi ikye ungwɔnɛ nɛ, iYesu abuon kwudzɛ mi idzidzɛ mgbi ama di gbɔ yi ama gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyu no dzɛ yi ema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Nɛ i kwulu ma ewo imio di wo ma kpakpa, a le tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ ama di onodzi inggisɛ ikwukwɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Ta iYesu nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi i le kaka ema ewo, ngwi itukwu di dzɛ ema efefa ngha? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Di abɔ yi afɔ mgbi ani na. Li ani abuen! Ema kye abɔ gbo ani di; bana onodzi inggisɛ ikwukwɔ dzɛ yi ikpewo yi akpukpu dafi ema di ani dzɛyan nɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Ngwi o gbɔdzɛ nɛ mata, o kye abɔ yi afɔ mgban tso ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Dafi a kale noyɛyɛ mi ele ba ikye gbɛɛ i kwulu ma ewo a di dzɛ yi atsa nɛ, o byi ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ema dzɛ yi ungwɔ ogyeegye mmɛnɛ wɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>A si kye ambulu mmbweni oshaasha yi ikpɔkpewo nun, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>man o kye gye mi inai ma.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>O nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ungwɔ ngwi ani nya ema onɔ ngwi ani ka dzɛ yi ema mani: Alungwɔ ngwi a lɔ mi ola mgbi iMose bɛyi olɔɔlɔ mgbi ama ogbɛɛsɛ yi iPaslami duu mbwumbwo kyɛmɛ mi ikpewo ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Nɛ o kwulu ma itukwu onu ma difwi Afɛ mgbi Imgbasho, <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>o nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Nɛnɛ li ungwɔ ngwi a lɔ ma aani: iKrestu ma ka gyadzɛ di kwulu di kyɛɛ mi ikwu mi egbe ongwu ta, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>nɛ a kale gbeesɔ mgbi itukwu okyata-kyata bɛyi odzata inggisɛ yi ali ibwubwe mi iyi mgban mi ɛsɛ duu, wita mi iJerosalin. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Ema li obwɛndɛ mi ungwɔ ntonɛni. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Ani ka kye ungwɔ ngwi Otsani Imgbasho zondu ma kye dɛsɔ nu ema; kpaa tila to ogalu iJerosalin na nghataa ni Imgbasho wa kye mfye mi esho nu ema se.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu yɛ lu esho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Onɔ ngwi iYesu gbe engwafɔɔn tasɛ lu iBetani nɛ, o kyile abɔ esho di kye mse bɛ ma ewo. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Ngwi o kye mse le bɛ ma ewo nɛ, o dzata ma ta a si kyon lu esho.<figure style="fig" alt="IYesu yɛ lu esho" file="CN01883B.TIF" size="col" loc="24;51" copy="Cn01883B" ref="24:51">Ascension</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Ta a sunun diyɛ luba iJerosalin yi atsa kpakpa. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Nɛ a kiyayi otsɛ Imgbasho mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin, alegbe-alegbe.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
